== 制片 ==
=== 开发 ===
2023年4月，据报道{{tsl|en|Radio Silence Productions|电波静默制片公司}}将为[[环球影业]]开发一部怪物惊悚片，由[[麦特·贝提内里-欧平]]和{{tsl|en|Tyler Gillett|泰勒·吉列特}}担任导演，{{tsl|en|Chad Villella|查德·维莱拉}}与X计划于乐的威廉·谢拉克（William Sherak）、保罗·奈因斯坦（Paul Neinstein）和[[詹姆斯·范德比尔特]]担任制片人，斯蒂芬·希尔兹（Stephen Shields）和{{tsl|en|Guy Busick|盖·布西克}}负责编剧。该项目是对[[环球怪物]]系列电影角色的现代改编，形式类似于2020年的《[[隐形人 (2020年电影)|隐形人]]》和2023年的《[[吸血鬼特助：雷菲尔]]》。电影剧情被形容为“对经典怪物传说的独特呈现，用全新的方向来纪念经典的银幕角色”。电影原计划为贝蒂内利-奥尔平在《[[惊声尖叫 (2022年电影)|惊声尖叫5]]》后的下一部作品，但贝蒂内利-奥尔本和吉列特在完成《惊声尖叫5》后又拍摄了《[[惊声尖叫6]]》，因而推迟了本片的制作<ref name="Developement_Deadline">{{cite web |last1=Kroll |first1=Justin |title='Scream' Filmmaking Team Radio Silence Reunites With Project X On Untitled Monster Movie At Universal |url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/scream-radio-silence-untitled-monster-movie-universal-1235321476/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-04-11 |date=2023-04-11 |archive-date=2023-04-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230411172256/https://deadline.com/2023/04/scream-radio-silence-untitled-monster-movie-universal-1235321476/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

后续消息指电影原名《德古拉的女儿》（''Dracula's Daughter''），沿用了1936年{{tsl|en|Dracula's Daughter|德古拉的女儿|同名电影}}，也就是本片蓝本的片名<ref name="WeirCast" />。不过环球影业表示，他们之前的确想将《[[神鬼传奇 (2017年电影)|神鬼传奇]]》开发成[[共同世界|一个宇宙]]，现在已经改变方向，每部作品继续“根植于恐怖片类型，同时不设预算、评级或类型上的限制”，不处在同一个宇宙，而是有各自的世界。这个全新的方向由电影制作人来把控，但凡有对角色有自己想法的导演都可以参与到剧情的开发中，可以向环球影业递交剧本提纲<ref name="BarreraCast" /><ref name="WeirCast" /><ref name="StevensCast" /><ref name="DurandCast" />。在这个理念的带动下，电影于2024年1月定名为《噬血芭蕾》<ref name="Abigail_Deadline">{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Universal's Melissa Barrera & Angus Cloud Monster Thriller From Radio Silence Gets Title & Trailer |url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/radio-silence-abigail-universal-monster-movie-1235716719/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |publisher=[[Penske Media Corporation]] |access-date=2024-01-11 |date=2024-01-11 |archive-date=2024-01-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240111190532/https://deadline.com/2024/01/radio-silence-abigail-universal-monster-movie-1235716719/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

=== 选角 ===
2023年4月，曾在[[惊声尖叫系列]]中担任主角的{{tsl|en|Melissa Barrera|梅莉莎·巴雷拉}}加盟剧组<ref name="BarreraCast" />。次月，[[丹·史蒂文斯]]、[[凯文·杜兰]]、{{tsl|en|Alisha Weir|艾莉莎·威尔}}、[[凯瑟琳·纽顿]]、[[安格斯·克劳德]]和威廉·谢拉克（William Sherak）宣布加盟<ref name="StevensCast" /><ref name="DurandCast" /><ref name="WeirCast" /><ref name="UniversalMonster2024" />。2023年6月，[[吉安卡洛·伊坡托]]宣布参演配角<ref name="EspositoCast" />。曾在{{tsl|en|Matilda the Musical (film)|玛蒂尔达：音乐剧}}中扮演主角{{tsl|en|Matilda Wormwood|玛蒂尔达·沃姆伍德}}的艾莉莎·威尔将出演德古拉的女儿<ref name="DraculaDaughter_THR">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/monster-movie-from-scream-directors-trailer-1235785611/|work=The Hollywood Reporter|title=Monster Movie from 'Scream' Directors Gets Title, Trailer|author=Couch, Aaron|quote=Sources previously told The Hollywood Reporter that the child is the daughter of Dracula.|date=2024-01-11|accessdate=2024-01-11|archive-date=2024-01-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240111170654/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/monster-movie-from-scream-directors-trailer-1235785611/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

===拍摄===
[[主体拍摄]]于2023年6月30日在爱尔兰[[都柏林]]启动,<ref>{{Cite web|last=Geisinger|first=Gabriella|date=2023-06-23|title=Dan Stevens, Melissa Barrera monster thriller filming in Dublin|url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/06/23/dan-stevens-melissa-barrera-monster-thriller-filming-in-dublin|access-date=2023-06-23|website={{tsl|en|Kemps Film and TV Production Services Handbook||Kemps Film and TV Production Services Handbook}}|archive-date=2023-06-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230623150406/https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/06/23/dan-stevens-melissa-barrera-monster-thriller-filming-in-dublin|url-status=live}}</ref>，暂定名称《绑架艾碧嘉》（''Abducting Abigail''）<ref>{{cite web|url=https://productionlist.com/production/abducting-abigail/|title=Abducting Abigail|work=Production List|publisher=Film & Television Industry Alliance|date=2023-05-01|access-date=2023-05-01|archive-date=2023-10-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231030015019/https://productionlist.com/production/abducting-abigail/|url-status=live}}</ref>。受[[2023年美国演员工会大罢工]]影响，拍摄工作于同年7月暂停<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/|title=Here Are All The Movies Affected by the SAG-AFTRA Strike From 'Deadpool 3' to 'Mission: Impossible 8' (Photos)|work=[[TheWrap]]|last=Gonzalez|first=Umberto|date=2023-07-13|access-date=2023-07-13|archive-date=2023-07-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230714014112/https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/|url-status=live}}</ref>。亚伦·莫顿（Aaron Morton）担任本片的摄影<ref>{{Cite web |title=Aaron Morton Resume |url=https://www.murthaskouras.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Morton-Aaron.pdf |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240129201216/https://www.murthaskouras.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Morton-Aaron.pdf |archive-date=2024-01-29 |access-date=2024-01-29 |agency=Murtha Skouras Agency}}</ref>。2023年7月31日，电影主演[[安格斯·克劳德]]猝死，他在片中的戏份已经拍摄完成<ref>{{Cite web |last=Vlessing |first=Etan |date=2023-08-01 |title=Angus Cloud Completed Filming on Two Upcoming Films |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angus-cloud-your-lucky-day-horror-1235548542/ |access-date=2023-08-01 |website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2023-08-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230801150540/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angus-cloud-your-lucky-day-horror-1235548542/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年12月15日，电影杀青<ref name="wrap">{{Cite web |last=Echebiri |first=Makuochi |date=2023-12-18 |title=Universal Monster Thriller From Radio Silence Wraps Filming |url=https://collider.com/universal-monster-movie-wrapped-filming-radio-silence/ |access-date=2023-12-18 |website=[[Collider|Collider]] |archive-date=2023-12-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231223215301/https://collider.com/universal-monster-movie-wrapped-filming-radio-silence/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

===音乐===
长期与贝蒂内利-奥尔平和吉列特的[[布莱恩·泰勒]]负责配乐创作<ref>{{cite web|url=http://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/01/11/brian-tyler-to-reteam-with-matt-bettinelli-olpin-tyler-gillett-on-abigail/|title=Brian Tyler to Reteam with Matt Bettinelli-Olpin & Tyler Gillett on 'Abigail'|work=Film Music Reporter|date=2024-01-11|access-date=2024-01-12|archive-date=2024-01-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240112024545/https://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/01/11/brian-tyler-to-reteam-with-matt-bettinelli-olpin-tyler-gillett-on-abigail/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
电影于2024年4月7日在{{tsl|en|Overlook Film Festival|俯瞰电影节}}上映<ref>{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2024-03-06 |title=Universal Vampire Flick ''Abigail'' Set To Close Out Overlook Film Festival – View Full Lineup |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/abigail-set-to-close-overlook-film-festival-full-lineup-1235846717/ |access-date=2024-03-13 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2024-04-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240414225035/https://deadline.com/2024/03/abigail-set-to-close-overlook-film-festival-full-lineup-1235846717/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，同年4月19日在美国上映，[[环球影业]]负责发行<ref name="UniversalMonster2024" />。

