==制作==
2022年12月，消息指[[赵约翰]]和[[凯萨琳·华特斯顿]]将出演[[克里斯·魏兹]]执导、编剧的恐怖片《他们听着》（''They Listen''）。电影由维兹的制片公司Depth of Field制片，[[布伦屋制片公司]]和[[索尼影视娱乐]]联合制片，制片人还包括[[杰森·布伦]]和安德鲁·米亚诺<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/12/john-cho-katherine-waterston-they-listen-blumhouse-movie-1235201274|title=John Cho & Katherine Waterston To Star In Sony-Blumhouse's 'They Listen', Horror Pic To Hit Cinemas Late Summer|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2022-12-16|access-date=2023-02-13|archive-date=2024-07-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240711182209/https://deadline.com/2022/12/john-cho-katherine-waterston-they-listen-blumhouse-movie-1235201274/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年2月，格雷格·希尔<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/they-listen-blumhouse-greg-hill-1235255993|title='They Listen': Greg Hill Joins John Cho, Katherine Waterston In Blumhouse Sony Movie|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2023-02-10|access-date=2023-02-13|archive-date=2023-05-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230520024217/https://deadline.com/2023/02/they-listen-blumhouse-greg-hill-1235255993/|dead-url=no}}</ref>、[[卢琪塔·麦斯威尔]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-02-22 |title=Lukita Maxwell Joins Blumhouse Sony Horror Pic 'They Listen' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/blumhouse-john-cho-they-listen-lukita-maxwell-1235267941/ |access-date=2023-02-22 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-12-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231216222007/https://deadline.com/2023/02/blumhouse-john-cho-they-listen-lukita-maxwell-1235267941/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>、{{tsl|en|Riki Lindhome|瑞琪·林德赫姆}}<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/wednesday-actress-riki-lindhome-joins-they-listen-1235333727/|title='Wednesday' Actress Riki Lindhome Joins Blumhouse Horror Thriller 'They Listen' (Exclusive)|last=Kit|first=Borys|work=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|date=2023-02-24|access-date=2023-02-24|archive-date=2024-07-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240701120220/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/wednesday-actress-riki-lindhome-joins-they-listen-1235333727/|dead-url=no}}</ref>和{{tsl|en|Havana Rose Liu|哈瓦娜·罗丝·刘}}<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-03-01 |title='They Listen': Blumhouse & Sony Turn Up Volume On Horror Pic With Havana Rose Liu |url=https://deadline.com/2023/03/blumhouse-sony-they-listen-havana-rose-liu-1235275876/ |access-date=2023-03-01 |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-04-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230401134734/https://deadline.com/2023/03/blumhouse-sony-they-listen-havana-rose-liu-1235275876/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>加盟剧组。

[[主体拍摄]]于2022年12月在洛杉矶举行<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/john-cho-katherine-waterston-they-listen-horror-movie-1235283714|title=John Cho, Katherine Waterston to Star in 'They Listen' Horror Pic|last=Vlessing|first=Etan|work=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|date=2022-12-16|access-date=2023-02-13|archive-date=2024-07-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240703212645/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/john-cho-katherine-waterston-they-listen-horror-movie-1235283714/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。首支预告片于2024年7月发布，片名改为《致命AI》（''Afraid''）<ref name="trailer">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/video/afraid-trailer-john-cho-katherine-waterston-blumhouse/|title='Afraid' Trailer: John Cho & Family Terrorized By New Smart Home Tech In Columbia/Blumhouse Thriller|last=Grobar|first=Matt|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2024-07-03|access-date=2024-07-03|archive-date=2024-08-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240829100221/https://deadline.com/video/afraid-trailer-john-cho-katherine-waterston-blumhouse/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

亚历克斯·韦斯顿为本片配乐，本片是维兹独立导演作品中，第一部不由[[亚历山大·德斯普拉]]作曲的电影<ref>{{Cite web|date=2024-08-02|title=Alex Weston scoring Chris Weitz's 'Afraid'|url=https://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/07/26/alex-weston-scoring-chris-weitzs-afraid/|access-date=2024-08-22|website=Film Music Reporter|archive-date=2024-08-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240815125836/https://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/07/26/alex-weston-scoring-chris-weitzs-afraid/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

