== 反响 ==
=== 票房 ===
截至2024年9月15日，电影北美票房670万美元，海外票房410万美元，全球票房共计1070万美元<ref name=NUM /><ref name=BOM />。

北美方面，电影与《{{tsl|en|Reagan (2024 film)|里根 (2024年电影)|里根}}》《{{tsl|en|Slingshot (2024 film)|弹弓卫星}}》《{{tsl|en|1992 (film)|洛杉矶大暴乱}}》和《{{tsl|en|City of Dreams (film)|梦想之城 (电影)|梦想之城}}》同日上映，首周末预计从3003家电影院获得500万至700万美元票房<ref name=BO-preview/>。最终首日票房130万美元，其中周四点映票房40万美元。首周末票房370万美元，位列票房榜第九名<ref name=opening>{{cite news|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/box-office-summer-labor-day-deadpool-wolverine-afraid-1236073792/|title=Summer Comes To An End With $3.6B+; ‘Reagan’ Sees $525K, Blumhouse’s ‘Afraid’ Scares Up $400K In Previews – Labor Day Box Office|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|publisher=Deadline Hollywood|date=2024-08-30|accessdate=2024-08-30|archive-date=2024-08-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240830160747/https://deadline.com/2024/08/box-office-summer-labor-day-deadpool-wolverine-afraid-1236073792/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/deadpool-wolverine-box-office-reagan-1235988739/|title=Box Office: ‘Deadpool & Wolverine’ Rules Quiet Labor Day, New ‘Reagan’ Biopic Battles for 4th Place|first=Pamela|last=McClintock|publisher=The Hollywood Reporter|date=2024-08-31|accessdate=2024-08-31|archive-date=2024-08-31|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240831175239/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/deadpool-wolverine-box-office-reagan-1235988739/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/deadpool-wolverine-tops-reagan-opening-day-afraid-1236125831/|title=Box Office: ‘Deadpool & Wolverine’ Topping Charts in Sixth Weekend as ‘Reagan’ and ‘Afraid’ Post Quiet Opening Days|first=J. Kim|last=Murphy|publisher=Variety|date=2024-08-31|accessdate=2024-08-31|archive-date=2024-09-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240918005523/https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/deadpool-wolverine-tops-reagan-opening-day-afraid-1236125831/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

海外方面，电影于19个国家及地区上映，票房230万美元<ref name="Deadline-Aug25">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/09/inside-out-2-overtakes-the-lion-king-ninth-biggest-movie-ever-worldiwde-alien-romulus-it-ends-with-us-deadpool-wolverine-despicable-me-4-global-international-box-office-1236075212/|title=‘Inside Out 2’ Overtakes ‘Lion King’ Globally, Now No. 9 Biggest Movie Ever; ‘Despicable Me 4’ Tops $900M WW; ‘Alien: Romulus’ & ‘It Ends With Us’ Close In On $300M – International Box Office|last=Tartaglione|first=Nancy|work=Deadline Hollywood|date=2024-09-01|access-date=2024-09-04|archive-date=2024-09-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240917025528/https://deadline.com/2024/09/inside-out-2-overtakes-the-lion-king-ninth-biggest-movie-ever-worldiwde-alien-romulus-it-ends-with-us-deadpool-wolverine-despicable-me-4-global-international-box-office-1236075212/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

