== 制作 ==
2021年6月，宣布[[马修·范恩]]将执导一部名为《机密特务：阿盖尔》的电影<ref name="RoninExclusive">{{cite web|url=https://theronin.org/2021/06/01/exclusive-director-matthew-vaughns-next-film-will-be-argyle-for-marv-films/|title=Exclusive: Director Matthew Vaughn's Next Film Will Be 'Argyle' For Marv Films|date=2021-06-01|first=Christopher|last=Marc|website=The Ronin|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210709002433/https://theronin.org/2021/06/01/exclusive-director-matthew-vaughns-next-film-will-be-argyle-for-marv-films/|archive-date=2021-07-09|dead-url=no|access-date=2021-07-09}}</ref>。2021年7月，据报导该片将由{{le|杰森·福克斯|Jason Fuchs}}编剧，改编自艾莉·康威（{{lang|en|Ellie Conway}}）尚未发售的同名小说，而[[亨利·卡维尔]]、[[山姆·洛克威尔]]、[[布莱丝·达拉斯·霍华]]、[[布莱恩·克兰斯顿]]、[[凯萨琳·奥哈拉]]、[[约翰·希南]]、[[山缪·杰克森]]和[[杜娃·黎波]]加入演员阵容。此外，黎波也将为电影献唱主题曲、并参与配乐工作<ref name="CastReveal">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2021/07/henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-bryan-cranston-samuel-jackson-john-cena-bruce-dallas-howard-new-movie-argylle-1234788568/|title=Henry Cavill, Sam Rockwell, Bryce Dallas Howard, Bryan Cranston, Dua Lipa, Samuel L. Jackson, John Cena, Catherine O'Hara Set For New Matthew Vaughn Spy Franchise 'Argylle'|date=2021-07-08|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210709002625/https://deadline.com/2021/07/henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-bryan-cranston-samuel-jackson-john-cena-bruce-dallas-howard-new-movie-argylle-1234788568/|archive-date=2021-07-09|dead-url=no|access-date=2021-07-09}}</ref>。2021年8月，据报导[[Apple TV+]]以2亿美元收购该片的发行权<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2021/08/apple-200-million-dollar-film-deal-matthew-vaughn-argllye-henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-samuel-jackson-1234808979/|title=Apple Lands Matthew Vaughn's Star-Studded Spy Film 'Argylle' In Massive Package Deal|date=2021-08-04|first1=Justin|last1=Kroll|first2=Mike Jr.|last2=Fleming|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|url-status=live|access-date=2021-08-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210804195444/https://deadline.com/2021/08/apple-200-million-dollar-film-deal-matthew-vaughn-argllye-henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-samuel-jackson-1234808979/|archive-date=2021-08-04}}</ref>。

《[[好莱坞报导]]》质疑新人作家艾莉·康威的身份。康威的书据称为本片的原作，但该作家存在的唯一证据包括没有帖子的[[Instagram]]帐号及两行简介，显示她居住在美国状态。该媒体指出，她的名字在出版商[[企鹅兰登书屋]]的网站上写为「{{lang|en|Ellie}}」，并尝试联系她本人、公关人员和人才经纪人，但并未成功。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/argylle-elly-conway-henry-cavill-apple-spy-mystery-1235220772/|title=Mystery Enshrouds Author Behind Henry Cavill Spy Thriller ''Argylle''|date=2022-09-15|first=Seth|last=Abramovitch|website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2022-09-15|archive-date=2022-09-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220915203701/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/argylle-elly-conway-henry-cavill-apple-spy-mystery-1235220772/|url-status=live}}</ref>

=== 拍摄 ===
[[主体拍摄]]于2021年8月在[[伦敦]]开始进行，并由[[乔治·里奇蒙德]]担任摄影师，拍摄地点还将在[[欧洲]]各地进行<ref name="RoninExclusive" /><ref name="CastReveal" /><ref>{{cite web|last=Daniels|first=Nia|url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2021/08/23/henry-cavill-begins-uk-shoot-on-matthew-vaughns-argylle-an-apple-spy-thriller|title=Henry Cavill begins UK shoot on Apple spy thriller Argylle, from Matthew Vaughn|website=KFTV|date=2021-08-23|access-date=2021-08-27|archive-date=2021-10-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211019151153/https://www.kftv.com/news/2021/08/23/henry-cavill-begins-uk-shoot-on-matthew-vaughns-argylle-an-apple-spy-thriller|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
2023年6月，[[环球影业]]将电影排定2024年2月2日在美国院线上映，之后在2024年4月12日于[[Apple TV+]]上线<ref>{{cite web |last1=Rubin |first1=Rebecca |title=Matthew Vaughn's ''Argylle'' Sets 2024 Theatrical Release Date |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/matthew-vaughn-argylle-spy-movie-release-date-1235645590/ |website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |access-date=2023-06-15 |date=2023-06-15 |archive-date=2023-06-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230615192116/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/matthew-vaughn-argylle-spy-movie-release-date-1235645590/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 回响 ==
=== 评价 ===
[[烂番茄]]根据303条评论，本片得到新鲜度33%，均分4.9／10，观众的好评度61%，均分3.4／5。<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/argylle|title=Argylle|work=[[烂番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|5=|access-date=2024-02-04|archive-date=2024-02-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240206171208/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/argylle|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]上根据56条评论而获得35分<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/argylle/|title=Argylle|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[CBS互动|CBS Interactive]]|5=|access-date=2024-02-04|archive-date=2024-02-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240206010440/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/argylle/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

