《'''异星战境'''》（{{langx|en|''Atlas''}}）是2024年[[Netflix]]原创[[美国]][[科幻电影|科幻]][[动作片]]。由[[布莱德·派顿]]执导，里欧·萨达里安（Leo Sardarian）和{{le|阿伦·埃利·科莱特|Aron Eli Coleite}}共同编剧<ref>{{Cite web |title=''Atlas'' |url=https://directories.wga.org/project/1232082/atlas |access-date=2023-03-11 |website=Writers Guild of America West |archive-date=2023-03-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230311184503/https://directories.wga.org/project/1232082/atlas |dead-url=no }}</ref>，演员阵容包括[[珍妮佛·罗培兹]]、[[刘思慕 (演员)|刘思慕]]、[[斯特林·K·布朗]]和[[马克·史壮]]<ref>{{Cite web|last=Lang|first=Brent|date=2021-06-15|title=Jennifer Lopez Starring in Sci-Fi Thriller 'Atlas' for Netflix|url=https://variety.com/2021/film/news/jennifer-lopez-netflix-atlas-movie-1234997306/|access-date=2021-06-16|website=Variety|archive-date=2023-12-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231217005918/https://variety.com/2021/film/news/jennifer-lopez-netflix-atlas-movie-1234997306/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-02-01 |title=Next On Netflix 2024 |url=https://www.netflix.com/tudum/galleries/next-on-netflix-2024-photos?mediaIndex=3 |website=Netflix Tudum |access-date=2024-04-05 |archive-date=2024-02-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240201142955/https://www.netflix.com/tudum/galleries/next-on-netflix-2024-photos?mediaIndex=3 |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

本电影2024年5月24日在Netflix上映。

== 剧情大纲 ==
艾勒丝·雪柏（Atlas Shepherd）是为政府工作的顶尖资料分析师，她加入一项捉捕[[人形机器人|机器人]]的任务，并从[[人工智慧]]手中拯救人类的未来<ref>{{cite web |last1=Dilillo |first1=John |title=In Atlas, Jennifer Lopez Suits Up for Space |url=https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/atlas-jennifer-lopez-release-date-photos-news |publisher=Netflix |access-date=2024-02-06 |date=2024-02-01 |archive-date=2024-02-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240206050713/https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/atlas-jennifer-lopez-release-date-photos-news |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

