* 葛瑞格里·詹姆斯·科汉（Gregory James Cohan） 饰演 史密斯（Smith，配音）

== 制作 ==
2021年6月，宣布《异星战境》由[[布莱德·派顿]]执导，[[珍妮佛·罗培兹]]领衔主演兼监制，以及{{le|阿伦·埃利·科莱特|Aron Eli Coleite}}将重新改写里欧·萨达里安（Leo Sardarian）所创作的原剧本<ref>{{Cite web|last=Kroll|first=Justin|date=2021-06-15|title=Jennifer Lopez To Star In Netflix's Sci-Fi Thriller 'Atlas' With Brad Peyton Directing|url=https://deadline.com/2021/06/jennifer-lopez-netflixs-sci-fi-thriller-atlas-brad-peyton-directing-1234775196/|access-date=2021-06-15|website=Deadline|archive-date=2022-11-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221118072448/https://deadline.com/2021/06/jennifer-lopez-netflixs-sci-fi-thriller-atlas-brad-peyton-directing-1234775196/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年8月，[[刘思慕 (演员)|刘思慕]]、[[斯特林·K·布朗]]和亚伯拉罕·波普拉（Abraham Popoola）加入主演阵容，前者将在本电影中饰演反派角色<ref>{{cite web |last1=Kroll |first1=Justin |title=From Marvel Superhero To Jennifer Lopez's Adversary, Simu Liu Lands First Villain Role In Netflix's 'Atlas'; Sterling K. Brown and Lana Parrilla Also Join The Cast |url=https://deadline.com/2022/08/jennifer-lopez-simu-liu-netflixs-atlas-sterling-k-brown-1235098798/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |publisher=Penske Media Corporation |date=2022-08-24 |access-date=2024-04-05 |archive-date=2023-05-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230520024911/https://deadline.com/2022/08/jennifer-lopez-simu-liu-netflixs-atlas-sterling-k-brown-1235098798/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同年9月，宣布[[拉娜·帕瑞拉]]加入剧组<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2022-09-27 |title=Lana Parrilla Signs With APA & Boards Jennifer Lopez's Netflix Sci-Fi Pic 'Atlas' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/lana-parrilla-jennifer-lopez-atlas-netflix-apa-1235128029/ |access-date=2022-09-27 |website=Deadline |archive-date=2023-10-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231008185501/https://deadline.com/2022/09/lana-parrilla-jennifer-lopez-atlas-netflix-apa-1235128029/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

=== 拍摄 ===
[[主体拍摄]]于2022年8月26日开始至11月26日结束，取景地点包括[[加州]][[洛杉矶]]和[[纽西兰]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Rajput |first=Priyanca |date=2022-09-01 |title=2022 Film and high-end TV productions shooting globally: latest updates |url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2022/08/31/2022-film-and-high-end-tv-productions-shooting-globally-latest-updates |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220901170025/https://www.kftv.com/news/2022/08/31/2022-film-and-high-end-tv-productions-shooting-globally-latest-updates |archive-date=2022-09-01 |access-date=2022-09-01 |website=Kemps Film and TV Production Services Handbook}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
《异星战境》2024年5月24日在[[Netflix]]上映<ref>{{cite web|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|title=Netflix 2024 Movie Slate Counts Titles From Jamie Foxx, Cameron Diaz, Jennifer Lopez, Jerry Seinfeld & Woody Woodpecker; 'Beverly Hills Cop 4' Sets Date|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/netflix-movie-dates-2024-1235810342/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2024-02-01|access-date=2024-02-01|archive-date=2024-02-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240201141129/https://deadline.com/2024/02/netflix-movie-dates-2024-1235810342/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

