== 制作 ==
据2023年11月的报导，[[狮门影视公司]]正在制作{{le|芭芭拉·罗宾森 (作家)|Barbara Robinson (author)|芭芭拉·罗宾森}}1972年小说《{{le|史上最棒的圣诞剧 (小说)|The Best Christmas Pageant Ever|史上最棒的圣诞剧}}》的改编电影，由{{le|达拉斯·詹金斯|Dallas Jenkins}}执导<ref name="Christmas"/>。电影2023年12月6日在加拿大[[曼尼托巴省]][[温尼伯]]展开[[主要拍摄]]<ref name="Christmas" />，2024年1月27日[[杀青]]<ref>{{Cite web |title=What's Filming |url=https://actramanitoba.ca/whats-filming/ |access-date=2024-01-28 |website={{le|ACTRA|ACTRA}} Manitoba |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240121201252/https://actramanitoba.ca/whats-filming/ |archive-date=2024-01-21 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last1=Boyle |first1=Gavin |title=Dallas Jenkins' THE BEST CHRISTMAS PAGEANT EVER Begins Production |url=https://www.movieguide.org/news-articles/the-best-christmas-pageant-ever-begins-production.html |website=Movieguide {{!}} The Family Guide to Movies & Entertainment |access-date=2024-09-05 |date=2023-12-19 |archive-date=2024-11-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241127230952/https://www.movieguide.org/news-articles/the-best-christmas-pageant-ever-begins-production.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
《史上最棒的圣诞剧》2024年11月2日在[[洛杉矶]]首映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.christianpost.com/news/best-christmas-pageant-ever-ever-premiere-celebrates-season.html|title=Red carpet premiere of ‘The Best Christmas Pageant Ever’ celebrates family, spirit of the season|last=Klett|first=Leah MarieAnn|work=Christian Post|date=2024-11-05|accessdate=2024-12-09}}</ref>，2024年11月8日在美国院线上映<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-04-09 |title='The Crow' Flies To August, Halle Berry Pic 'Never Let Go' Sets Fall, 'Saw XI' To Slice 2025, 'Best Christmas Pageant Ever' Earlier – Lionsgate Release Date Changes |url=https://deadline.com/2024/04/lionsgate-the-crow-saw-xi-never-let-go-halle-berry-release-dates-1235879683/ |access-date=2024-04-10 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-04-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240409224519/https://deadline.com/2024/04/lionsgate-the-crow-saw-xi-never-let-go-halle-berry-release-dates-1235879683/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片在美国原定2024年11月15日上映，后来提前一周，以避免与另一部圣诞电影《[[红色一号]]》竞争<ref>{{cite web |title=Dwayne Johnson & Chris Evans Seven Bucks Amazon MGM Movie 'Red One' To Jingle In Theaters Next Year |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-red-one-release-date-1235678552/ |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |website=Deadline Hollywood |date=2023-12-20 |access-date=2023-12-20 |archive-date=2023-12-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231220160705/https://deadline.com/2023/12/dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-red-one-release-date-1235678552/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

