[[路易·古兹曼]]饰演查利诺·巴尔德莫罗（{{lang|en|Chalino Valdemoro}}）；达米恩·迪亚兹（{{lang|en|Damien Diaz}}）饰演山姆·安利奎兹（{{lang|en|Sam Enriquez}}）；[[马克·佩雷格里诺]]饰演贝克（{{lang|en|Beck}}）。此外，[[克里斯多夫·麦当劳]]客串演出一名愤怒的高尔夫球手，致敬他在《[[高尔夫球也疯狂]]》（1996年）中扮演的角色<ref name="MolloyInterview">{{cite web |last=Davids |first=Brian |title='Beverly Hills Cop' Director Mark Molloy Kept Saying No to Jerry Bruckheimer Until 'Axel F' Came Along |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-features/beverly-hills-cop-axel-f-director-1235938760/amp/ |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |access-date=2024-07-04 |date=2024-07-03 |archive-date=2024-07-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240703212600/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-features/beverly-hills-cop-axel-f-director-1235938760/amp/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。墨菲现实中的女儿布莉亚（{{lang|en|Bria}}）饰演雷恩·明尼克（{{lang|en|Renne Minnick}}），逮捕福里的比佛利山警员<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://spoiler.bolavip.com/en/celebrities/eddie-murphys-daughter-all-on-bria-murphy-who-appears-in-beverly-hills-cop-axel-f|title=All about Bria Murphy, Eddie Murphy's daughter who appears in 'Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F'|date=2024-07-04|website=Spoiler US}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
2024年2月1日，根据[[Netflix]]前瞻影片公布，《比佛利山超级警探：艾索·福里》定于2024年7月3日登上该平台串流发行<ref>{{Cite web |title=Eddie Murphy Previews His Return as Axel Foley in 'Beverly Hills Cop 4' (Exclusive) |url=https://www.etonline.com/media/videos/eddie-murphy-previews-his-return-as-axel-foley-in-beverly-hills-cop-4-exclusive-215676 |access-date=2023-11-30 |website=Entertainment Tonight |language=en-US |archive-date=2023-12-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231202043848/https://www.etonline.com/media/videos/eddie-murphy-previews-his-return-as-axel-foley-in-beverly-hills-cop-4-exclusive-215676 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref name="slate">{{cite web|title=Netflix 2024 Movie Slate Counts Titles From Jamie Foxx, Cameron Diaz, Jennifer Lopez, Jerry Seinfeld & Woody Woodpecker; 'Beverly Hills Cop 4' Sets Date|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2024-02-01|access-date=2024-02-01|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/netflix-movie-dates-2024-1235810342/|archive-date=2024-02-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240201141129/https://deadline.com/2024/02/netflix-movie-dates-2024-1235810342/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。电影7月3日在Netflix首播后，五天内观看次数达到4100万次<ref name=viewership>{{cite web|url=https://www.netflix.com/tudum/top10|title=Global Top 10 - July 1-July 7, 2024|publisher=Netflix|accessdate=2024-07-09|archive-date=2024-05-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240530134115/https://www.netflix.com/tudum/top10|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.thewrap.com/beverly-hills-cop-axel-f-netflix-viewership/|title=Eddie Murphy’s ‘Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F’ Debuts as Most-Watched Netflix Title of the Week With 41 Million Views|first=Loree|last=Seltz|publisher=The Wrap|date=2024-07-09|accessdate=2024-07-09|archive-date=2024-07-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240710020506/https://www.thewrap.com/beverly-hills-cop-axel-f-netflix-viewership/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://screenrant.com/beverly-hills-cop-4-netflix-chart-rank-audience-debut/|title=Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F Dominates Netflix's Global Chart With Massive Viewership Debut|first=Hannah|last=Gearan|publisher=Screen Rant|date=2024-07-09|accessdate=2024-07-09|archive-date=2024-07-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240710181615/https://screenrant.com/beverly-hills-cop-4-netflix-chart-rank-audience-debut/|dead-url=no}}</ref>；观看时间也达8070万小时<ref name=viewership /><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.forbes.com/sites/timlammers/2024/07/09/2014-denzel-washington-hit-debuts-big-on-netflix-global-movies-chart/|title=2014 Denzel Washington Hit Debuts Big On Netflix Global Movies Chart|first=Tim|last=Lammers|work=Forbes|date=2024-07-09|accessdate=2024-07-09|archive-date=2024-07-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240710190310/https://www.forbes.com/sites/timlammers/2024/07/09/2014-denzel-washington-hit-debuts-big-on-netflix-global-movies-chart/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://comicbook.com/movies/news/beverly-hills-cop-axel-f-views-ratings-netflix-top-10/|title=Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F Is Netflix's Most-Watched Movie Premiere of 2024|publisher=ComicBook.com|date=2024-07-09|accessdate=2024-07-09|archive-date=2024-07-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240711022155/https://comicbook.com/movies/news/beverly-hills-cop-axel-f-views-ratings-netflix-top-10/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

