== 制作 ==
=== 发展 ===
2015年8月，宣布[[狮门]]正在制作一部改编自《[[边缘禁地系列|边缘禁地]]》的电影，由阿里·阿拉德和{{le|阿维·阿拉德|Avi Arad}}担任制片人<ref>{{cite web |last=McNary |first=Dave |date=2015-08-28 |title='Borderlands' Videogame Movie in Works at Lionsgate |url=https://variety.com/2015/film/news/borderlands-videogame-movie-lionsgate-1201580303/ |access-date=2021-01-27 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2020-10-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201029151741/https://variety.com/2015/film/news/borderlands-videogame-movie-lionsgate-1201580303/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2020年2月，宣布该片将由[[艾利·罗斯]]执导，{{le|克雷格·麦辛|Craig Mazin}}编剧<ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2020-02-20 |title=Eli Roth To Direct Adaptation Of Sci-Fi Videogame 'Borderlands' For Lionsgate |url=https://deadline.com/2020/02/borderlands-videogame-eli-roth-directing-lionsgate-movie-1202864502/ |access-date=2021-01-27 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2020-12-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201224212648/https://deadline.com/2020/02/borderlands-videogame-eli-roth-directing-lionsgate-movie-1202864502/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。5月，[[凯特·布兰琪]]为饰演角色莉莉丝进行洽谈，并于同月底确认出演电影<ref>{{cite web |last=N'Duka |first=Amanda |date=2020-05-05 |title=Oscar Winner Cate Blanchett In Talks To Join 'Borderlands' Adaptation At Lionsgate |url=https://deadline.com/2020/05/cate-blanchett-borderlands-lionsgate-1202926685/ |access-date=2021-01-27 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2020-08-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200815152347/https://deadline.com/2020/05/cate-blanchett-borderlands-lionsgate-1202926685/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Romano |first=Nick |date=2020-05-28 |title=Cate Blanchett to star in Eli Roth's Borderlands movie |url=https://ew.com/movies/cate-blanchett-borderlands/ |access-date=2021-01-27 |website=[[Entertainment Weekly]] |archive-date=2021-01-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210126002334/https://ew.com/movies/cate-blanchett-borderlands/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2021年1月，[[凯文·哈特]]加盟演员阵容<ref>{{cite web |last=Dedmon |first=Tanner |date=2020-12-16 |title=Kevin Hart Reportedly Joining Borderlands Movie as Fan-Favorite Character |url=https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/kevin-hart-borderlands-movie-roland/ |access-date=2021-01-27 |website=ComicBook |archive-date=2021-01-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210126193639/https://comicbook.com/gaming/news/kevin-hart-borderlands-movie-roland/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Roxborough |first=Scott |date=2021-01-07 |title=Why COVID Couldn't Stop the Hungarian Production Boom |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/why-covid-couldnt-stop-the-hungarian-production-boom |dead-url=no |access-date=2021-01-11 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2021-01-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210110123903/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/why-covid-couldnt-stop-the-hungarian-production-boom }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Rubin |first=Rebecca |date=2021-01-26 |title=Kevin Hart to Star Alongside Cate Blanchett in 'Borderlands' |url=https://variety.com/2021/film/news/kevin-hart-borderlands-cate-blanchett-1234892540/ |access-date=2021-01-26 |website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |archive-date=2021-01-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210126201942/https://variety.com/2021/film/news/kevin-hart-borderlands-cate-blanchett-1234892540/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2月，[[洁美·李·寇蒂斯]]和[[杰克·布莱克]]加盟演员阵容<ref>{{cite web |last=N'Duka |first=Amanda |date=2021-02-08 |title=Jamie Lee Curtis Joins Cate Blanchett and Kevin Hart In 'Borderlands' Adaptation From Lionsgate |url=https://deadline.com/2021/02/jamie-lee-curtis-cate-blanchett-kevin-hart-borderlands-lionsgate-1234689764/ |access-date=2021-02-08 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2022-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220213133342/https://deadline.com/2021/02/jamie-lee-curtis-cate-blanchett-kevin-hart-borderlands-lionsgate-1234689764/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=N'Duka |first=Amanda |date=2021-02-11 |title=Jack Black Reunites With Eli Roth & Cate Blanchett For 'Borderlands' Movie |url=https://deadline.com/2021/02/jack-black-eli-roth-cate-blanchett-borderlands-lionsgate-1234692217/ |access-date=2021-02-11 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2022-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220213133346/https://deadline.com/2021/02/jack-black-eli-roth-cate-blanchett-borderlands-lionsgate-1234692217/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。3月，[[雅瑞安娜·葛林布雷]]、[[佛洛里安·蒙特亚努]]和[[海莉·班奈特]]加盟演员阵容<ref>{{cite web |last=Kit |first=Borys |date=2021-03-01 |title=Young Gamora Actress Ariana Greenblatt Joins Cate Blanchett, Kevin Hart in 'Borderlands' Movie |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/young-gamora-actress-ariana-greenblatt-joins-cate-blanchett-kevin-hart-in-borderlands-movie |access-date=2021-03-01 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2021-03-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210301201110/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/young-gamora-actress-ariana-greenblatt-joins-cate-blanchett-kevin-hart-in-borderlands-movie |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Kit |first=Borys |date=2021-03-09 |title='Creed II' Actor Florian Munteanu Joining Cate Blanchett, Kevin Hart in 'Borderlands' Movie (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/creed-ii-actor-florian-munteanu-joining-cate-blanchett-kevin-hart-in-borderlands-movie-exclusive |access-date=2021-03-09 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2021-03-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210310055036/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/creed-ii-actor-florian-munteanu-joining-cate-blanchett-kevin-hart-in-borderlands-movie-exclusive |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2021-03-12 |title=Haley Bennett To Star In Eli Roth's 'Borderlands' |url=https://deadline.com/2021/03/haley-bennett-to-star-in-eli-roths-borderlands-1234713251/ |access-date=2021-03-12 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2021-04-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210420222705/https://deadline.com/2021/03/haley-bennett-to-star-in-eli-roths-borderlands-1234713251/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

=== 拍摄 ===
[[主体拍摄]]于2021年4月1日在[[匈牙利]]开始进行<ref>{{cite web |date=2021-01-25 |title=Borderlands |url=https://productionlist.com/production/borderlands/ |access-date=2021-01-26 |website=Production List |archive-date=2021-02-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210208201044/https://productionlist.com/production/borderlands/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite tweet|user=ArianaG|number=1377677890783911936|title=we out here, cameras rolling Day1 #BorderlandsMovie|date=2021-04-02|accessdate=2021-04-03}}</ref>。

2023年1月，[[提姆·米勒]]接手执导本片为期两周的补拍，罗斯则为了拍摄长片《[[恐怖感恩劫]]》（2023年）而不回归参与补拍作业，但仍给予米勒祝福<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2023/01/borderlands-tim-miller-eli-roth-grindhouse-trailer-thanksgiving-1235214050/ |title=Tim Miller Steps In For Eli Roth To Handle ‘Borderlands’ Reshoot As Roth Cooks Up Feature Version Of ‘Grindhouse’ Trailer ‘Thanksgiving’ |first=Mike |last=Fleming Jr. |date=2023-01-07 |accessdate=2023-01-07 |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-01-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230108002524/https://deadline.com/2023/01/borderlands-tim-miller-eli-roth-grindhouse-trailer-thanksgiving-1235214050/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年6月，麦辛从该项目中删去了自己的名字，并使用化名乔·克龙比（{{lang|en|Joe Crombie}}）<ref>{{cite web|url=https://directories.wga.org/project/1203280/borderlands/|title=''Borderlands'' Writing Credits|date=2023-06-21|website=WGA Directory|accessdate=2023-07-02|archive-date=2023-08-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230807062622/https://directories.wga.org/project/1203280/borderlands/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
《边缘禁地》2024年8月9日由狮门安排在美国院线上映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.comingsoon.net/movies/news/1305425-borderlands-movie-releasing-2024-jamie-lee-curtis-tannis|title=Borderlands Movie Releasing in 2024, Jamie Lee Curtis Details Tannis|work=ComingSoon.net|last=Sim|first=Jonathan|date=2023-07-12|access-date=2023-07-12|archive-date=2023-07-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230715184142/https://www.comingsoon.net/movies/news/1305425-borderlands-movie-releasing-2024-jamie-lee-curtis-tannis|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|title=Eli Roth's Feature Take of Videogame 'Borderlands' Lands Summer 2024 Release Date – Comic-Con|url=https://deadline.com/2023/07/borderlands-release-date-eli-roth-comic-con-1235443176/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2023-07-20|access-date=2023-07-20|archive-date=2023-07-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230726193941/https://deadline.com/2023/07/borderlands-release-date-eli-roth-comic-con-1235443176/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年11月9日进行了内部试映<ref>{{cite web|last=Groot|first=Peter|url=https://mentalmars.com/game-news/test-screening-for-the-borderlands-movie-has-started/|title=Test Screening For The Borderlands Movie Has Started|date=2022-11-05|access-date=2023-01-08|website=MentalMars|archive-date=2023-01-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230108170414/https://mentalmars.com/game-news/test-screening-for-the-borderlands-movie-has-started/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

