==制作==
2022年1月，据报导，[[亚力克斯·嘉兰]]再度与[[A24 (公司)|A24]]合作，自编自导电影《帝国浩劫：美国内战》，[[克丝汀·邓斯特]]、[[华格纳·莫拉]]、{{le|史蒂芬·麦金利·亨德森|Stephen McKinley Henderson}}和[[卡莉·史派妮]]已签约参演<ref>{{cite web|last1=Grobar|first1=Matt|title=Alex Garland Reteams With A24 For Action Epic ''Civil War''; Kirsten Dunst, Wagner Moura & More Set To Star|url=https://deadline.com/2022/01/civil-war-kirsten-dunst-more-to-star-in-alex-garland-a24-film-1234917411/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-01-21|date=2022-01-21|archive-date=2022-04-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220418080027/https://deadline.com/2022/01/civil-war-kirsten-dunst-more-to-star-in-alex-garland-a24-film-1234917411/|url-status=live }}</ref>。[[卡尔·葛鲁斯曼]]于4月加入演出阵容<ref>{{cite web|last1=Russell|first1=Calum|title=Why Kirsten Dunst feels disillusioned with Hollywood|url=https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/kirsten-dunst-disillusioned-with-hollywood/|website={{le|Far Out (网站)|Far Out (website)|Far Out Magazine}}|access-date=2022-06-19|date=2022-04-30|archive-date=2023-11-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231124131256/https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/kirsten-dunst-disillusioned-with-hollywood/|url-status=live }}</ref>。嘉兰在5月接受《[[每日电讯报]]》采访时，将本片形容为《[[们]]》（2022年）的姊妹作，并补充：「电影设定在距离我足够远、不确定的某未来时间点，足以让我自由发挥，更成为我们当今两极分化困境的科幻寓言。」[[水野索诺亚]]也已参演本片。<ref>{{cite web|last1=Collin|first1=Robbie|title=Ex Machina's Alex Garland: 'If I did a Marvel movie, it would be a disaster'|url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/0/ex-machinas-alex-garland-did-marvel-movie-would-disaster/|website=[[每日电讯报|The Daily Telegraph]]|access-date=2022-06-19|date=2022-05-28|archive-date=2022-06-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220619041522/https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/0/ex-machinas-alex-garland-did-marvel-movie-would-disaster/|url-status=live }}</ref>

本片2022年3月15日在[[亚特兰大]][[主要拍摄|开拍]]<ref>{{cite web|title=Civil War|url=https://productionlist.com/production/civil-war/|website=Film & Television Industry Alliance|date=2022-02-21|access-date=2022-04-06|archive-date=2024-02-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240215044820/https://productionlist.com/production/civil-war/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CbbUNKUuQQq/|title=Nothing civil in war|website=[[Instagram]]|first=Rob|last=Hardy|date=2022-03-22|access-date=2022-05-04|archive-date=2024-01-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240103173648/https://www.instagram.com/p/CbbUNKUuQQq/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。5月，剧组移至英国[[伦敦]]拍摄<ref>{{cite web|last1=Lattanzio|first1=Ryan|title=Alex Garland Knows He's Made the Most Inscrutable Movie of His Career with ''Men''|url=https://www.indiewire.com/2022/05/men-alex-garland-interview-a24-horror-movie-jessie-buckley-1234725238/|website=[[IndieWire]]|access-date=2022-06-19|date=2022-05-17|archive-date=2022-06-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220619040606/https://www.indiewire.com/2022/05/men-alex-garland-interview-a24-horror-movie-jessie-buckley-1234725238/|url-status=live }}</ref>。《帝国浩劫：美国内战》的制作预算为5,000万美元，成为A24造价最昂贵的电影<ref name="Budget"/>。

==发行==
《帝国浩劫：美国内战》原先计划2024年4月26日在美国上映<ref>{{cite web|last=Grobar|first=Matt|title=''Civil War'' Trailer & Release Date: America Becomes A Battleground In Alex Garland's A24 Pic Starring Kirsten Dunst, Wagner Moura & Cailee Spaeny|url=https://deadline.com/video/civil-war-movie-trailer-release-date-a24/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2023-12-13|access-date=2023-12-13|archive-date=2023-12-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231213140340/https://deadline.com/video/civil-war-movie-trailer-release-date-a24/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Webster|first=Andrew|date=2023-12-13|title=America is on the brink in the first trailer for Alex Garland's ''Civil War''|url=https://www.theverge.com/23999689/civil-war-trailer-alex-garland-a24|access-date=2023-12-13|website=[[The Verge]]|archive-date=2023-12-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231213154553/https://www.theverge.com/23999689/civil-war-trailer-alex-garland-a24|url-status=live }}</ref>。后续改定2024年4月12日上映，与真实历史上的[[南北战争|美国内战]]的开始日期相同<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/the-civil-war-begins|title=Civil War begins as Confederate forces fire on Fort Sumter|website=History|date=2009-11-24|access-date=2024-04-10|archive-date=2024-07-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240703022249/https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/the-civil-war-begins|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==回响==
===评价===
本片在[[烂番茄]]网站上根据397名影评人的评分，新鲜度达81%，平均得分7.5／10。该网站的共识评论：「《帝国浩劫：美国内战》设计上棘手且令人不安，以扣人心弦的视角近距离观察深陷水深火热的国家，此时的不安定生活是如此剧烈。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/civil_war_2024|title=Civil War (2024)|work=[[烂番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-04-03|archive-date=2024-04-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240415173932/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/civil_war_2024|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]网站上，电影根据64名影评人的评分，取得75分（满分100），象征「普遍好评」<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/civil-war|title=Civil War|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-04-03|archive-date=2024-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213104601/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/civil-war/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

