== 制作 ==
据2022年5月的报导，[[雷夫·范恩斯]]、[[约翰·李斯高]]、[[史丹利·图奇]]和[[伊莎贝拉·罗塞里尼]]将出演[[罗伯特·哈里斯]]2016年小说《{{le|秘密会议 (小说)|Conclave (novel)|秘密会议}}》的改编电影，该片由[[爱德华·贝尔格]]执导<ref>{{cite web |last=Whittock |first=Jesse |title=Ralph Fiennes To Lead Conspiracy Thriller ''Conclave'' With Edward Berger Helming; John Lithgow, Stanley Tucci & Isabella Rossellini Join Cast With FilmNation Selling At Cannes Market |url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/ralph-fiennes-edward-berger-conspiracy-thriller-conclave-john-lithgow-stanley-tucci-isabella-rossellini-join-cast-with-filmnation-attached-cannes-market-1235021126/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-05-11 |date=2022-05-11 |archive-date=2023-02-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230206063343/https://deadline.com/2022/05/ralph-fiennes-edward-berger-conspiracy-thriller-conclave-john-lithgow-stanley-tucci-isabella-rossellini-join-cast-with-filmnation-attached-cannes-market-1235021126/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年1月，电影在[[罗马]]开拍，同时宣布了其余的演员阵容<ref>{{cite web |last=Ramachandran |first=Naman |title=Ralph Fiennes-Led Vatican Thriller ''Conclave'' From ''All Quiet on the Western Front'' Filmmaker Adds Cast, Begins Shoot (EXCLUSIVE) |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/ralph-fiennes-vatican-conclave-all-quiet-on-the-western-front-cast-shoot-1235507914/ |work=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |access-date=2023-02-06 |date=2023-01-31 |archive-date=2023-02-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230228055622/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/ralph-fiennes-vatican-conclave-all-quiet-on-the-western-front-cast-shoot-1235507914/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。拍摄也在[[奇尼奇塔]]进行<ref>{{cite web |last=Vivarelli |first=Nick |title=Cinecittà Studios Revamp Gets Traction With More Soundstages, International Productions Including Ralph Fiennes Thriller ''Conclave'' |url=https://variety.com/2022/artisans/global/cinecitta-studios-revamp-soundstages-international-productions-1235373371/ |work=Variety |access-date=2023-02-06 |date=2022-09-15 |archive-date=2023-02-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230228055633/https://variety.com/2022/artisans/global/cinecitta-studios-revamp-soundstages-international-productions-1235373371/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影于同年3月宣告[[杀青]]<ref>{{cite web |title='Conclave' |url=https://www.backstage.com/casting/conclave-2500521/ |work={{le|后台 (杂志)|Backstage (magazine)|Backstage}} |access-date=2023-02-06 |archive-date=2023-02-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230228055631/https://www.backstage.com/casting/conclave-2500521/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

布景设计师非常精心复制了[[西斯汀小堂]]，但他们仍对[[圣玛尔大之家]]进行部分{{le|诗的破格|Artistic license|更动}}。他们把场景设计得更像监狱，以增强戏剧张力，因为他们觉得现实的版本相当沉闷。剧装设计师为了取材，参观了罗马当地的[[加马雷利]]裁缝店、{{le|蒂雷利·科斯图米|Tirelli Costumi}}服装厂及几家博物馆。对于枢机的红色服装，剧装设计师{{le|莉西·克里斯托|Lisy Christl}}选择了17世纪枢机祭衣的用色，认为「这种颜色更美丽，看久了不会累眼睛」，而非现代的颜色。<ref name="NYT-Povoledo">{{cite news |last1=Povoledo |first1=Elisabetta |title='Conclave': A Fly on the Wall Inside the Secret Process to Elect a Pope |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/10/25/movies/conclave-edward-berger.html |access-date=2024-11-05 |date=2024-10-25 |work=New York Times |archive-date=2024-11-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241118194933/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/10/25/movies/conclave-edward-berger.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>

编剧{{le|彼特·史卓翰|Peter Straughan}}在撰写剧本时表示，会见了一位枢机，讨论了[[教宗选举]]的后勤工作。他还私人参观了梵蒂冈，并表示在该地并未感受到敌意，反而对他予以欢迎。<ref name="NYT-Povoledo" />

== 与现实相似之处及影响力 ==
2025年2月末，时任[[教宗]][[方济各 (教宗)|方济各]]病重入院。<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.catholicnewsagency.com/news/262509/pope-francis-stable-after-respiratory-crisis-prognosis-remains-reserved|archive-date=2025-05-13|url-status=unfit|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250513090512/https://www.catholicnewsagency.com/news/262509/pope-francis-stable-after-respiratory-crisis-prognosis-remains-reserved|access-date=2025-03-01|title=Pope's health remains stable following respiratory crisis|first=AC|last=Wimmer|agency={{tsl|en|Catholic News Agency}}|date=2025-03-01}}</ref>美国娱乐兼媒体网站[[TheWrap]]的评论员吴菲莉安娜（{{lang|en|Philiana Ng}}）评论道：「《教宗选战》的台前幕后庆祝他们在[[第31届美国演员工会奖]]上赢得{{tsl|en|Screen Actors Guild Award for Outstanding Performance by a Cast in a Motion Picture|美国演员工会奖最佳电影卡司|最佳电影卡司}}奖项，但同时也承认现实中的情况与电影相似——电影讲述了[[教宗选举]]的秘密过程，恰巧时任教宗方济各正出现健康问题。[[伊莎贝拉·罗西里尼]]向记者表示：『我们非常、非常担心我们的教宗方济各。我们祝他一切安好，希望他早日康复。』」<ref>{{Cite news|first=Philiana |last=Ng|date=2025-02-23 |title='Conclave' Cast Addresses Film's Timeliness During Pope Francis' Health Crisis: 'We Are Very Worried'|url=https://www.thewrap.com/conclave-pope-francis-health-crisis/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250412055945/https://www.thewrap.com/conclave-pope-francis-health-crisis/ |archive-date=2025-04-21|url-status=live |access-date=2025-03-01 |work=[[TheWrap]]}}</ref>

2025年4月21日，[[教宗方济各之死|教宗方济各逝世]]，享年88岁。由此，[[2025年教宗选举秘密会议|实际的教宗选举]]于同年5月7日至5月8日在[[梵蒂冈]][[西斯汀小堂]]举行。<ref>{{cite news |work=[[The Sydney Morning Herald]] |url=https://www.smh.com.au/world/europe/the-pope-has-died-here-s-what-happens-next-20250224-p5lemh.html |access-date=2025-04-21 |archive-date=2025-04-21 |archive-url=https://archive.today/20250421090622/https://www.smh.com.au/world/europe/the-pope-has-died-here-s-what-happens-next-20250224-p5lemh.html |date=2025-04-21 |title=The Pope has died. Here's what happens next |first1=Jackson |last1=Graham |first2=Angus |url-status=live |last2=Holland}}</ref>根据[[Luminate]]报导，教宗方济各的去世导致在家观看《教宗选战》的人数大幅增加。4月21日，本片在串流媒体平台的收视率飙升283%。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2025/film/news/conclave-streaming-views-pope-francis-death-1236375240/|title=‘Conclave’ Viewership Soars After Pope Francis’ Death, Up 283% to Nearly 7 Million Minutes Watched|website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|first=Zack|last=Sharf|date=2025-04-22|access-date=2025-04-22|archive-date=2025-05-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250508024446/https://variety.com/2025/film/news/conclave-streaming-views-pope-francis-death-1236375240/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

2025年5月8日，美国枢机[[罗伯特·方济各·普雷沃斯特]]当选[[天主教会]]第267任教宗，是为[[良十四世]]。翌日，据其二兄约翰·普雷沃斯特（John Prevost）接受[[NBC新闻]]专访时透露，良十四世在参与教宗选举前也有观看《教宗选战》，以作准备。<ref>{{cite web |title=Pope Leo's brother in Illinois talks about doing Wordle, watching 'Conclave' movie |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=83WFXxPRGHE |website=[[YouTube]] |publisher=[[NBC News]] |accessdate=2025-05-13 |date=2025-05-09 |archive-date=2025-05-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250513104739/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=83WFXxPRGHE |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |author1=Adrian Horton |title=Pope Leo XIV watched Conclave movie to prepare, brother says |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2025/may/09/pope-leo-xiv-watched-conclave-movie |accessdate=2025-05-13 |work=[[The Guardian]] |date=2025-05-09}}</ref>

