== 制作 ==

=== 拍摄 ===
[[主体拍摄]]于2022年7月13日在[[捷克]][[布拉格]]开始<ref name="JulyFilming">{{Cite news|url=https://www.praguereporter.com/home/2022/7/13/the-crow-starring-bill-skarsgrd-and-fka-twigs-now-filming-in-prague|title='The Crow', starring Bill Skarsgård and FKA Twigs, now filming in Prague|date=2022-07-13|work=The Prague Reporter|access-date=2022-08-10|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-09-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220929232101/https://www.praguereporter.com/home/2022/7/13/the-crow-starring-bill-skarsgrd-and-fka-twigs-now-filming-in-prague|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年9月16日拍摄结束<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.praguereporter.com/home/2022/9/16/the-crow-reboot-starring-bill-skarsgard-as-eric-draven-wraps-production-in-prague|title='The Crow' reboot, starring Bill Skarsgård as Eric Draven, wraps production in Prague|date=2022-09-16|work=The Prague Reporter|access-date=2022-10-05|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-10-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221005162145/https://www.praguereporter.com/home/2022/9/16/the-crow-reboot-starring-bill-skarsgard-as-eric-draven-wraps-production-in-prague|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name="Wrap">{{cite web |url=https://comicbook.com/movies/news/the-crow-reboot-wraps-production/ |title=The Crow Reboot Reportedly Wraps Production |website=ComicBook |last=Burlingame |first=Russ |date=2022-09-30 |access-date=2022-10-05 |archive-date=2022-11-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221126101744/https://comicbook.com/movies/news/the-crow-reboot-wraps-production/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="JulyFilming" />。

== 上映 ==

《龙族战神：重生》2024年8月23日由[[狮门娱乐]]安排在美国院线上映。原上映日定于2024年6月7日。<ref>{{Cite web |title=‘Ballerina’ Dances Into Summer 2025 As ‘The Crow’ Swoops Into John Wick Spinoff’s June 2024 Date |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/ballerina-john-wick-spinoff-the-crow-release-date-1235833533/ |website=Deadline |date=2024-02-22 |language=en-US |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |access-date=2024-02-22 |archive-date=2024-02-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240222000720/https://deadline.com/2024/02/ballerina-john-wick-spinoff-the-crow-release-date-1235833533/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>

2022年5月，本片的国际发行权在[[第75届坎城影展]]卖给多个买家<ref>{{cite web|last=Wiseman|first=Andreas|url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/the-crow-reboot-with-bill-skarsgard-fka-twigs-heads-to-market-with-filmnation-cannes-hot-package-1235020973/|title=''The Crow'' Reboot With Bill Skarsgård & FKA Twigs Heads To Market With FilmNation — Cannes Hot Package|date=2022-05-11|website=Deadline|access-date=2022-06-19|archive-date=2022-08-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220823211405/https://deadline.com/2022/05/the-crow-reboot-with-bill-skarsgard-fka-twigs-heads-to-market-with-filmnation-cannes-hot-package-1235020973/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3718804/the-crow-reboot-taking-flight-with-several-big-deals-made-for-international-rights/ |title='The Crow' Reboot Taking Flight With Several Big Deals Made for International Rights |website={{tsl|en|Bloody Disgusting||Bloody Disgusting}} |first=John |last=Squires |date=2022-06-10 |access-date=2022-08-12 |archive-date=2023-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230121071958/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3718804/the-crow-reboot-taking-flight-with-several-big-deals-made-for-international-rights/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/filmnation-sells-out-on-the-crow-reboot-in-cannes-exclusive/5171567.article |title=FilmNation sells out on 'The Crow' reboot in Cannes (exclusive) |website=ScreenDaily |last=Kay |first=Jeremy |date=2022-06-10 |access-date=2022-08-12 |archive-date=2023-06-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230609002014/https://www.screendaily.com/news/filmnation-sells-out-on-the-crow-reboot-in-cannes-exclusive/5171567.article |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

