{{Rotten Tomatoes prose|78|6.9|414|ref=yes|access-date=2025-01-16|consensus=[[莱恩·雷诺斯]]凭借其辛辣机智在漫威电影宇宙中扎根，而[[晓治·积曼]]则为《死侍与狼人》提供[[亚德曼合金]]般的坚实支柱。这是一场放肆不羁的狂欢，却又意外地流露出对昔日超级英雄电影的缅怀。}}
{{Metacritic film prose|56|58|ref=yes|access-date=2025-06-17}}据[[影院评分]]调查，观众的评价在A+至F间落于「A」。而{{le|PostTrak}}调查的观众给了96%的正面评分，其中85%的人表示他们肯定会推荐这部电影<ref>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title='Deadpool & Wolverine' At $211M, Now The 6th Highest Opening Of All-Time At U.S. Box Office – Monday AM Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/07/box-office-deadpool-wolverine-1236022761/ |website=Deadline |date=2024-07-29 |access-date=2024-08-04 |archive-date=2024-07-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240730110346/https://deadline.com/2024/07/box-office-deadpool-wolverine-1236022761/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

