《'''性梦爱三部曲：梦'''》（{{langx|no|Drømmer}}）是2024年上映的挪威[[剧情片]]，为挪威导演[[达格·约翰·豪格鲁德]]《性梦爱三部曲》最后一部，前两部为 《{{tsl|en|Sex (2024 film)|性梦爱三部曲：性}}》、《{{tsl|en|Love (2024 film)|性梦爱三部曲：爱}}》，三部作品探讨了人际关系、性与社会规范复杂性。电影讲述{{tsl|no|Ella Øverbye|艾拉·奥弗拜}}饰演的女学生约翰娜暗恋法语老师{{tsl|no|Selome Emnetu|塞洛梅·埃姆内图}}，其记录这段关系的文字引发其母亲与祖母质疑师生二人为实现的梦想和欲望，继而挑起其家族内部的紧张关系及自我反省<ref name="cine:dreams">{{Cite web |url= https://cineuropa.org/film/468007/ |title= Dreams |author= Dag Johan Haugerud |date= 2024-12-17 |access-date= 2025-01-22 |website= {{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language= en |archive-date= 2025-01-21 |archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20250121220139/https://cineuropa.org/film/468007/ |url-status= live }}</ref>。

电影于2024年10月4日在挪威院线上映<ref name="rel:nfi"/>。2025年，电影入选[[第75届柏林影展]]主竞赛单元<ref name="maincomp:sd">{{cite web |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/berlin-film-festival-reveals-2025-competition-line-up/5200946.article |title=Berlin film festival reveals 2025 competition line-up 2025 |first=Michael |last=Rosser |date=2025-01-21 |access-date=2025-01-21 |website=[[国际银幕|ScreenDaily]] |language=en |archive-date=2025-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121105038/https://www.screendaily.com/news/berlin-film-festival-reveals-2025-competition-line-up/5200946.article |url-status=live }}</ref>，2025年2月19日在电影节全球首映，获[[金熊奖]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Ntim |first=Zac |date=2025-02-22 |title=Berlin Film Festival: Norwegian Film ‘Dreams (Sex Love)’ Wins Golden Bear, Andrew Scott & Rose Byrne Take Acting Honors — Full List |url=https://deadline.com/2025/02/berlin-film-festival-winners-2025-1236298118/ |access-date=2025-02-22 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-02-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250222184819/https://deadline.com/2025/02/berlin-film-festival-winners-2025-1236298118/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==演员==
* {{tsl|no|Ella Øverbye|艾拉·奥弗拜}} 饰 约翰妮（Johanne）
* {{tsl|no|Selome Emnetu|塞洛梅·埃姆内图}} 饰 约翰娜（Johanna）
* {{tsl|en|Ane Dahl Torp|安妮·达尔·托普}} 饰 克里斯汀（Kristin），约翰妮的母亲
* {{tsl|en|Anne Marit Jacobsen|安妮·玛丽·雅各布森}} 饰 卡琳（Karin），约翰妮的祖母
* {{tsl|en|Andrine Sæther|安德琳·赛瑟}} 饰 安妮（Anne）

==制片==
2022年9月22日，{{tsl|en|Viaplay|Viaplay}}将《性梦爱三部曲》的制片工作交给导演[[达格·约翰·豪格鲁德]]。电影由挪威制片公司Motlys和Viaplay制作，{{tsl|en|Norwegian Film Institute|挪威电影学院}}、{{tsl|en|Nordisk Film & TV Fond|北欧影视基金}}、奥斯陆电影基金会（Oslo Filmfond）和Arthaus提供支持<ref name="prod:cine">{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/newsdetail/431096/ |title=Dag Johan Haugerud to direct Sex, Dreams and Love for Viaplay |first=Davide |last=Abbatescianni |date=2022-09-23 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en |archive-date=2025-01-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250122102448/https://cineuropa.org/newsdetail/431096/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。在《[[综艺 (杂志)|综艺]]》杂志专访中，豪格鲁德表示自己是在[[克日什托夫·基斯洛夫斯基]]《[[三色]]》三部曲的启发下接手这个项目，计划用不同视角呈现三部讲述同一议题的电影。他认为三部电影应该给人不一样的感冠和感受，但也需要让人觉得它们都是在同一个对话里<ref name="prod:variety">{{Cite news |url= https://variety.com/2024/film/global/sex-dag-johan-haugerud-berlin-festival-1235874973/ |title= Let's Talk About 'Sex': Dag Johan Haugerud Discusses 'Sincere, Truthful and Shameless' First Part of Trilogy as It Scores Berlinale Premiere, Debuts Trailer (EXCLUSIVE) |author= Marta Balaga |work= [[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |date= 2024-01-17 |access-date= 2025-01-22 |language= en |archive-date= 2025-01-22 |archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20250122102448/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/sex-dag-johan-haugerud-berlin-festival-1235874973/ |url-status= live }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年10月4日在挪威院线上映<ref name="rel:nfi">{{Cite web |url=https://www.nfi.no/en/films/drommer |title=Dreams |date=2024-09-17 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website={{tsl|en|Norwegian Film Institute||Norwegian Film Institute}} |language=en |archive-date=2025-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121144341/https://www.nfi.no/en/films/drommer |url-status=live }}</ref>。电影入选[[第75届柏林影展]]主竞赛单元，于2025年2月19日在电影节上全球首映<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/472576 |title=The Berlinale unveils the titles playing in its Competition and its Perspectives and Berlinale Special strands |author=Davide Abbatescianni |date=2025-01-21 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en |archive-date=2025-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121185226/https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/472576/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2025/01/berlin-film-festival-competition-line-up-2025-follow-live-1236262137/ |title=Berlin Film Festival Lineup: Richard Linklater, Jessica Chastain, A$AP Rocky & Marion Cotillard Movies Among Vibrant Selection |last=Ntim |first=Zac |date=2025-01-21 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood|Deadline]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-01-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250122050713/https://deadline.com/2025/01/berlin-film-festival-competition-line-up-2025-follow-live-1236262137/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.berlinale.de/en/2025/programme/202516839.html |title=Dreams (Sex Love) |work=Berlinale |date=2025-02-04 |access-date=2025-02-19 |archive-date=2025-02-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250212002833/https://www.berlinale.de/en/2025/programme/202516839.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。电影定于2025年5月8日在德国上映，由阿拉莫德影业（Alamode Film）发行<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.filmstarts.de/kritiken/308471.html |title=Oslo-Stories: TRÄUME |trans-title=Oslo Stories: DREAMS |date=2024-09-12 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website=Film Starts |language=de |archive-date=2025-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121143759/https://www.filmstarts.de/kritiken/308471.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==评价==
[[File:Dag Johan Haugerud with Golden Bear-4.jpg|thumb|200px|[[达格·约翰·豪格鲁德]]凭借电影拿下[[金熊奖]]]]
《[[卫报]]》影评人彼得·布拉德肖（Peter Bradshaw）给出4/5星评价，认为电影狡黠、对白多、好玩，与[[卢卡斯·穆迪森]]早期执导的《[[同窗的爱]]》有异曲同工之妙<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2025/feb/19/drommer-dreams-review-berlin-film-festival |title=Drømmer (Dreams) review – teen’s high romantic hopes throw adults into disarray  |first=Peter |last= Bradshaw|date=1 pp February 2025|access-date=2025-02-23|website= [[卫报|The Guardian]] |language=en}}</ref>。

豪格鲁德在一年内完成三部风格各异的电影，展现了艺术创作的多样性，这种创作自由和实验精神在全球艺术界都有共鸣。<ref>{{cite web |url=https://yololab.net/2025/02/24/dreams-sex-love/ |title=写给奥斯陆的情书《关于梦（性与爱）》勇擒柏林金熊奖 |author=YOLOLab |date=2025-02-28 |access-date=2025-02-28}}</ref>

