== 制作 ==
2018年3月，[[丹尼·维勒纳夫]]表示他的目标是将原著小说《[[沙丘 (小说)|沙丘]]》改编成两部电影<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.slashfilm.com/denis-villeneuve-dune-remake-two-films/|title=At Least Two ''Dune'' Films Are Being Planned by Denis Villeneuve|last=Bui|first=Hoai-Tran|date=2018-03-09|website=[[Slash Film]]|access-date=2021-10-26|archive-date=2018-05-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180522042236/http://www.slashfilm.com/denis-villeneuve-dune-remake-two-films/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。维勒纳夫最终与[[华纳兄弟]]达成了两部电影的协议，两片风格类似于[[史蒂芬·金]]的小说《[[牠 (小说)|牠]]》的两部改编电影《[[牠 (电影)|牠]]》（2017年）和《[[牠：第二章]]》（2019年）<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/2020/04/behold-dune-an-exclusive-look-at-timothee-chalamet-zendaya-oscar-isaac|title=Behold ''Dune'': An Exclusive Look at Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, Oscar Isaac, and More|first=Anthony|last=Breznican|date=2020-04-14|website=[[Vanity Fair (magazine)|Vanity Fair]]|access-date=2021-10-26|archive-date=2020-04-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200414123142/https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/2020/04/behold-dune-an-exclusive-look-at-timothee-chalamet-zendaya-oscar-isaac|dead-url=no}}</ref>。《沙丘：第二部》将由维勒纳夫、{{le|玛丽·帕伦|Mary Parent}}和凯尔·波伊特（{{lang|en|Cale Boyter}}）制片，{{le|谭雅·拉波因特|Tanya Lapointe}}、{{le|布莱恩·赫伯特|Brian Herbert}}、拜伦·梅里特（{{lang|en|Byron Merritt}}）、金·赫伯特（{{lang|en|Kim Herbert}}）、[[汤玛士·塔尔]]、[[乔·斯派茨]]、{{le|理查·P·鲁宾斯坦|Richard P. Rubinstein}}、{{le|约翰·哈里森 )(导演)|John Harrison (director)|约翰·哈里森}}和赫伯特·W·盖恩（{{lang|en|Herbert W. Gain}}）担任执行制片人，而[[凯文·J·安德森]]担任创意顾问<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2019/02/warner-bros-dates-dune-for-november-2020-more-1202558747/|title=Warner Bros. Dates ''Dune'' For November 2020 & More|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|date=2019-02-16|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2021-10-26|archive-date=2019-02-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190216063302/https://deadline.com/2019/02/warner-bros-dates-dune-for-november-2020-more-1202558747/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2021年2月，[[艾瑞克·罗斯]]表示他已经为潜在的续集剧本<ref>{{cite web|date=2021-04-12|title='Dune' Co-Writer Eric Roth Says the Sci-Fi Adaptation Is “Spectacular," Talks Sequel|url=https://collider.com/dune-movie-update-eric-roth-interview/|access-date=2021-10-26|website=[[Collider (website)|Collider]]|archive-date=2021-04-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210412170454/https://collider.com/dune-movie-update-eric-roth-interview/amp/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。8月，维勒纳夫确认开始为续集编写剧本<ref>{{cite web|last=Massuda|first=Lauren|date=2021-08-19|title=Dune 2 Script Is Being Written, Reveals Denis Villeneuve|url=https://collider.com/dune-2-movie-script-denis-villeneuve/|access-date=2021-10-26|website=Collider|archive-date=2021-08-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210819040755/https://collider.com/dune-2-movie-script-denis-villeneuve/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。10月，[[传奇影业]]正式为《沙丘：第二部》亮起[[绿灯 (电影制作)|绿灯]]<ref>{{Cite web|last=McClintock|first=Aaron Couch,Pamela|last2=Couch|first2=Aaron|last3=McClintock|first3=Pamela|date=2021-10-26|title=‘Dune 2’ a Go From Legendary, Warner Bros.|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/dune-2-greenlit-movie-release-date-1235036655/|access-date=2021-10-26|website=The Hollywood Reporter|archive-date=2022-03-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220324122300/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/dune-2-greenlit-movie-release-date-1235036655/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

