 |archive-date=2022-06-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220621172417/https://deadline.com/2022/06/dune-part-2-lea-seydoux-to-play-lady-margot-in-upcoming-sequel-for-legendary-1235048753/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，而[[史戴伦·史柯斯嘉]]和[[巴帝斯塔|戴夫·巴帝斯塔]]回归出演<ref>{{Cite web |last=B. Vary |first=Adam |title=Léa Seydoux Joins ‘Dune Part Two’ as Lady Margot |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-part-two-lea-seydoux-lady-margot-1235299805/ |website=[[Variety]] |access-date=2022-06-23 |date=2022-06-21 |archive-date=2022-09-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220907203601/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-part-two-lea-seydoux-lady-margot-1235299805/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。7月，[[苏海拉·雅各布]]签约饰演[[弗瑞曼人|施舍克里]]<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |title='Dune Part Two': Souheila Yacoub Latest To Join Legendary Sequel |url=https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-souheila-yacoub-1235064119/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-07-14 |date=2022-07-14 |archive-date=2022-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220714181832/https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-souheila-yacoub-1235064119/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，而[[夏绿蒂·兰普琳]]和{{le|史蒂芬·麦金利·亨德森|Stephen McKinley Henderson}}回归出演<ref>{{Cite web |last=Complex |first=Valerie |title=‘Dune: Part Two’ Has Begun Production With Expanded Cast Including Florence Pugh, Austin Butler & Christopher Walken |url=https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-has-begun-production-1235072029/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-07-20 |date=2022-07-18 |archive-date=2022-09-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220929193143/https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-has-begun-production-1235072029/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年1月，[[提姆·布莱克·尼尔森]]参演<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/dune-part-2-casts-time-blake-nelson-1235292182/ |title=Tim Blake Nelson Joins Denis Villeneuve's 'Dune: Part 2' (Exclusive) |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |last=Kit |first=Borys |date=2023-01-06 |access-date=2023-01-06 |archive-date=2023-01-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230106205014/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/dune-part-2-casts-time-blake-nelson-1235292182/ |dead-url=no}}</ref>。

=== 拍摄 ===
2022年7月4日开始在[[阿尔蒂沃莱]]进行为期两天的前期拍摄<ref name="Filming">{{cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-production-italy-1235057506/ |title='Dune: Part Two' Ramping Up Production This Month |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |first=Anthony |last=D'Alessandro |date=2022-07-03 |access-date=2022-07-05 |archive-date=2022-07-04 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220704223528/https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-production-italy-1235057506/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2022年7月18日于[[布达佩斯]]开始进行[[主体拍摄]]<ref name="Filming" /><ref name="start">{{Cite web |last=Sharf |first=Zack |date=2022-07-18 |title=''Dune: Part Two'' Starts Filming: Full Cast and Synopsis Revealed, Oscar-Winning Crafts Team Returns |website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-2-filming-full-cast-synopsis-1235319029/ |access-date=2022-07-18 |archive-date=2022-07-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220718185833/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-2-filming-full-cast-synopsis-1235319029/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mishra |first=Shrishty |date=2022-07-18 |title=''Dune: Part 2'': Production Begins on Epic Sci-Fi Sequel |website=[[Collider (website)|Collider]] |url=https://collider.com/dune-part-2-production-start-warner-bros/ |access-date=2022-07-18 |archive-date=2022-07-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220718192456/https://collider.com/dune-part-2-production-start-warner-bros/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，并于2022年12月12日[[杀青]]<ref>{{cite web |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-part-two-wraps-filmingtimothee-chalamet-1235457990/ |title='Dune: Part Two' Wraps Production, Timothée Chalamet Announces |last=Zee |first=Michaela |date=2022-12-12 |website=[[Variety]] |access-date=2022-12-18 |dead-url=no |archive-date=2022-12-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221212182152/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-part-two-wraps-filmingtimothee-chalamet-1235457990/ }}</ref>。

