==制作==
2022年6月14日，宣布[[妮可·基嫚]]、[[柴克·艾弗隆]]和[[乔伊·金]]将领衔主演一部未命名的喜剧电影，由{{le|理查·拉葛瑞夫尼斯|Richard LaGravenese}}执导，拉葛瑞夫尼斯和凯莉·所罗门（Carrie Solomon）共同编剧。本电影由《[[爱爱爱上你]]》的制作公司之一{{le|罗斯/基申鲍姆影业|Roth/Kirschenbaum Films}}为[[Netflix]]制作，{{le|乔·罗斯|Joe Roth}}、{{le|杰夫·基申鲍姆|Jeff Kirschenbaum}}和艾莉莎·奥特曼（Alyssa Altman）担任电影监制<ref>{{cite news |url=https://deadline.com/2022/06/nicole-kidman-zac-efron-joey-king-netflix-1235044848/|title=Nicole Kidman, Zac Efron And Joey King To Star In New Comedy For Netflix|first=Justin|last=Kroll|date=2022-06-14 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood|Deadline]]|access-date=2024-04-29|archive-date=2022-06-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220614193927/https://deadline.com/2022/06/nicole-kidman-zac-efron-joey-king-netflix-1235044848/|url-status=live|language=en}}</ref>。2022年8月2日，[[凯西·贝兹]]和[[莱莎·寇希]]加入剧组，分别饰演扎菈的祖母和挚友<ref>{{cite news |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/kathy-bates-liza-koshy-netflix-nicole-kidman-zac-efron-1235333489/|title=Kathy Bates and Liza Koshy Join Untitled Netflix Rom-Com Starring Nicole Kidman, Zac Efron and Joey King|first=Wilson|last=Chapman|date=2022-08-02 |website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|access-date=2024-04-29|archive-date=2022-08-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220802193927/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/kathy-bates-liza-koshy-netflix-nicole-kidman-zac-efron-1235333489/|url-status=live|language=en}}</ref>。

电影[[主体拍摄]]于2022年8月开始至10月结束，主要取景地点在[[乔治亚州]][[亚特兰大]]<ref>{{Cite web |date=2022-07-07 |title=#1308 07/21 |url=https://www.productionweekly.com/072122im.pdf |access-date=2023-09-14 |website=Production Weekly |language=en |archive-date=2022-10-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221008193537/https://www.productionweekly.com/072122im.pdf |dead-url=yes }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Ho |first=Rodney |date=2022-10-17|title=What's filming in Georgia in October, 2022? |url=https://www.ajc.com/life/radiotvtalk-blog/whats-filming-in-georgia-in-october-2022/HR7UU6VWTNDOXEOZKN4SISL5WA/ |access-date=2023-09-15|archive-date=2022-10-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221017193927/https://www.ajc.com/life/radiotvtalk-blog/whats-filming-in-georgia-in-october-2022/HR7UU6VWTNDOXEOZKN4SISL5WA/|website=The Atlanta Journal-Constitution|language=en}}</ref>。2024年3月，因恶劣天气影响，剧组在[[加利福尼亚州]][[马里布]]重新进行额外拍摄<ref>{{cite web |author1=Kasey Moore |title=Nicole Kidman and Zac Efron Return to Filming 'A Family Affair' Ahead of 2024 Netflix Release |url=https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/nicole-kidman-and-zac-efron-return-to-filming-a-family-affair-ahead-of-2024-release/ |website=What's on Netflix |accessdate=2024-06-03 |language=en |date=2024-03-06 |archive-date=2024-04-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240403095231/https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/nicole-kidman-and-zac-efron-return-to-filming-a-family-affair-ahead-of-2024-release/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==发行==
《非常家务事》原先预定于2023年11月17日在[[Netflix]]上映<ref>{{cite news |last=Remley |first=Hilary |date=2023-01-18 |title=Joey King Is Caught in 'A Family Affair' in New Image from Netflix Rom-Com |work=[[Collider (website)|Collider]] |url=https://collider.com/a-family-affair-image-joey-king-nicole-kidman-zac-efron/ |access-date=2023-08-01 |language=en |archive-date=2023-01-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230118193927/https://collider.com/a-family-affair-image-joey-king-nicole-kidman-zac-efron/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，却受到{{le|2023年美国演员工会大罢工影响|2023 SAG-AFTRA strike}}而延后电影上映日期<ref>{{Cite web |last=Marshall|first=Carrie|date=2023-08-01 |title=Netflix delays the release of six movies amid the writers' and actors' strike |url=https://www.techradar.com/streaming/netflix-delays-the-release-of-six-movies-amid-the-writers-and-actors-strike |language=en |access-date=2024-05-04|archive-date=2023-08-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230801193927/https://www.techradar.com/streaming/netflix-delays-the-release-of-six-movies-amid-the-writers-and-actors-strike|url-status=live|website=TechRadar}}</ref>。2024年2月，电影出现在Netflix的「2024年即将上映清单」（Next on Netflix）<ref>{{cite web |title=Get Ready to See What's Coming to Netflix in 2024 |url=https://www.netflix.com/tudum/movies-shows-netflix-2024 |website=Netflix Tudum |accessdate=2024-06-03 |language=en |date=2024-02-07 |archive-date=2024-01-31 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240131182455/https://www.netflix.com/tudum/movies-shows-netflix-2024 |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同年4月，《非常家务事》的上映日期确认为2024年6月28日<ref name="b">{{cite news |url=https://people.com/nicole-kidman-zac-efron-have-paperboy-reunion-in-a-family-affair-exclusive-8639733|title=Nicole Kidman and Zac Efron Rekindle Their Paperboy Spark in A Family Affair: Exclusive First Look|first=Esme|last=Mazzeo|date=2024-04-29 |website=[[People (magazine)|People]] |language=en|access-date=2024-04-29|archive-date=2024-04-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240429193927/https://people.com/nicole-kidman-zac-efron-have-paperboy-reunion-in-a-family-affair-exclusive-8639733|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.thenews.com.pk/latest/1183673-zac-efron-reflects-on-being-paired-with-nicole-kidman-in-a-family-affair|title=Zac Efron reflects on being paired with Nicole Kidman in 'A Family Affair'|first=Web|last=Desk|date=2024-04-29 |website=[[The News International]]|access-date=2024-05-04|archive-date=2024-04-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240429193927/https://www.thenews.com.pk/latest/1183673-zac-efron-reflects-on-being-paired-with-nicole-kidman-in-a-family-affair|url-status=live|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a60640131/zac-efron-nicole-kidman-family-affair-release-date/|title=Zac Efron and Nicole Kidman's Netflix rom-com confirms release date|first=Brenna|last=Cooper|date=2024-04-30 |website=[[Digital Spy]]|access-date=2024-05-04|archive-date=2024-04-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240430193927/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a60640131/zac-efron-nicole-kidman-family-affair-release-date/|url-status=live|language=en}}</ref>。5月29日，电影首支预告上线<ref>{{cite web |title=A Family Affair Official Trailer |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ytc2eifpiuQ |website=www.youtube.com |publisher=Netflix |accessdate=2024-06-03 |language=en |date=2024-05-29 |archive-date=2024-12-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241225205852/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ytc2eifpiuQ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

