《'''飞月情海'''》（{{langx|en|''Fly Me to the Moon''}}）是一部2024年美国[[爱情片|浪漫]][[喜剧片|喜剧剧情片]]，由[[葛瑞格·贝兰提]]执导，萝丝·吉洛伊（{{lang|en|Rose Gilroy}}）编写剧本；剧情讲述了20世纪60年代[[太空竞赛]]期间行销专家和[[NASA]]主管之间的关系。电影主演阵容包括[[史嘉蕾·乔韩森]]、[[查宁·塔图]]、{{le|吉姆·罗许|Jim Rash}}、安娜·贾西亚（{{lang|en|Anna Garcia}}）、唐纳·艾利斯·华金斯（{{lang|en|Donald Elise Watkins}}）、{{le|诺亚·罗宾斯|Noah Robbins}}、[[柯林·伍德尔]]、克里斯蒂安·朱伯（{{lang|en|Christian Zuber}}）、尼克·迪伦堡（{{lang|en|Nick Dillenburg}}）、[[雷·罗曼诺]]与[[伍迪·哈里逊]]。

《飞月情海》2024年7月8日在[[纽约市]]AMC林肯广场（{{lang|en|AMC Lincoln Square}}）首映，2024年7月12日在美国和加拿大院线上映，之后于[[Apple TV+]]上线<ref name="variety">{{cite web|title=Sony Dates Scarlett Johansson-Channing Tatum Film, George Clooney and Brad Pitt's 'Wolfs' for 2024|website=Variety|first=Pat|last=Saperstein|date=2023-12-21|access-date=2023-12-22|url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/scarlett-johansson-project-artemis-george-clooney-wolfs-2024-release-dates-1235849230/|archive-date=2023-12-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231222102400/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/scarlett-johansson-project-artemis-george-clooney-wolfs-2024-release-dates-1235849230/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-12-13 |title=Sony Wins Global Theatrical Distribution Deal For Apple's George Clooney & Brad Pitt Pic 'Wolfs' & Scarlett Johansson & Channing Tatum's 'Project Artemis' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/apple-sony-wolfs-project-artemis-theatrical-distribution-deal-1235666711/ |access-date=2024-02-28 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-05-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240530115202/https://deadline.com/2023/12/apple-sony-wolfs-project-artemis-theatrical-distribution-deal-1235666711/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://people.com/scarlett-johansson-channing-tatum-fly-me-to-the-moon-first-look-exclusive-8625419|title=Scarlett Johansson and Channing Tatum Pair Up for the First Time in Fly Me to the Moon First Look (Exclusive)|publisher=People.com|access-date=2024-07-11|archive-date=2024-07-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240710053616/https://people.com/scarlett-johansson-channing-tatum-fly-me-to-the-moon-first-look-exclusive-8625419|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Scarlett Johansson and Colin Jost Join Channing Tatum on the Red Carpet for Fly Me to the Moon Premiere |url=https://people.com/scarlett-johansson-colin-jost-channing-tatum-hit-the-red-carpet-for-fly-me-to-the-moon-premiere-in-ny