《'''异教诡屋'''》（{{langx|en|''Heretic''}}）是一部2024年美国[[心理恐怖|心理恐怖片]]，由{{le|史考特·贝克和布莱恩·伍兹|Scott Beck and Bryan Woods}}编导，[[休·葛兰]]、[[苏菲·蔡彻]]和{{le|克洛伊·伊丝特|Chloe East}}主演。电影讲述[[耶稣基督后期圣徒教会]]的两名[[传教士 (耶稣基督后期圣徒教会)|传教士]]试图改变一位隐居英国人的信仰，却发现对方比表面上看起来更危险的故事。

《异教诡屋》2024年9月8日在{{le|2024年多伦多国际影展|2024 Toronto International Film Festival|多伦多国际影展}}上举行全球首映，2024年11月8日由[[A24 (公司)|A24]]发行于美国院线。电影在影评界取得普遍好评。

== 演员 ==
* [[休·葛兰]]饰演里德先生（{{lang|en|Mr. Reed}}）<ref name="Trailer">{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2024-06-25 |title=''Heretic'' Trailer: Hugh Grant Lures Pair Of Missionaries Into Cat-And-Mouse Game In A24 Horror Film From ''A Quiet Place'' Duo |url=https://deadline.com/video/heretic-trailer-hugh-grant-a24/ |access-date=2024-06-25 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2024-10-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241002063224/https://deadline.com/video/heretic-trailer-hugh-grant-a24/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>
* [[苏菲·蔡彻]]饰演巴恩斯修女（{{lang|en|Sister Barnes}}）<ref name="Trailer"/>
* {{le|克洛伊·伊丝特|Chloe East}}饰演帕克斯顿修女（{{lang|en|Sister Paxton}}）<ref name="Trailer"/>
* [[托弗·格雷斯]]饰演甘迺迪长老（{{lang|en|Elder Kennedy}}）<ref>{{cite web|url=https://press.a24films.com/films/heretic|title=Heretic|website=[[A24 (公司)|A24 Publicity]]|access-date=2024-09-09|archive-date=2024-09-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240909154552/https://press.a24films.com/films/heretic|dead-url=no}}</ref>
* 艾拉·扬（{{lang|en|Elle Young}}）饰演先知（{{lang|en|Prophet}}）<ref>{{Cite web |last=Hullender |first=Tatiana |date=2024-09-25 |title=Hugh Grant & Heretic Team Talk Exploring Mormonism Through A Horror Lens [TIFF] |url=https://screenrant.com/heretic-hugh-grant-sophie-thatcher-tiff-2024-interview/ |access-date=2024-10-19 |website=ScreenRant |language=en |archive-date=2024-09-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240930223122/https://screenrant.com/heretic-hugh-grant-sophie-thatcher-tiff-2024-interview/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>
* [[艾莉·麦金侬]]饰演联谊会女孩（{{lang|en|Sorority Girl}}）

== 制作 ==
据2023年6月的报导，{{le|史考特·贝克和布莱恩·伍兹|Scott Beck and Bryan Woods}}将为[[A24 (公司)|A24]]电影《异教诡屋》编写剧本并执导。该片由[[休·葛兰]]和{{le|克洛伊·伊丝特|Chloe East}}主演。<ref name="THR1">{{Cite web |last=Galuppo |first=Mia |date=2023-06-09 |title=''The Fabelmans'' Breakout Chloe East in Talks for A24 Thriller from Scott Beck, Bryan Woods (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/a24-thriller-heretic-chloe-east-1235510779/ |access-date=2023-06-10 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2023-06-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230610155400/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/a24-thriller-heretic-chloe-east-1235510779/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

本片获得了一份临时协议，允许在[[2023年SAG-AFTRA大罢工]]期间进行拍摄<ref>{{cite web |url=https://deadline.com/feature/sag-aftra-interim-agreements-list-movies-tv-series-1235446661/ |title=SAG-AFTRA Interim Agreements: Full List Of Movies And TV Series |website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Patrick |last=Hipes |date=2023-08-16 |access-date=2023-08-18 |archive-date=2023-07-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230725010318/https://deadline.com/feature/sag-aftra-interim-agreements-list-movies-tv-series-1235446661/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2023年10月3日至11月16日，《异教诡屋》以不足1000万美元的制作预算<ref>{{Cite web|date=2024-11-10|last=Coyle|first=Jake|title=''Heretic'' and Hugh Grant debut with $11 million, but ''Venom: The Last Dance'' tops box office again|url=https://apnews.com/article/box-office-heretic-venom-last-dance-christmas-pageant-954b7e1b4812ff960759ef0ae8324208|access-date=2024-11-11|website=[[Associated Press]]|archive-date=2024-11-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241112212141/https://apnews.com/article/box-office-heretic-venom-last-dance-christmas-pageant-954b7e1b4812ff960759ef0ae8324208|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[温哥华]]进行[[主要拍摄]]，历时30天<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-08-18|title=In Production British Columbia|url=https://creativebc.com/services/provincial-film-commission/in-production/ |access-date=2023-08-21 |website=[[Creative BC Film Commission]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230821163202/http://web.archive.org/screenshot/https://creativebc.com/services/provincial-film-commission/in-production|archive-date=2023-08-21|url-status=dead}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Kay |first=Jeremy |title=Directors Scott Beck, Bryan Woods talk courting Hugh Grant for their TIFF religion horror ''Heretic'' |url=https://www.screendaily.com/features/directors-scott-beck-bryan-woods-talk-courting-hugh-grant-for-their-tiff-religion-horror-heretic/5196988.article |access-date=2024-09-08 |website=[[国际银幕|Screen Daily]] |archive-date=2025-02-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250202142223/https://www.screendaily.com/features/directors-scott-beck-bryan-woods-talk-courting-hugh-grant-for-their-tiff-religion-horror-heretic/5196988.article |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
《异教诡屋》2024年9月8日在{{le|2024年多伦多国际影展|2024 Toronto International Film Festival|多伦多国际影展}}上举行全球首映<ref name="tiff2">{{cite web |url=https://tiff.net/events/heretic |title=Heretic |website=[[多伦多国际影展|Toronto International Film Festival]] |access-date=2024-08-15 |archive-date=2025-10-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251006105113/https://tiff.net/events/heretic |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="tiff">{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-07-22 |title=TIFF Galas & Special Presentations Lineup Includes World Premieres From Angelina Jolie, Mike Leigh, Gia Coppola; Starry Pics With Jennifer Lopez, Lily James, Dave Bautista; Int'='l Premieres ''Conclave'' & ''Piece By Piece'', More |url=https://deadline.com/2024/07/2024-toronto-film-festival-lineup-movies-list-1236017283/ |access-date=2024-07-23 |website=Deadline Hollywood}}</ref>。本片原定2024年11月15日在美国院线上映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/05/a24-the-front-room-a-different-man-we-live-in-time-heretic-baby-girl-1235944716/|title=A24 Dates Fall & Holiday Slate With 'The Front Room', 'A Different Man', 'We Live In Time', 'Heretic' & 'Baby Girl'|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Anthony|last=D’Alessandro|date=2024-05-30|access-date=2024-05-30|archive-date=2024-05-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240530164145/https://deadline.com/2024/05/a24-the-front-room-a-different-man-we-live-in-time-heretic-baby-girl-1235944716/|url-status=live}}</ref>，之后提前至11月8日<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3831868/heretic-release-date-and-trailer-2nd-hugh-grant/|title=''Heretic'' 2nd Trailer Brings New Release Date and Closer Look at Hugh Grant's Sinister Villain|first=Megan|last=Navarro|website=[[Bloody Disgusting]]|date=2024-09-19|access-date=2024-09-19|archive-date=2025-08-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250826160759/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3831868/heretic-release-date-and-trailer-2nd-hugh-grant/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

