《'''地平线：美国传奇 第一部'''》（{{langx|en|''Horizon: An American Saga – Chapter 1''}}）是2024年美国[[史诗片|史诗]][[西部片]]，由[[凯文·科斯特纳]]自编自导自演，是《[[地平线：美国传奇]]》四部曲的第一部。本片有著庞大的演员阵容，包含[[丝安娜·美娜]]、[[山姆·沃辛顿]]、[[吉娜·玛隆]]、[[艾比·丽·科肖]]、[[迈克尔·鲁克]]、[[丹尼·休斯顿]]、[[卢克·威尔逊]]、[[伊莎贝拉·弗尔曼]]与[[杰夫·法赫]]等人。本片的剧情设定在[[南北战争]]时的美国西部。

本片于2024年6月28日在美国上映。

== 演员 ==
{{see also|地平线：美国传奇#演员}}

== 制作 ==
{{see also|地平线：美国传奇#发展}}
本片于2022年8月29日在[[犹他州]]南部开拍<ref name="August12">{{Cite web |last=Fleming |first=Mike Jr. |date=2022-08-12 |title=Sienna Miller, Sam Worthington Saddle Up As Leads For Kevin Costner's ''Horizon'' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/08/sienna-miller-sam-worthington-kevin-costner-horizon-jamie-campbell-bower-yellowstone-1235091034/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221008175237/https://deadline.com/2022/08/sienna-miller-sam-worthington-kevin-costner-horizon-jamie-campbell-bower-yellowstone-1235091034/ |archive-date=2022-10-08 |access-date=2022-08-12 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>，11月结束<ref>{{Cite web |last=Fixsen |first=Rachel |date=2022-08-04 |title="Horizon" filming this fall: Big budget movie to hire locals as extras |url=https://moabsunnews.com/2022/08/04/big-budget-movie-to-hire-locals-as-extras/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220814011134/https://moabsunnews.com/2022/08/04/big-budget-movie-to-hire-locals-as-extras/ |archive-date=2022-08-14 |access-date=2022-08-13 |website=Moab Sun News}}</ref>。

== 上映 ==

2023年10月，报导称本片将于2024年6月28日在美国上映<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-10-05 |title=Kevin Costner Western ‘Horizon: An American Saga’ To Hit Theaters In Two Chapters |url=https://deadline.com/2023/10/kevin-costner-horizon-an-american-saga-release-date-1235565013/ |access-date=2024-01-10 |website=Deadline |language= |archive-date=2024-06-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240627181949/https://deadline.com/2023/10/kevin-costner-horizon-an-american-saga-release-date-1235565013/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同月稍晚，宣布《地平线》的国际版权代理将在{{tsl|en|American Film Market||American Film Market}}上待价而沽，相关交易由K5 Media Group旗下的K5 International经手<ref>{{cite web|title=Kevin Costner's Epic Western 'Horizon: An American Saga' Will Be On Sale For International Buyers At AFM|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|date=2023-10-24|access-date=2023-10-25|url=https://deadline.com/2023/10/kevin-costner-western-movie-horizon-american-saga-afm-sales-deals-1235582091/|archive-date=2023-11-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231103190042/https://deadline.com/2023/10/kevin-costner-western-movie-horizon-american-saga-afm-sales-deals-1235582091/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

本片于2024年5月19日在[[第77届坎城影展|第77届]][[戛纳电影节]]首映（非竞赛片）<ref>{{Cite web |title=Kevin Costner’s Western Epic ‘Horizon’ Sets Cannes Film Festival Premiere |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/kevin-costner-horizon-an-american-saga-cannes-film-festival-1235964084/ |website=Variety |date=2024-04-08 |last=Shafer |first=Ellise |access-date=2024-04-09 |archive-date=2024-06-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240613034806/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/kevin-costner-horizon-an-american-saga-cannes-film-festival-1235964084/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，映毕后得到7分钟的[[起立致敬]]<ref>{{Cite web |title=Kevin Costner Can’t Hold Back Tears as His Western Epic ‘Horizon’ Earns 7-Minute Cannes Standing Ovation, Promises ‘3 More’ Installments |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/kevin-costner-cannes-standing-ovation-horizon-an-american-saga-1236009400/ |website=Variety |date=2024-05-19 |language= |last=Siegel |first=Tatiana |last2=Lang |first2=Brent |access-date=2024-05-21 |archive-date=2024-07-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240713113320/https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/kevin-costner-cannes-standing-ovation-horizon-an-american-saga-1236009400/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 评价 ==

[[烂番茄]]根据119条评论，本片获得46%的新鲜度，平均得分5.6／10<ref>{{Cite Rotten Tomatoes|title=
Horizon: An American Saga – Chapter 1|id=horizon_an_american_saga_chapter_1|type=movie|access-date=2024-07-01}}</ref>。在[[Metacritic]]上，本片获得48分<ref>{{Cite Metacritic|id=horizon-an-american-saga---chapter-1|type=movie|title=Horizon: An American Saga - Chapter 1|access-date=2024-07-01}}</ref>。据美国[[影院评分|CinemaScore]]所进行的调查，观众的平均评价于A+至F间落于「B-」<ref>{{Cite web |title=‘A Quiet Place: Day One’ Easily Scares Up $53M Franchise Opening Record, But ‘Inside Out 2’ Has Last Laugh With Third No. 1 Win At $57M+ – Sunday AM Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/06/box-office-a-quiet-place-day-one-horizon-1235985586/ |website=Deadline |date=2024-06-30 |language= |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |access-date=2024-07-01 |archive-date=2024-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240714214002/https://deadline.com/2024/06/box-office-a-quiet-place-day-one-horizon-1235985586/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

