== 制作 ==
桑恩布伦开始接受[[性别肯定激素治疗]]约3个月后著手撰写《怪奇粉红物语》剧本。当时，他在[[出柜]]成为[[跨性别者]]后正经历所形容的「压倒性的混乱」。为呈现跨性别主题，桑恩布伦刻意避免直接以[[性别过渡]]或出柜作为剧情核心，而是采用{{le|寓言|allegory}}方式呈现，以区别于其他探讨相关议题的电影。<ref name="new-yorker">{{Cite magazine |last=Seidlitz |first=Holden |date=June 10, 2024 |title=Jane Schoenbrun Finds Horror Close to Home |url=https://www.newyorker.com/culture/persons-of-interest/jane-schoenbrun-finds-horror-close-to-home |access-date=June 13, 2024 |magazine=[[The New Yorker]] |archive-date=2026-08-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260801220652/https://www.newyorker.com/culture/persons-of-interest/jane-schoenbrun-finds-horror-close-to-home |url-status=live }}</ref>

2021年，[[艾玛·史东]]及其丈夫{{le|戴夫·麦卡里|Dave McCary}}注意到本片剧本。桑恩布伦表示，两人「立即爱上这个剧本」。剧本其后向6家潜在制作伙伴寻求合作。<ref name="new-yorker"/>2021年10月，电影宣布由[[A24]]制作，桑恩布伦执导，史东与麦卡里则透过两人旗下的{{le|Fruit Tree|Fruit Tree (company)}}担任制片。<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2021-10-07 |title=A24 and Emma Stone's Fruit Tree Banner Reunite on Jane Schoenbrun's ''I Saw the TV Glow'' |url=https://deadline.com/2021/10/a24-emma-stones-fruit-tree-banner-jane-shoenbruns-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1234851361/ |access-date=2022-08-27 |website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}} |archive-date=2023-08-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230819195301/https://deadline.com/2021/10/a24-emma-stones-fruit-tree-banner-jane-shoenbruns-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1234851361/ |url-status=live }}</ref>2022年8月，官方宣布[[贾斯特·史密斯]]、{{le|杰克·海温|Jack Haven}}、{{le|海伦娜·霍华德|Helena Howard}}、[[丹妮尔·戴德维勒]]、{{le|安柏·班森|Amber Benson}}、伊恩·福尔曼、{{le|康纳·欧马利|Conner O'Malley}}、{{le|艾玛·波特纳|Emma Portner}}、{{le|丹尼·塔姆柏瑞利|Danny Tamberelli}}、{{le|菲比·布里吉斯|Phoebe Bridgers}}、{{le|林赛·乔丹|Lindsey Jordan}}、{{le|弗雷德·德斯特|Fred Durst}}、{{le|Sloppy Jane|Sloppy Jane}}成员海莉·达尔（Haley Dahl）及{{le|克莉丝蒂娜·埃斯凡迪亚里|Kristina Esfandiari}}加入演员阵容。<ref>{{cite magazine|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/justice-smith-brigette-lundy-paine-a24-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1235205246/|title=Justice Smith, Brigette Lundy-Paine Starring in A24 Horror Thriller ''I Saw the TV Glow'' (Exclusive)|magazine={{le|好莱坞报导|The Hollywood Reporter}}|first=Borys|last=Kit|date=2022-08-24|access-date=2022-08-27|archive-date=2023-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230329175902/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/justice-smith-brigette-lundy-paine-a24-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1235205246/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.indiewire.com/2022/08/jane-schoenbrun-i-saw-the-tv-glow-a24-cast-phoebe-bridgers-1234755258/|title=Phoebe Bridgers and Helena Howard Join Jane Schoenbrun's ''I Saw the TV Glow'' at A24|website={{le|IndieWire|IndieWire}}|first=Samantha|last=Bergeson|date=2022-08-24|access-date=2022-08-27|archive-date=2022-08-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220826214602/https://www.indiewire.com/2022/08/jane-schoenbrun-i-saw-the-tv-glow-a24-cast-phoebe-bridgers-1234755258/|url-status=live}}</ref>

[[主体拍摄]]于2022年7月至8月在[[纽泽西州]]进行。<ref>{{cite tweet|first=Jane|last=Schoenbrun|author-link=Jane Schoenbrun|user=janeschoenbrun|number=1546906646714228736|title=It's real!! We are making an @A24 movie this summer!!|date=2022-07-12|access-date=2022-08-27}}</ref><ref>{{cite tweet|first=Jane|last=Schoenbrun|author-link=Jane Schoenbrun|user=janeschoenbrun|number=1559918846672359426|title=That's a wrap :-)|date=2022-08-17|access-date=2022-08-27}}</ref><ref name="Locations">{{Cite web |last=Kuperinsky |first=Amy |date=2024-02-28 |title=See trailer for ''I Saw the TV Glow'', an A24 horror movie filmed in N.J. |url=https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2024/02/see-trailer-for-i-saw-the-tv-glow-an-a24-horror-movie-filmed-in-nj.html |access-date=2024-03-12 |website={{le|NJ.com|NJ.com}} |archive-date=2024-03-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240312141807/https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2024/02/see-trailer-for-i-saw-the-tv-glow-an-a24-horror-movie-filmed-in-nj.html |url-status=live }}</ref>拍摄地点包括{{le|维罗纳高中|Verona High School (New Jersey)}}、{{le|雪松格罗夫高中|Cedar Grove High School (New Jersey)}}及{{le|基恩斯堡游乐园|Keansburg, New Jersey|Keansburg Amusement Park}}。其他拍摄地点包括音乐场地{{le|The Saint|The Saint (music venue)}}及{{le|刘易斯营|Camp Lewis (New Jersey)}}。<ref name="Locations"/>《神力粉红》的片段以[[35毫米胶片]]拍摄，后于后期制作阶段转录至{{le|VHS|VHS}}及{{le|Betamax|Betamax}}格式。<ref name="shimmeringmemoryof90sTV">{{Cite web |url=https://www.thebeverlytheater.com/news/i-saw-the-tv-glow-a-shimmering-memory-of-90s-tv |title=I Saw the TV Glow: A Shimmering Memory of '90s TV – The Beverley Theater |access-date=2026-08-24 |archive-date=2026-08-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260822031350/https://www.thebeverlytheater.com/news/i-saw-the-tv-glow-a-shimmering-memory-of-90s-tv |url-status=live }}</ref>

== 音乐 ==
电影原创配乐由{{le|艾力克斯·G|Alex G}}创作。电影原声带收录{{le|卡洛琳·波拉契克|Caroline Polachek}}、{{le|Sloppy Jane|Sloppy Jane}}、{{le|菲比·布里吉斯|Phoebe Bridgers}}、{{le|克莉丝蒂娜·埃斯凡迪亚里|Kristina Esfandiari}}、{{le|Florist|Florist (band)}}、{{le|耶尔|yeule}}、{{le|Drab Majesty|Drab Majesty}}、{{le|Snail Mail|Snail Mail (musician)}}等艺人的歌曲。原声带于2024年5月10日发行，艾力克斯·G创作的配乐则于2024年5月16日发行。<ref>{{cite web |last=Keates |first=Emma |date=2024-04-25 |title=A24 shares new song from stellar ''I Saw the TV Glow'' soundtrack |url=https://www.avclub.com/i-saw-the-tv-glow-soundtrack-a24-florist-schoenbrun-1851433691 |access-date=2024-04-29 |website={{le|影音俱乐部|The A.V. Club}} |archive-date=2024-04-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240429091554/https://www.avclub.com/i-saw-the-tv-glow-soundtrack-a24-florist-schoenbrun-1851433691 |url-status=live }}</ref>

== 发行 ==
《怪奇粉红物语》于2024年1月18日在{{le|2024年日舞影展|2024 Sundance Film Festival}}「午夜」单元首映。<ref>{{cite web|title=Sundance Unveils Packed 2024 Lineup That Includes A.I., Pedro Pascal, Kristen Stewart, Satan, Devo & Steven Yeun|website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}}|first1=Anthony|first2=Dominic|last1=D'Alessandro|last2=Patten|date=2023-12-06|access-date=2023-12-06|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/2024-sundance-film-festival-lineup-movies-1235652869/|archive-date=2024-01-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119130630/https://deadline.com/2023/12/2024-sundance-film-festival-lineup-movies-1235652869/|url-status=live}}</ref>2024-02-20，电影亦于{{le|第74届柏林国际影展|74th Berlin International Film Festival}}「全景」单元放映，<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/berlin-film-festival-saoirse-ronan-danielle-deadwyler-paapa-essiedu-panorama-1235667699/|title=Berlin: Saoirse Ronan, Danielle Deadwyler & Paapa Essiedu Titles Set For Panorama Sidebar|website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}}|first=Zac|last=Ntim|date=2023-12-14|access-date=2023-12-14|archive-date=2023-12-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231221124230/https://deadline.com/2023/12/berlin-film-festival-saoirse-ronan-danielle-deadwyler-paapa-essiedu-panorama-1235667699/|url-status=live}}</ref>并于2024-03-10在{{le|西南偏南|South by Southwest}}放映。<ref>{{cite web |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'', SXSW 2024 Schedule |url=https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198597 |access-date=2024-02-07 |publisher={{le|西南偏南|South by Southwest}} |archive-date=2024-02-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207222056/https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198597 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-02-07 |title=SXSW 2024 Second Wave Includes Pics With Sydney Sweeney, Nicolas Cage, Camila Mendes & ''Monkey Man'' |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/ |access-date=2024-02-07 |website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}} |archive-date=2024-02-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207200930/https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

电影于2024年5月3日在美国部分影院限量上映，首轮上映地点包括纽约市及洛杉矶，<ref>{{cite web |last=Bergeson |first=Samantha |date=2024-02-28 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Trailer: Jane Schoenbrun Channels David Lynch and Late-Night Cable Nightmares for A24 Horror Movie |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/trailers/i-saw-the-tv-glow-trailer-jane-schoenbrun-a24-horror-movie-1234957945/ |access-date=2024-02-28 |website=IndieWire |archive-date=2024-05-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240515034131/https://www.indiewire.com/news/trailers/i-saw-the-tv-glow-trailer-jane-schoenbrun-a24-horror-movie-1234957945/ |url-status=live }}</ref>并于2024年5月17日扩大至全美及加拿大上映。<ref>{{cite tweet|number=1781352172845949139|title=Follow the glow  Jane Schoenbrun's groundbreaking horror #ISawTheTVGlow opens in NY/LA theaters May 3, nationwide May 17. Get tickets now|author=I Saw The TV Glow|user=tvglowmovie|date=2024-04-19|access-date=2024-04-19}}</ref>电影于2024年6月开放数位平台观看。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Egan |first=Toussaint |date=2024-06-14 |title=Netflix's ''Ultraman: Rising'', ''I Saw the TV Glow'', and every movie new to streaming this week |url=https://www.polygon.com/2024/6/14/24174156/new-movies-i-saw-the-tv-glow-ultraman-rising-netflix-monkey-man |access-date=2024-06-16 |website={{le|Polygon|Polygon (website)}} |archive-date=2024-10-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005202112/https://www.polygon.com/2024/6/14/24174156/new-movies-i-saw-the-tv-glow-ultraman-rising-netflix-monkey-man |url-status=live }}</ref>

电影由{{le|Stage 6 Films|Stage 6 Films}}负责国际院线发行，包括于2024年8月29日在澳洲及纽西兰上映。<ref>{{cite web |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' - Event Cinemas |url=https://www.eventcinemas.com.au/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |access-date=2024-07-14 |publisher={{le|Event Cinemas|Event Cinemas}} |archive-date=2024-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240714125252/https://www.eventcinemas.com.au/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' - Event Cinemas |url=https://www.eventcinemas.co.nz/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |access-date=2024-07-14 |publisher={{le|Event Cinemas|Event Cinemas}} |archive-date=2024-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240714125252/https://www.eventcinemas.co.nz/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |url-status=live }}</ref>英国及爱尔兰则由{{le|Park Circus Films}}共同发行，于2024年7月26日上映。<ref>{{cite web |last=Sarrubba |first=Stefania |date=2024-07-01 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' finally confirms UK release date |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a61468573/i-saw-the-tv-glow-uk-release-date/ |access-date=2024-07-20 |website=Digital Spy |archive-date=2024-07-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240720132418/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a61468573/i-saw-the-tv-glow-uk-release-date/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

==评价==
{{Rotten Tomatoes prose|85|7.6|236|ref=yes|consensus=独特的视觉美学强化了情感共鸣的叙事，《怪奇粉红物语》进一步确立了编导珍·舍恩布伦作为影坛新秀的地位。}}
{{Metacritic film prose|86|48|ref=yes}}

《[[综艺杂志]]》影评人盖伊·洛奇认为，《怪奇粉红物语》是一部「充满潜力的{{le|心理剧|psychological drama}}作品」，并延续桑恩布伦过往作品一贯关注的主题。<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Lodge |first=Guy |date=2024-01-19 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Review: Jane Schoenbrun's Eerie Ode to Adolescent Television Obsessions |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1235877715/ |access-date=2024-01-19 |magazine=[[综艺杂志]] |archive-date=2024-01-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119204349/https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1235877715/ |url-status=live }}</ref>《{{le|独立线|IndieWire}}》的{{le|大卫·埃利希|David Ehrlich}}则称本片为桑恩布伦「令人惊叹的第二部长片」，认为其在扩大规模探讨相关主题的同时，仍保留首部长片的低成本恐怖感，并进一步深化对未知的探索。<ref name="IndieWire">{{Cite web |last=Ehrlich |first=David |date=2024-01-19 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Review: Jane Schoenbrun's Second Feature Is a Haunting Look at What We See in Our Media |url=https://www.indiewire.com/criticism/movies/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1234946004/ |access-date=2024-01-19 |website=[[IndieWire]] |archive-date=2024-01-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119204350/https://web.archive.org/web/20240119204350/https://www.indiewire.com/criticism/movies/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1234946004/ |url-status=live }}</ref>部分影评人亦肯定电影对跨性别主题的呈现。《{{le|纽约客|The New Yorker}}》的{{le|理查德·布罗迪|Richard Brody}}称其为「对跨性别经验的深刻描绘」；《[[卫报]]》的维罗妮卡·埃斯波西托则认为本片「与90年代的跨性别青少年产生共鸣」。<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Brody |first=Richard |authorlink=Richard Brody |date=2024-05-03 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Is a Profound Vision of the Trans Experience |url=https://www.newyorker.com/culture/the-front-row/i-saw-the-tv-glow-is-a-profound-vision-of-the-trans-experience |magazine=[[The New Yorker]] |access-date=2026-08-24 |archive-date=2026-08-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260801170410/https://www.newyorker.com/culture/the-front-row/i-saw-the-tv-glow-is-a-profound-vision-of-the-trans-experience |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Esposito |first=Veronica |date=2024-05-04 |title=Nostalgia horror ''I Saw the TV Glow'' speaks to 90s trans teens like me |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/article/2024/may/04/i-saw-tv-glow-movie-trans-teen |access-date=2024-06-16 |newspaper=[[The Guardian]] |archive-date=2024-10-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005202118/https://www.theguardian.com/film/article/2024/may/04/i-saw-tv-glow-movie-trans-teen |url-status=live }}</ref>

《{{le|洛杉矶时报|Los Angeles Times}}》的艾米·尼科尔森批评本片充斥「沉重得令人想从自己的皮肤中爬出的场景」，并认为电影营造出一种强烈的矛盾感。<ref>{{cite news |last=Nicholson |first=Amy |date=2024-05-02 |title=Review: ''I Saw the TV Glow'' gets stranded in a glum gaze from which it never stirs |url=https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/movies/story/2024-05-02/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-jane-schoenbrun |accessdate=2024-05-17 |newspaper=[[Los Angeles Times]] |archive-date=2024-05-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240516232017/https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/movies/story/2024-05-02/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-jane-schoenbrun |url-status=live }}</ref>《{{le|视与听|Sight & Sound}}》的尼可拉斯·拉波德则认为，本片虽展现对整体构想的强烈感受，但未能充分将其落实。<ref>{{cite magazine |last=Rapold |first=Nicolas |date=2024-01-30 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'': a rough portrait of fanatical obsession |url=https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/reviews/i-saw-tv-glow-rough-portrait-fanatical-obsession |magazine=[[Sight & Sound]] |accessdate=2024-05-17 |archive-date=2024-05-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240518022844/https://web.archive.org/web/20240518022844/https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/reviews/i-saw-tv-glow-rough-portrait-fanatical-obsession |url-status=live }}</ref>《{{le|纽约观察家报|The New York Observer}}》的迪伦·罗斯则承认电影刻意营造的不适感，认为尽管自己不喜欢其中大部分内容，这些手法确实达到预期效果，因此仍可视为成功的艺术作品。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Roth |first=Dylan |date=2024-05-06 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Review: Moody, Interesting, No Fun |url=https://observer.com/2024/05/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-moody-interesting-no-fun/ |access-date=2024-06-16 |website=[[The New York Observer|Observer]] |archive-date=2024-10-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005202113/https://observer.com/2024/05/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-moody-interesting-no-fun/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

导演[[马丁·史柯西斯]]称赞本片「在情感与心理层面都具有强大力量」，并表示自己「非常喜欢」本片。<ref name=Scorsese>{{cite web |last=Coyle |first=Jake |date=2024-11-14 |title=Martin Scorsese on 'The Saints,' faith in filmmaking and what his next movie might be |website=apnews.com |url=https://apnews.com/article/martin-scorsese-saints-fox-df1b10e984c32c96a8eb0d0515b1d7c1 |access-date=2024-11-18 |archive-date=2024-11-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241114204637/https://apnews.com/article/martin-scorsese-saints-fox-df1b10e984c32c96a8eb0d0515b1d7c1 |url-status=live }}</ref>[[保罗·许瑞德]]则称桑恩布伦是「过去十年来电影界毫无疑问最具原创性的声音」，但也认为其作品「令人费解」。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Schrader |first=Paul |author-link=Paul Schrader |date=2024-05-05 |title=JANE SCHOEBRUN is hands down the most original voice in film in the last decade. But also confounding. Do "We're All Going to the World's Fair" and "I Saw the TV Glow" have a genuine niche in the commercial indie horror market or are they unicorns? Either way, they are a wonder to behold. |url=https://www.facebook.com/paul.schrader.900/posts/pfbid0JSjMitYGkeNYbsXp66fRnvXSrdTzPjiLcmLaqCQFTE729a7yfZx43wHoKfRshYJCl |access-date=2025-11-10 |publisher=Facebook}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Zilko |first=Christian |date=2024-06-19 |title=3 Lessons We've Learned at the Midpoint of a Strange Year for Horror Movies |url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/commentary/lessons-learned-state-of-horror-movies-2024-1235017815/ |access-date=2025-11-10 |website=[[IndieWire]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2026-08-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260807044640/https://www.indiewire.com/features/commentary/lessons-learned-state-of-horror-movies-2024-1235017815/ |url-status=live }}</ref>其他电影制作人，包括[[莉娜·丹恩]]、{{le|德鲁·汉考克|Drew_Hancock}}及[[帕斯卡·普朗特]]，亦对本片表示赞赏。<ref>{{cite news |last1=O'Flat |first1=Chris |title=65 Directors Pick Their Favorite Films of 2024 |url=https://www.indiewire.com/gallery/directors-pick-best-films-2024/ |access-date=2024-12-30 |work=IndieWire |date=2024-12-30 |archive-date=2024-12-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241230231638/https://www.indiewire.com/gallery/directors-pick-best-films-2024/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

《{{le|视与听|Sight & Sound}}》将本片列入2024年最佳50部电影第11名。<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-12-06 |title=The 50 best films of 2024 |url=https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |access-date= |website=BFI |language=en |archive-date=2024-12-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241207002204/https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |url-status=live }}</ref>2025年6月，《{{le|独立线|IndieWire}}》将本片列入「2020年代至今100部最佳电影」第28名。<ref>{{cite web |date=2025-06-16 |title=The 100 Best Movies of the 2020s (So Far) |url=https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |access-date=2025-06-23 |archive-date=2025-07-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250727024924/https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

《{{le|视与听|Sight & Sound}}》将本片列入2024年最佳50部电影榜单第11名。<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-12-06 |title=The 50 best films of 2024 |url=https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |access-date= |website=BFI |language=en |archive-date=2024-12-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241207002204/https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |url-status=live }}</ref>2025年6月，《{{le|独立线|IndieWire}}》将本片列入「2020年代至今100部最佳电影」榜单第28名。<ref>{{cite web |date=2025-06-16 |title=The 100 Best Movies of the 2020s (So Far) |url=https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |access-date=2025-06-23 |archive-date=2025-07-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250727024924/https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

