==制作==
2018年12月，{{tsl|en|Welle Entertainment|Welle娱乐}}宣布将改编{{tsl|en|Robinne Lee|罗宾·李}}小说《关于你的想法》（{{lang|en|The Idea Of You}}），由{{tsl|en|Cathy Schulman|凯茜·舒尔曼}}和[[加布里埃尔·尤尼恩]]担任制片人<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2018/12/the-idea-of-you-gabrielle-union-everything-must-go-transfers-female-projects-welle-entertainment-slate-cathy-schulman-jeff-gaspin-1202523033/|title=The Idea Of You,' 'Everything Must Go' & Other Female-Strong Projects Join Welle Entertainment Slate|website=Deadline|date=2018-12-19|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-02-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230226161347/https://deadline.com/2018/12/the-idea-of-you-gabrielle-union-everything-must-go-transfers-female-projects-welle-entertainment-slate-cathy-schulman-jeff-gaspin-1202523033/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。尤尼恩将这本书列为她2018年最喜欢的十本书之一<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.vulture.com/2018/01/gabrielle-unions-10-favorite-books.html|title=Gabrielle Union's 10 favourite books|website=Vulture.com|date=2018-01-03|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-03-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230327144801/https://www.vulture.com/2018/01/gabrielle-unions-10-favorite-books.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。尤尼恩和李自[[2000年代]]初以来一直是朋友<ref>{{Cite news|url= https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/05/style/gabrielle-union-memoir.amp.html|title= We're Going to Need More Gabrielle Union|work= The New York Times|date= 2017-12-05|last1= Krischer|first1= Hayley|accessdate= 2023-10-13|archive-date= 2024-03-13|archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20240313205106/https://www.nytimes.com/2017/12/05/style/gabrielle-union-memoir.html|dead-url= no}}</ref>。2021年6月，据透露，詹妮弗·韦斯特费尔夫特改编了这部小说，而[[安妮·海瑟薇]]将担任主演<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.deadline.com/2021/06/anne-hathaway-the-idea-of-you-amazon-welle-entertainment-jennifer-westfeldt-1234778882/|title=Amazon, Welle Entertainment Adapt 'The Idea Of You' For Anne Hathaway|website=Deadline|date=2021-06-21|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-03-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230314100534/https://deadline.com/2021/06/anne-hathaway-the-idea-of-you-amazon-welle-entertainment-jennifer-westfeldt-1234778882/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

2022年8月，{{tsl|en|Michael Showalter|迈克尔·肖沃尔特}}被确认为此片导演<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.deadline.com/2022/08/anne-hathaway-michael-showalter-the-idea-of-you-prime-video-cathy-schulman-gabrielle-union-producing-1235099474/|title=Michael Showalter To Direct Anne Hathaway In 'The Idea Of You' For Prime Video; Cathy Schulman & Gabrielle Union Producing|website=Deadline|date=2022-08-25|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-10-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231001171012/https://deadline.com/2022/08/anne-hathaway-michael-showalter-the-idea-of-you-prime-video-cathy-schulman-gabrielle-union-producing-1235099474/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://collider.com/anne-hathaway-cast-the-idea-of-you-michael-showalter-directing/|title=Anne Hathaway to Star in 'The Idea of You' From Director Michael Showalter|website=Collider|date=2022-08-25|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2022-12-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221209232655/https://collider.com/anne-hathaway-cast-the-idea-of-you-michael-showalter-directing/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年9月，[[尼古拉斯·加利齐纳]]加入演员阵容，他将饰演“地球上最热门的男孩乐队”的主唱<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.variety.com/2022/film/news/nicholas-galitzine-anne-hathaway-the-idea-of-you-1235375884/|title=Nicholas Galitzine to Star Opposite Anne Hathaway in Prime Video's 'The Idea of You'|website=Variety.com|date=2022-09-19|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-02-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230219141158/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/nicholas-galitzine-anne-hathaway-the-idea-of-you-1235375884/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/nicholas-galitzine-joins-anne-hathaway-in-prime-video-romance-the-idea-of-you-1235121002/|title=Nicholas Galitzine To Star Opposite Anne Hathaway In Prime Video Romance 'The Idea Of You' From Director Michael Showalter|website=Deadline|date=2022-09-19|last1=Grobar|first1=Matt|accessdate=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-08-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230823105230/https://deadline.com/2022/09/nicholas-galitzine-joins-anne-hathaway-in-prime-video-romance-the-idea-of-you-1235121002/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年10月，{{Tsl|en|Ella Rubin|艾拉·鲁宾}}被曝将饰演海瑟薇的女儿，[[主要拍摄]]工作已经开始<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.variety.com/2022/film/news/ella-rubin-anne-hathaway-prime-video-the-idea-of-you-1235401034/|title=Ella Rubin Joins Anne Hathaway in Amazon Prime Video's 'The Idea of You'|website=Variety|date=2022-10-12|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-02-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230219141158/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/ella-rubin-anne-hathaway-prime-video-the-idea-of-you-1235401034/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a41619016/gossip-girl-ella-rubin-anne-hathaway-movie/|title=Gossip Girl star lands next role in Anne Hathaway movie|website=digitalspy.com|date=2022-10-14|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-10-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231001170845/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a41619016/gossip-girl-ella-rubin-anne-hathaway-movie/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。在宣布这一消息后不久，{{tsl|en|Annie Mumolo|安妮·穆莫罗}}、[[里德·斯科特]]、{{tsl|en|Perry Mattfeld|佩里·马特菲尔德}}和乔丹·亚伦·霍尔（Jordan Aaron Hall）以及乐队的其他成员杰登·安东尼 （Jaiden Anthony）、雷蒙德·查姆（Raymond Cham）、维克·怀特（Vik White）和达科塔·亚当（Dakota Adam）也加入了演员阵容。

拍摄于2022年10月在[[佐治亚州]][[亚特兰大]]及周边地区进行<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://productionlist.com/production/the-idea-of-you/|title=The Idea Of You|website=production list|date=2022-09-12|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-10-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231001170757/https://productionlist.com/production/the-idea-of-you/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.atlantafi.com/heres-the-list-of-movies-being-filmed-in-atlanta-georgia/|title=Here's The List Of Movies Being Filmed In Atlanta, Georgia Right Now|website=Atlantafi.com|date=2023-01-02|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2023-05-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230517064038/https://atlantafi.com/heres-the-list-of-movies-being-filmed-in-atlanta-georgia/|dead-url=no}}</ref>，媒体报道称加利齐纳和海瑟薇在佐治亚州[[萨凡纳]]的片场一起拍摄<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.msn.com/en-us/entertainment/celebrity/mel-gibson-66-treats-son-lars-5-to-something-sweet-in-malibu-plus-more-great-celebrity-photos-this-week/ss-AA12ubXG?li=BBnb2gh|title=Anne Hathaway, 39, and Nicholas Galitzine, 28, cuddle up while filming 'The Idea of You' in Georgia, plus more great celebrity photos this week|website=MSN.com|access-date=2023-10-13|archive-date=2022-10-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221024021209/https://www.msn.com/en-us/entertainment/celebrity/mel-gibson-66-treats-son-lars-5-to-something-sweet-in-malibu-plus-more-great-celebrity-photos-this-week/ss-AA12ubXG?li=BBnb2gh|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

