《'''鬼圣胎'''》（{{langx|en|''Immaculate''}}）是一部2024年美国[[心理恐怖]]电影，由{{le|麦克·莫翰|Michael Mohan}}执导，安德鲁·洛贝尔（{{lang|en|Andrew Lobel}}）编剧，[[席妮·史威尼]]担任主演兼联合监制，其他主演包括[[阿尔法罗·莫特]]、{{le|贝妮黛塔·波卡洛利|Benedetta Porcaroli}}、{{link-it|朵拉·罗曼诺|Dora Romano}}、{{le|乔治欧·克兰杰利|Giorgio Colangeli}}和{{le|席梦娜·塔巴斯科|Simona Tabasco}}。电影剧情重点放在一位虔诚信仰的年轻女子，被邀请住在一座风景如画的义大利修道院，但慢慢意识到修道院隐藏著可怕的秘密。

《鬼圣胎》2024年3月12日在[[西南偏南]]首映，2024年3月22日由[[霓虹 (公司)|霓虹]]安排在美国院线上映。影评界的评价褒贬不一，但仍以正面占主流，史威尼的表演获得普遍赞誉。

== 演员 ==
* [[席妮·史威尼]]饰演瑟希莉亚（{{lang|en|Cecilia}}）
* [[阿尔法罗·莫特]]饰演萨尔·泰德斯基神父（{{lang|en|Father Sal Tedeschi}}）
* {{le|贝妮黛塔·波卡洛利|Benedetta Porcaroli}}饰演关修女（{{lang|en|Sister Gwen}}）
* {{link-it|朵拉·罗曼诺|Dora Romano}}饰演修道院院长
* {{le|乔治欧·克兰杰利|Giorgio Colangeli}}饰演枢机佛朗哥·梅罗拉（{{lang|en|Cardinal Franco Merola}}）
* {{le|席梦娜·塔巴斯科|Simona Tabasco}}饰演玛丽修女（{{lang|en|Sister Mary}}）

== 主题 ==
本片探讨了[[基因工程|基因改造]]的主题，以及围绕分娩和堕胎的辩论。导演{{le|麦克·莫翰|Michael Mohan}}在接受《{{le|Fangoria|Fangoria}}》杂志采访时讲述了一则故事，他的家人在听到反堕胎布道后不再上教堂；但他认为本片无意传达社会讯息。<ref name=":0" />文章写道：<blockquote>虽然本片归根结底是关于宗教机构强行分娩并索取女人身体的故事，已受到了网路上某些保守派人士的抵制，但莫翰并不在意。「我不认为这是个问题，反而这是一次必要的对话，如果一部电影能够激发这种对话，那么我们的工作就完成了。但我也想明确表示：我希望对话是由观众发起，不想让外界看著我们然后说『注意那些[[社会正义战士]]吧！』」莫翰似乎更愿意让《鬼圣胎》执行恐怖片的另一项重要使命：给人们留下终生的创伤。<ref name=":0" /></blockquote>

== 制作 ==
《鬼圣胎》的开发早在2014年启动，剧本由安德鲁·洛贝尔（{{lang|en|Andrew Lobel}}）编写，当时[[席妮·史威尼]]参与了首次试镜<ref name="Davids 2024">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-features/immaculate-director-sydney-sweeney-1235854844/|title='Immaculate' Director Michael Mohan Had a Front Row Seat to the Rise of Sydney Sweeney|last=Davids|first=Brian|date=2024-03-18|website=[[好莱坞报导|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2024-03-26|archive-date=2024-03-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240327142900/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-features/immaculate-director-sydney-sweeney-1235854844/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。但该项目并未投入制作，身陷[[开发地狱]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a60258178/immaculate-rotten-tomatoes/|title=Sydney Sweeney's horror movie Immaculate lands fresh Rotten Tomatoes rating|last=Anderton|first=Joe|date=2024-03-20|website=[[数位间谍|Digital Spy]]|access-date=2024-03-26|archive-date=2024-03-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240327014817/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a60258178/immaculate-rotten-tomatoes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。在2019年电视剧《[[高校十八禁]]》中取得要角后，史威尼购买了剧本版权，并与曾合作过电视剧《{{le|诸事不炫！|Everything Sucks!}}》（2018年）及电影《{{le|偷窥者 (2021年电影)|The Voyeurs|偷窥者}}》（2021年）的莫翰接洽执导<ref name="Davids 2024" />。莫翰表示，本片中的许多桥段受到自己天主教成长的启发<ref>{{Cite web |last=Lattanzio |first=Ryan |date=2024-03-19 |title=‘Immaculate’ Director Michael Mohan Channeled His Catholic Youth Group Trauma for the Film’s Unholy Imagery |url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/interviews/immaculate-director-catholic-trauma-inspired-horror-film-1234965689/ |access-date=2024-03-29 |website=IndieWire |archive-date=2024-03-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240322161159/https://www.indiewire.com/features/interviews/immaculate-director-catholic-trauma-inspired-horror-film-1234965689/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

2022年10月，史威尼正式宣告参演，莫翰确定担任导演，史威尼凭借自己的五五十电影（{{lang|en|Fifty-Fifty Films}}）公司而担任监制<ref name=deadline1>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/sydney-sweeney-set-for-psychological-horror-immaculate-1235157706/|title=Sydney Sweeney Set For Black Bear Pictures' Psychological Horror 'Immaculate' From Director Michael Mohan|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2022-10-28|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230217180831/https://deadline.com/2022/10/sydney-sweeney-set-for-psychological-horror-immaculate-1235157706/|url-status=live}}</ref>。据莫翰所述，为更好满足史威尼和观众的期望，剧本最初的演员阵容从高中女生改成了修女<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |last=Jr |first=Phil Nobile |date=2024-03-25 |title=Sydney Sweeney’s IMMACULATE Conception |url=https://www.fangoria.com/original/immaculate-sydney-sweeney-spoiler/ |access-date=2024-03-29 |website={{le|Fangoria|Fangoria}} |archive-date=2024-03-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329203348/https://www.fangoria.com/original/immaculate-sydney-sweeney-spoiler/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年2月，[[阿尔法罗·莫特]]、{{le|贝妮黛塔·波卡洛利|Benedetta Porcaroli}}、{{link-it|朵拉·罗曼诺|Dora Romano}}、{{le|乔治欧·克兰杰利|Giorgio Colangeli}}和{{le|席梦娜·塔巴斯科|Simona Tabasco}}加入演出阵容<ref name="variety">{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/alvaro-morte-benedetta-porcaroli-dora-romano-giorgio-colangeli-sydney-sweeney-immaculate-1235521371/|title=Álvaro Morte, Benedetta Porcaroli and More Join Sydney Sweeney in Black Bear Pictures' 'Immaculate' (EXCLUSIVE)|work=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|first=Julia|last=MacCary|date=2023-02-13|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230218153551/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/alvaro-morte-benedetta-porcaroli-dora-romano-giorgio-colangeli-sydney-sweeney-immaculate-1235521371/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/simona-tabasco-cast-psychological-horror-film-immaculate-1235263849/|title=Simona Tabasco Joins Sydney Sweeney In Psychological Horror Film 'Immaculate'|work=Deadline Hollywood|first=Rosy|last=Cordero|date=2023-02-17|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-26|archive-url=https://archive.today/20230226214113/https://deadline.com/2023/02/simona-tabasco-cast-psychological-horror-film-immaculate-1235263849/|url-status=live}}</ref>。同月，电影在[[罗马]]<ref name=variety/>完成[[主要拍摄]]<ref>{{Cite instagram |user=sydney_sweeney|last=Sweeney|first=Sydney|author-link=席德妮·史威尼|postid=CoxYVPRL0rR|title=I just wrapped the first film I've ever produced, Immaculate, with the most amazing cast and crew. I can't even begin to describe what an amazing experience it's been these past few months in Rome. I've learned so much and can't wait to share all the madness we created with you ♥️|date=2023-02-17|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230218153551/https://www.instagram.com/p/CoxYVPRL0rR/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
2023年12月，[[霓虹 (公司)|霓虹]]获得了《鬼圣胎》的美国发行权<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/immaculate-movie-sydney-sweeney-acquired-neon-1235677591/|title=Sydney Sweeney Horror 'Immaculate' Acquired By Neon|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2023-12-19|access-date=2023-12-19|archive-date=2023-12-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231219170717/https://deadline.com/2023/12/immaculate-movie-sydney-sweeney-acquired-neon-1235677591/|url-status=live}}</ref>。电影2024年3月12日在[[西南偏南]]举行世界首映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198599|title=Immaculate|website=South by Southwest|access-date=2024-02-07|archive-date=2024-02-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207202302/https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198599|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/|title=SXSW 2024 Second Wave Includes Pics With Sydney Sweeney, Nicolas Cage, Camila Mendes & 'Monkey Man'|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2024-02-07|access-date=2024-02-07|archive-date=2024-02-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207200930/https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/|url-status=live}}</ref>，2024年3月22日在美国院线上映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3797202/immaculate-neon-releasing-sydney-sweeney-horror-movie-in-march-poster/|title='Immaculate' – NEON Releasing Sydney Sweeney Horror Movie in March [Poster]|website={{le|Bloody Disgusting|Bloody Disgusting}}|first=John|last=Squires|date=2024-01-24|access-date=2024-01-24|archive-date=2024-01-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240124170740/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3797202/immaculate-neon-releasing-sydney-sweeney-horror-movie-in-march-poster/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 反响 ==
=== 票房 ===
在美国和加拿大，《鬼圣胎》与《[[捉鬼敢死队：冰封魅来]]》和《[[魔鬼深夜秀]]》一起上映，预计首映周末在2354家影院获得约500万美元的票房<ref>{{Cite web |last=Rubin |first=Rebecca |date=2024-03-19 |title=Box Office Preview: 'Ghostbusters: Frozen Empire' Aims for $45 Million Opening Weekend |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-opening-weekend-estimates-1235945825/ |access-date=2024-03-19 |website=Variety |archive-date=2024-03-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240319180109/https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-opening-weekend-estimates-1235945825/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片首日票房为200万美元，首映票房为530万美元，排名当周票房排名第四，创下Neon史上最佳首映周末成绩<ref name=opening>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-03-24 |title=' Ghostbusters: Frozen Empire' Propels Franchise Past $1B As Sequel Opens To $45M+ – Sunday AM Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-1235865730/ |access-date=2024-03-24 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-03-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328012950/https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-1235865730/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=IW-open />。

=== 评价 ===
《鬼圣胎》在[[烂番茄]]网站上根据148位影评人，新鲜度达71%，平均评分为6.4／10；该网站共识评论：「《鬼圣胎》构思完美，在执行上却并非如此，所幸席妮·史威尼的精彩表演挽救了这场以宗教为主题的恐怖之旅。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/immaculate_2024|title=Immaculate (2024)|work=[[烂番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-03-30|archive-date=2024-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329160535/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/immaculate_2024|dead-url=no}}</ref>根据39位影评人打分的[[Metacritic]]得分为57，代表「好坏参半或一般」的评价<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/immaculate/|title=Immaculate|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-03-30|archive-date=2024-03-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240330073831/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/immaculate/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。据[[影院评分]]的民意调查，观众的口碑在A+至F间落于「C」，而{{le|PostTrak|PostTrak}}则调查出观众的好评度为52%，其中30%的人表示予以推荐<ref name=opening/>。

《[[每日电讯报]]》的提姆·罗比（{{lang|en|Tim Robey}}）给本片打了3星（满分5星），并评论道：「席妮·史威尼对怀孕修女的恐怖需要时间来实现……可以说，《鬼圣胎》只有到了最后一刻，才向观众兑现了该有的期望。」<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/2024/03/21/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeneys-pregnant-nun-horror-takes/|title=Immaculate: Sydney Sweeney's pregnant-nun horror takes time to deliver|website=The Telegraph|date=2024-03-21|access-date=2024-03-22|archive-date=2024-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329080117/https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/2024/03/21/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeneys-pregnant-nun-horror-takes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>《[[纽约时报]]》的马诺拉·达吉斯（{{lang|en|Manohla Dargis}}）将《鬼圣胎》列为影评人之选，表示「电影可谓一场惊悚盛宴，勇敢的女主角、敏感且扭曲的不敬以及模糊的叙事，足以让观众有争论的空间。」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Dargis |first=Manohla |date=2024-03-21 |title='Immaculate' Review: Sydney Sweeney Is Wide-Eyed but Sly |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/21/movies/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeney.html |url-status=no |access-date=2024-03-25 |work=[[纽约时报|The New York Times]] |archive-date=2024-03-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328094919/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/21/movies/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeney.html }}</ref>

