== 制作 ==
2022年8月，[[欧文·提格]]参演，他将以动作捕捉担任主演<ref name="Teague">{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-08-22 |title='Planet of the Apes': Owen Teague To Star In New Installment For 20th Century |url=https://deadline.com/2022/08/planet-of-the-apes-owen-teague-20th-century-1235097948/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220622195201/https://movieweb.com/disney-impressed-with-new-planet-of-the-apes-script-now-planning-new-trilogy/ |archive-date=2022-08-23 |access-date=2022-08-23 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。9月，[[芙蕾雅·艾伦]]和{{le|彼得·梅肯|Peter Macon}}参演，并公布片名为《猩球崛起：王国诞生》（{{lang|en|''Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes''}}）以及其上映日期<ref name="Announcement">{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-09-29 |title=New 'Planet Of The Apes' Movie Taps 'The Witcher's Freya Allan To Star, Releases New Title And First Look |url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/planet-of-the-apes-the-witchers-freya-allen-1235130196/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220929171517/https://deadline.com/2022/09/planet-of-the-apes-the-witchers-freya-allen-1235130196/ |archive-date=2022-09-29 |access-date=2022-09-29 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。10月，[[艾卡·达维尔]]和[[凯文·杜兰]]参演<ref name="Darville">{{Cite magazine |last=Couch |first=Aaron |date=2022-10-06 |title='Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes' Casts 'Jessica Jones' Actor Eka Darville (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-casts-eka-darville-1235234232/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221006163625/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-casts-eka-darville-1235234232/ |archive-date=2022-10-06 |access-date=2022-10-06 |magazine=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]}}</ref><ref name="Durand">{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-10-06 |title=Kevin Durand Joins 'Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/kevin-durand-kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-1235137084/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221006184948/https://deadline.com/2022/10/kevin-durand-kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-1235137084/ |archive-date=2022-10-06 |access-date=2022-10-06 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。

=== 拍摄 ===
[[主体拍摄]]于2022年10月9日在{{le|迪士尼澳大利亚制片厂|Disney Studios Australia}}开始进行<ref>{{cite web |last1=Tulich |first1=Katherine |title=''Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes'' Starts Shooting at Renamed Disney Studios Australia |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-shooting-australia-1235397570/ |website=[[Variety]] |access-date=2022-10-10 |date=2022-10-09 |archive-date=2022-10-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221027113802/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-shooting-australia-1235397570/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，最初曾预定于2022年8月开始拍摄<ref name="ProductionWeekly">{{Cite web |date=2022-06-15 |title=Production Weekly – Issue 1303 – Thursday, June 16, 2022 / 188 Listings – 41 Pages |url=https://www.productionweekly.com/production-weekly-issue-1303-thursday-june-16-2022-188-listings-41-pages/ |url-access=subscription |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220616013339/https://www.productionweekly.com/production-weekly-issue-1303-thursday-june-16-2022-188-listings-41-pages/ |archive-date=2022-06-16 |access-date=2022-06-20 |website=Production Weekly}}</ref><ref name=Announcement/>。

== 发行 ==
《猩球崛起：王国诞生》2024年5月10日于美国上映<ref name="Announcement"/><ref name=NewSagaTwitter>{{Cite tweet|number=1575532321012211712|user=20thcentury|title=A new saga begins. “Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes,” picking up many years after “War for the Planet of the Apes,” starts production next month and stars Owen Teague, Freya Allen, and Peter Macon. Directed by Wes Ball, “Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes” arrives in 2024.|date=2022-09-29|access-date=2022-09-29}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Couch |first=Aaron |last2=Couch |first2=Aaron |date=2022-10-11 |title=Marvel Shifts Dates for ‘Avengers: Secret Wars,’ ‘Deadpool 3’, ‘Fantastic Four’ and ‘Blade’ |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/marvel-release-dates-shift-avengers-secret-wars-1235239094/ |access-date=2022-10-11 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2022-10-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221011183748/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/marvel-release-dates-shift-avengers-secret-wars-1235239094/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。据报道，迪士尼和20世纪计划将《王国诞生》作为《猩球崛起》新三部曲的第一部。鲍尔在2023年12月证实了这一点，并解释说这部电影被认为是新三部曲的开始，“符合”前三部电影的“遗产”。<ref>{{Cite web|title=Disney Impressed With New Planet of the Apes Script, Now Planning New Trilogy|url=https://movieweb.com/disney-impressed-with-new-planet-of-the-apes-script-now-planning-new-trilogy/|website=MovieWeb|date=2022-06-22|language=en|last=Fuge|first=Jonathan|access-date=2024-02-26|archive-date=2022-06-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220622195201/https://movieweb.com/disney-impressed-with-new-planet-of-the-apes-script-now-planning-new-trilogy/|dead-url=no}}</ref>
