《'''美声歌后：玛丽亚'''》（{{langx|en|''Maria''}}）是2024年上映的[[传记片|传记]]{{tsl|en|psychological drama|心理剧情片}}<ref>{{Cite web |last=Gonzalez |first=Umberto |date=2024-08-28 |title=Netflix Acquires Angelina Jolie's 'Maria' From Director Pablo Larraín for US Distribution |url=https://www.thewrap.com/netflix-angelina-jolie-maria-pablo-larrain/ |access-date=2024-08-28 |website=TheWrap |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-09-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240905103815/https://www.thewrap.com/netflix-angelina-jolie-maria-pablo-larrain/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，讲述歌剧演唱家[[玛丽亚·卡拉丝]]的晚年岁月。电影由[[帕布罗·拉拉因]]执导，[[史蒂芬·奈特]]编剧，[[安吉丽娜·朱莉]]、[[薇拉莉·葛琳诺]]和{{tsl|en|Haluk Bilginer|哈鲁克·比尔根纳尔}}领衔主演。本片是拉腊因“杰出女性三部曲”的最后一部，前两部是介绍[[美国第一夫人]][[杰奎琳·肯尼迪]]的《[[第一夫人的秘密]]》，以及介绍[[威尔士王妃戴安娜]]的《[[史宾赛 (电影)|史宾赛]]》。

影片于2024年8月29日在[[第81届威尼斯影展]]全球首映，入选主竞赛单元，角逐[[金狮奖]]<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-07-09 |title=Biennale Cinema 2024 {{!}} Maria |url=https://www.labiennale.org/en/cinema/2024/venezia-81-competition/maria |access-date=2024-07-23 |website=La Biennale di Venezia |language=en |archive-date=2024-09-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240925145833/https://www.labiennale.org/en/cinema/2024/venezia-81-competition/maria |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==梗概==
故事发生在1970年代，讲述歌剧演唱家[[玛丽亚·卡拉丝]]在[[巴黎]]的晚年岁月<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.classicfm.com/artists/maria-callas/angelina-jolie-biopic-opera-singer/|access-date=2023-10-05|website={{tsl|en|Classic FM (UK)||Classic FM}}|title=Angelina Jolie to star as legendary Greek operatic soprano Maria Callas in new musical biopic|first=Maddy|last=Shaw Roberts|date=2023-10-02|archive-date=2023-10-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231009152512/https://www.classicfm.com/artists/maria-callas/angelina-jolie-biopic-opera-singer/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==演员==
* [[安吉丽娜·朱莉]] 饰 [[玛丽亚·卡拉丝]]
** 阿吉丽娜·帕帕佐普卢（Aggelina Papadopoulou）饰 少女玛丽亚·卡拉丝
* [[薇拉莉·葛琳诺]] 饰 亚金蒂·卡拉斯（Yakinthi  Callas）
* {{tsl|en|Haluk Bilginer|哈鲁克·比尔根纳尔}} 饰 [[亚里士多德·奥纳西斯]]
* [[艾芭·罗尔瓦雀]] 饰 布鲁娜（Bruna）
* [[皮耶法兰西斯柯·法维诺]] 饰 费鲁乔（Ferruccio）
* [[寇帝·史密-麦菲]] 饰 曼德拉克斯（Mandrax）
* {{tsl|it|Alessandro Bressanello|亚历山德罗·布雷萨内洛}} 饰 {{tsl|it|Giovanni Battista Meneghini|乔瓦尼·巴蒂斯塔·梅内吉尼}}

==制片==
[[File:Maria (2024 film)-64582.jpg|thumb|电影《玛丽亚》的主创团队亮相第81届威尼斯国际电影节]]
2023年5月，消息指[[帕布罗·拉拉因]]签约担任本片导演，[[史蒂芬·奈特]]负责编剧<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-movie-cannes-market-filmnation-1235361309/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2023-10-05|title=Maria Callas Biopic Starring Angelina Jolie Heads To Cannes Market With FilmNation|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|date=2023-05-10|archive-date=2023-10-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231009152510/https://deadline.com/2023/05/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-movie-cannes-market-filmnation-1235361309/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年10月，[[安吉丽娜·朱莉]]加盟剧组，饰演主角[[玛丽亚·卡拉丝]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-1235246234/|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2023-10-05|title=Angelina Jolie to Play Maria Callas in Next Biopic From Pablo Larrain|first=Alex|last=Ritman|date=2022-10-21|archive-date=2024-09-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240913075751/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-1235246234/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

2023年10月，电影于[[布达佩斯]]开机，此后在[[巴黎]]、[[希腊]]和[[米兰]]取景，部分素材在[[斯卡拉大剧院]]拍摄。在此之前，布景师{{tsl|en|Guy Hendrix Dyas|盖·亨德里克斯·戴亚斯}}与导演拉拉因设计视觉概念，将1940年代至1970年代的风格与超现实的音乐场景结合起来。电影制片人表示，朱莉在片中的戏服不包括新设计的皮草，而是根据卡拉斯亲手制作的演出服进行改造。服装设计师{{tsl|en|Massimo Cantini Parrini|马西莫·坎蒂尼·帕里尼}}的私藏复古皮草在片中出现，这部分事前有和[[善待动物组织]]等动物权利组织咨询<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2023/film/global/valeria-golino-angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-biopic-1235746237/|access-date=2023-10-05|website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|date=2023-10-05|first=Nick|last=Vivarelli|title=Valeria Golino Joins Angelina Jolie as Maria Callas' Sister in Pablo Larraín's Biopic|archive-date=2023-12-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231221145036/https://variety.com/2023/film/global/valeria-golino-angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-biopic-1235746237/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2023-10-09|date=2023-10-09|title=First Images of Angelina Jolie as Maria Callas Unveiled as Pablo Larrain's Biopic 'Maria' Begins Shooting|first=Alex|last=Ritman|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-images-pablo-larrain-1235612496/|archive-date=2023-10-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231009152513/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-images-pablo-larrain-1235612496/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

为了准备角色，[[安吉丽娜·朱莉]]花了七个月时间学歌剧<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/angelina-jolie-maria-singing-opera-training-seven-months-terribly-nervous-1236122176/|title=Angelina Jolie Spent ‘Almost Seven Months’ Training to Sing Opera in ‘Maria’: ‘I Had Not Sung in Public’ Before and ‘Was Terribly Nervous’|publisher=Variety|access-date=2024-08-31|archive-date=2024-10-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241001212046/https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/angelina-jolie-maria-singing-opera-training-seven-months-terribly-nervous-1236122176/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 反响 ==
