《'''师情化欲'''》（{{langx|en|''Miller's Girl''}}）是一部2024年上映的美国色情惊悚片，由杰德·哈雷·巴特利特（Jade Halley Bartlett）自编自导，[[珍娜·奥尔特加]]和[[马丁·弗里曼]]主演。电影主要讲述了一名学生和老师，他们在完成创意写作任务后建立了复杂的关系。

本片上映后获得负面为主的评价，叙事与节奏受到指谪，但是演员的表现则获得好评。

该片由狮门影业于2024年1月26日在美国院线上映<ref>{{Cite web |last=Hipes |first=Patrick |date=2023-12-12 |title=Jenna Ortega-Martin Freeman Movie ''Miller's Girl'' To World Premiere At Palm Springs Film Festival Ahead Of January Release; See First-Look Photo |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/jenna-ortega-millers-girl-movie-photo-first-look-release-date-1235659454/ |access-date=2023-12-12 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2023-12-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231212211054/https://deadline.com/2023/12/jenna-ortega-millers-girl-movie-photo-first-look-release-date-1235659454/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Jenna Ortega to attend Palm Springs International Film Festival for 'Miller's Girl' premiere |url=https://www.desertsun.com/story/life/entertainment/events/2023/12/12/la-quinta-natve-jenna-ortega-to-attend-palm-springs-film-festival-for-millers-girl-movie-premiere/71858094007/ |access-date=2023-12-22 |website={{tsl|en|The Desert Sun||The Desert Sun}} |archive-date=2023-12-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231222052744/https://www.desertsun.com/story/life/entertainment/events/2023/12/12/la-quinta-natve-jenna-ortega-to-attend-palm-springs-film-festival-for-millers-girl-movie-premiere/71858094007/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==演员==
* [[马丁·弗里曼]] 饰演 乔纳森·米勒（Jonathan Miller）
* [[珍娜·奥尔特加]] 饰演 凯萝·斯威特（Cairo Sweet）
* [[达格玛拉·多敏齐克]] 饰演 碧翠丝·琼·哈珀（Beatrice June Harper）
* {{tsl|en|Bashir Salahuddin|巴希尔·沙拉胡丁}} 饰演 鲍里斯·菲尔莫尔（Boris Fillmore）
* [[吉第安·阿德龙]] 饰演 温妮·布莱克（Winnie Black）
* {{tsl|en|Christine Adams (actress)|克里斯蒂尼·亚当斯 (演员)|克里斯蒂尼·亚当斯}} 饰演 乔伊斯（Joyce Manor）

==制作==
2016年12月，杰德·哈雷·巴特利特为《师情化欲》编写的剧本被[[塞斯·罗根]]的公司{{tsl|en|Point Grey Pictures|灰点影业}}收购，并被列入好莱坞未制作剧本黑名单。<ref>{{cite web|first=Patrick|last=Hipes|title=The Black List 2016 Scripts: Madonna Biopic 'Blond Ambition' Leads Rankings|url=https://deadline.com/2016/12/2016-black-list-2016-scripts-rankings-list-1201868979/|date=2016-12-12|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2023-01-24|archive-date=2023-01-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230124194148/https://deadline.com/2016/12/2016-black-list-2016-scripts-rankings-list-1201868979/|url-status=live}}</ref> 

2022年9月中旬，有报道称[[狮门影业]]已获得该电影的发行权。此外，巴特利特将执导她的剧本，[[马丁·弗里曼]]和[[珍娜·奥尔特加]]将担任主演<ref name=”Bartlett’sOpportunity”>{{cite web|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|title=Jenna Ortega Joins Martin Freeman In Lionsgate & Point Grey's 'Miller's Girl'|url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/jenna-ortega-millers-girl-martin-freeman-1235122345/|date=2022-09-19|website=Deadline Hollywood|access-date= 2023-01-24|archive-date= 2022-09-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220919200916/https://deadline.com/2022/09/jenna-ortega-millers-girl-martin-freeman-1235122345/|url-status=live}}</ref>。一周后，宣布[[吉第安·阿德龙]]、{{tsl|en|Bashir Salahuddin|巴希尔·沙拉胡丁}}、[[达格玛拉·多敏齐克]]和{{tsl|en|Christine Adams (actress)|克里斯蒂尼·亚当斯 (演员)|克里斯蒂尼·亚当斯}}加入影片演员阵容<ref>{{cite web|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|title=Gideon Adlon, Bashir Salahuddin, Dagmara Domińczyk & Christine Adams Board 'Miller's Girl'|url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/lionsgate-millers-girl-gideon-adlon-bashir-salahuddin-dagmara-dominczyk-christine-adams-1235132433/|date= 2022-09-30|website=Deadline Hollywood|access-date=2023-01-24|archive-date=2023-01-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230124194236/https://deadline.com/2022/09/lionsgate-millers-girl-gideon-adlon-bashir-salahuddin-dagmara-dominczyk-christine-adams-1235132433/|url-status=live}}</ref>。同月，[[主要摄影]]工作在[[佐治亚州]][[卡特斯维尔]]进行<ref>{{Cite web |title=Briefly: Cartersville's Dellinger Park closing for movie ''Miller's Girl'' production. |url=https://www.northwestgeorgianews.com/hometown_headlines/bartow/briefly-cartersvilles-dellinger-park-closing-for-movie-millers-girl-production/article_6d31d2ea-3061-11ed-a8a4-a3273bc97279.html |access-date=2023-03-04 |website={{tsl|en|Rome News-Tribune||Rome News-Tribune}} |date= 2022-09-10 |archive-date=2023-03-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230304011744/https://www.northwestgeorgianews.com/hometown_headlines/bartow/briefly-cartersvilles-dellinger-park-closing-for-movie-millers-girl-production/article_6d31d2ea-3061-11ed-a8a4-a3273bc97279.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年1月11日在[[棕榈泉国际电影节]]首映，随后由[[狮门影业]]于2024年1月26日在影院上映。该片于2024年2月16日在美国以数字格式发行，并定于2月19日在英国上映<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-02-16 |title=Miller's Girl is now available to watch digitally in the US |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a46694022/watch-millers-girl-streaming/ |access-date=2024-02-16 |website=[[Digital Spy]] |archive-date=2024-02-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240216193635/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a46694022/watch-millers-girl-streaming/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==评价==
{{RT prose|31|5.2|55|Despite a pair of talented stars and a central concept with a certain amount of real-world relevance, the narratively superficial ''Miller's Girl'' rings hollow.|ref=y|access-date=2024-02-02}} {{Metacritic film prose|41|14|ref=yes|access-date=2024-01-28}}

