== 制作 ==
2022年10月，宣布[[盖·瑞奇]]将编导一部改编自{{le|达米安·路易斯 (电影制作人)|Damien Lewis (filmmaker)|达米安·路易斯}}的小说《非绅士特攻队》（或称为《邱吉尔的秘密战士：二战特种部队无赖的爆炸性真实故事》）的电影，该片由[[亨利·卡维尔]]和[[艾莎·冈萨雷]]主演<ref>{{cite web |last1=Wiseman |first1=Andreas |title=Henry Cavill & Eiza González To Lead Guy Ritchie WWII Action Spy Pic ''The Ministry Of Ungentlemanly Warfare'' For Jerry Bruckheimer & Black Bear International — AFM Hot Pic |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/henry-cavill-guy-ritchie-eiza-gonzalez-jerry-bruckheimer-world-war-two-action-movie-ministry-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235157749/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-10-28 |date=2022-10-28 |archive-date=2023-02-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230214025331/https://deadline.com/2022/10/henry-cavill-guy-ritchie-eiza-gonzalez-jerry-bruckheimer-world-war-two-action-movie-ministry-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235157749/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年2月，[[艾伦·瑞奇森]]、[[亨利·高汀]]、[[艾力克斯·派帝佛]]、[[凯瑞·艾文斯]]、[[希罗·范恩斯·提芬]]、{{le|巴布斯·奥卢桑莫昆|Babs Olusanmokun}}、[[蒂尔·施魏格尔]]和{{le|亨利·札加|Henry Zaga}}参演<ref>{{cite web |last1=Wiseman |first1=Andreas |title=Henry Cavill & Guy Ritchie WWII Pic ''Ministry'' Adds Alan Ritchson, Henry Golding, Alex Pettyfer, Cary Elwes, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Babs Olusanmokun, Til Schweiger & Henrique Zaga |url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/henry-cavill-new-movie-alan-ritchson-henry-goulding-henry-zaga-alex-pettyfer-hero-fiennes-tiffin-til-schweiger-1235247502/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-02-02 |date=2023-02-01 |archive-date=2023-09-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230907215957/https://deadline.com/2023/02/henry-cavill-new-movie-alan-ritchson-henry-goulding-henry-zaga-alex-pettyfer-hero-fiennes-tiffin-til-schweiger-1235247502/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

电影开拍当天，[[狮门影视公司]]宣布已获得该片的美国发行权，预定2024年院线上映，{{le|黑熊影业|Black Bear Pictures}}已出售该片在国际市场的发行权给[[Prime Video]]<ref name=deadline>{{cite web|title=Lionsgate Lands Domestic On Guy Ritchie, Jerry Bruckheimer & Black Bear's WWII Pic 'Ministry', Prime Video Splashes On Key Int'l Markets As Filming Begins|website=Deadline Hollywood|date=2023-02-13|access-date=2023-02-13|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/lionsgate-guy-ritchie-jerry-bruckheimer-and-black-bears-epic-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-efm-1235257510/|archive-date=2023-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230213162531/https://deadline.com/2023/02/lionsgate-guy-ritchie-jerry-bruckheimer-and-black-bears-epic-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-efm-1235257510/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

=== 拍摄 ===
电影2023年2月13日在[[土耳其]]开始进行[[主体拍摄]]，拍摄地点包括[[安塔利亚]]<ref>{{cite web |title=NEW FILM FROM DIRECTOR GUY RITCHIE: FILMING WILL START IN ANTALYA, TURKEY |url=https://www.turkeyhomes.com/news/new-film-from-director-guy-ritchie-filming-will-start-in-antalya-turkey |website=Turkey Homes |access-date=2023-02-03 |date=2023-12-21 |archive-date=2023-02-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230206083446/https://www.turkeyhomes.com/news/new-film-from-director-guy-ritchie-filming-will-start-in-antalya-turkey |dead-url=no }}</ref>。4月，电影在土耳其宣告[[杀青]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/04/26/henry-cavills-the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-wraps-production-in-turkey|title=Henry Cavill's The Ministry of Ungentlemanly Warfare wraps production in Turkey|last=Rajput|first=Priyanca|work=KFTV|date=2023-04-26|accessdate=2023-05-09|archive-date=2023-05-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230529144040/https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/04/26/henry-cavills-the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-wraps-production-in-turkey|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://collider.com/ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-henry-cavill-filming-wrap-video/|title=Henry Cavill Wraps Filming on 'The Ministry of Ungentlemanly Warfare'|last=Klawans|first=Justin|work=[[Collider]]|date=2023-04-24|accessdate=2023-05-09|archive-date=2023-05-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230522003537/https://collider.com/ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-henry-cavill-filming-wrap-video/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 反响 ==
=== 票房 ===
在美国和加拿大，《非绅士特攻队》与《[[噬血芭蕾]]》和《[[剧场版 SPY×FAMILY CODE: White]]》同天上映，外界预估首映周末在2700家影院获得500万至800万美元的票房<ref name=Variety-Proj/>。本片首日票房为370万美元，其中145万美元来自周四晚间的提前场<ref name=opening>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Box Office: ‘Civil War’ Draws Blood to Beat ‘Abigail’ and Stay No. 1 With $11M Second Weekend – Sunday AM Box Office Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/04/box-office-abigail-civil-war-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235890123/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-04-21 |date=2024-04-21 |archive-date=2024-04-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240420215228/https://deadline.com/2024/04/box-office-abigail-civil-war-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235890123/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片的首映票房为900万美元，位居当周票房排名第四，落后于《[[帝国浩劫：美国内战]]》、《噬血芭蕾》和《[[哥吉拉与金刚：新帝国]]》<ref name=opening /><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/civil-war-box-office-drawing-blood-abigail-1235878317/|title=Box Office: ‘Civil War’ Draws Blood to Beat ‘Abigail’ and Stay No. 1 With $11M Second Weekend|first=Pamela|last=McClintock|publisher=The Hollywood Reporter|date=2024-04-21|accessdate=2024-04-21|archive-date=2024-04-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240427143818/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/civil-war-box-office-drawing-blood-abigail-1235878317/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

=== 评价 ===
本片在[[烂番茄]]网站上根据168名影评人的评分，新鲜度达68%。该网站的共识影评：「《非绅士特攻队》是盖·瑞奇万神坛中的又一力作，将一则勇敢的真实故事升级成极度火爆的动作片，即使缺乏悬念，也充满了奇观。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/the_ministry_of_ungentlemanly_warfare|title=The Ministry Of Ungentlemanly Warfare (2024)|work=[[烂番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-04-17|archive-date=2024-04-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240429233606/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/the_ministry_of_ungentlemanly_warfare|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]网站上，电影根据38名影评人的评分，取得55分（满分100），象征「好坏参半的评价」<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare|title=The Ministry Of Ungentlemanly Warfare|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-04-17|archive-date=2024-04-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240430075438/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

