《'''绝不放手'''》（{{langx|en|''Never Let Go''}}）是2024年上映的美国{{tsl|en|survival film|生存电影|生存题材}}[[恐怖电影|恐怖片]]，由[[亚历山大·阿甲]]执导，凯文·考夫林和莱恩·格拉斯比编剧，[[荷莉·贝瑞]]、珀西·达格斯四世、安东尼·B·詹金斯、马修·凯文·安德森、克莉丝汀·朴和斯蒂芬妮·拉维尼主演。电影于2024年9月20日在美国上映，由[[狮门影视公司]]发行。

==梗概==
一位单亲妈妈与双胞胎儿子住在林间小屋，多年来一直受到邪灵折磨。然而，其中一位男孩开始质疑邪恶的存在，家人间的神圣纽带被打破，一场危险的生存之战就此打响<ref name="MotherlyHalle"/>。

==演员==
* [[荷莉·贝瑞]]饰演妈妈
* 珀西·达格斯四世（Percy Daggs IV）饰演诺兰（Nolan）
* 安东尼·B·詹金斯（Anthony B. Jenkins）饰演山缪（Samuel）
* 马修·凯文·安德森（Matthew Kevin Anderson）饰演陌生人
* 克莉丝汀·朴（Christin Park）饰演护理人员
* 斯蒂芬妮·拉维尼（Stephanie Lavigne）饰演邪灵（The Evil）

==制作==
2020年8月，凯文·考夫林和莱恩·格拉斯比撰写的恐怖片剧本《Mother Land》被[[肖恩·利维]]的{{tsl|en|21 Laps Entertainment||21 Laps Entertainment}}制片，[[狮门影视公司]]负责发行<ref>{{cite web|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|title=Lionsgate Acquires Horror Spec 'Mother Land'; 21 Laps' Shawn Levy & Dan Cohen To Produce|url=https://deadline.com/2020/08/lionsgate-horror-mother-land-shawn-levy-strangers-things-to-produce-1203025318/|date=2016-12-12|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2023-02-03|archive-date=2020-11-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201118012000/https://deadline.com/2020/08/lionsgate-horror-mother-land-shawn-levy-strangers-things-to-produce-1203025318/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2021年4月，{{tsl|en|Mark Romanek|马克·罗曼尼克}}宣布出任电影导演<ref>{{cite web|first=Mike Jr.|last=Fleming|title=Director Mark Romanek Returns To Movies With 'Mother Land' At Lionsgate & 21 Laps|url=https://deadline.com/2021/04/mark-romanek-directs-mother-land-lionsgate-21-laps-1234728665/|date=2021-04-06|website=Deadline Hollywood|access-date=2023-02-03|archive-date=2021-04-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210406194248/https://deadline.com/2021/04/mark-romanek-directs-mother-land-lionsgate-21-laps-1234728665/|url-status=live}}</ref>。次月，罗曼尼克退出项目，由[[亚历山大·阿甲]]接手，[[荷莉·贝瑞]]加盟剧组<ref name="MotherlyHalle">{{cite web|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|title=Halle Berry To Star In Thriller 'Mother Land' For Lionsgate, 'Stranger Things' Outfit 21 Laps & Director Alexandre Aja — Cannes Market Hot Pic|url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/halle-berry-stranger-things-arrival-producer-mother-land-lionsgate-cannes-1235019878/|date=2022-05-09|website=Deadline Hollywood|access-date=2023-02-03|archive-date=2023-03-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230305032341/https://deadline.com/2022/05/halle-berry-stranger-things-arrival-producer-mother-land-lionsgate-cannes-1235019878/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2022年6月，狮门在[[第75届坎城影展|戛纳电影节]]买下电影海外发行权<ref>{{cite web|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|title=Lionsgate Inks Raft Of Multimillion-Dollar Pre-Sales On Movie Slate Including 'Hunger Games' Prequel & 'Dirty Dancing' Sequel|url=https://deadline.com/2022/06/hunger-games-dirty-dancing-lionsgate-big-deals-international-buyers-1235054615/|date=2022-05-09|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2023-02-03|archive-date=2023-02-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230203030101/https://deadline.com/2022/06/hunger-games-dirty-dancing-lionsgate-big-deals-international-buyers-1235054615/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2023年4月，珀西·达格斯四世和安东尼·B·詹金斯加盟剧组，电影改名《Never Let Go》<ref name="DaggsJenkins">{{cite web|first=Matt|last=Grobar|title=Percy Daggs IV & Anthony B. Jenkins Join Halle Berry Thriller 'Never Let Go' From Lionsgate, 21 Laps|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/halle-berry-thriller-never-let-go-adds-percy-daggs-iv-anthony-b-jenkins-1235330244/|date=2023-04-19|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2023-04-19|archive-date=2023-12-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231225213004/https://deadline.com/2023/04/halle-berry-thriller-never-let-go-adds-percy-daggs-iv-anthony-b-jenkins-1235330244/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2024年5月，马修·凯文·安德森、克莉丝汀·朴、斯蒂芬妮·拉维尼加盟剧组<ref>{{cite web|first=Michaela|last=Zee|title='Never Let Go' Trailer: Halle Berry Battles an Evil Spirit to Survive in New Horror Film Directed by Alexandre Aja|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/never-let-go-trailer-halle-berry-1236005689/|date=2024-05-16|website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|access-date=2024-05-23|archive-date=2024-05-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240522234837/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/never-let-go-trailer-halle-berry-1236005689/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

[[主体拍摄]]于2023年4月17日至6月2日在[[加拿大]][[不列颠哥伦比亚省]][[温哥华]]进行<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-03-30 |title=In Production |url=https://creativebc.com/services/provincial-film-commission/in-production/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230330202457/https://creativebc.com/services/provincial-film-commission/in-production/ |archive-date=2023-03-30 |access-date=2023-10-08 |website={{tsl|en|Creative BC Film Commission||Creative BC Film Commission}}}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-04-20 |title=Never Let Go: Halle Berry / Alexandre Aja horror project is now filming |url=https://www.joblo.com/never-let-go-berry-aja/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230512180553/https://www.joblo.com/never-let-go-berry-aja/ |archive-date=2023-05-12 |access-date=2024-02-19 |website={{tsl|en|JoBlo.com||JoBlo.com}}}}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年9月19日在[[奇幻电影节]]首映<ref>{{cite web|title=Fantastic Fest Unveils 2024 Lineup Featuring 'Terrifier 3,' 'Apartment 7A,' 'Anora,' 'Never Let Go' & More|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2024-08-15|access-date=2024-08-16|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/fantastic-fest-2024-lineup-terrifier-3-never-let-go-unveiled-1236040859/|archive-date=2024-08-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240821025215/https://deadline.com/2024/08/fantastic-fest-2024-lineup-terrifier-3-never-let-go-unveiled-1236040859/|dead-url=no}}</ref>，次日在美国院线上映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/halle-berry-never-let-go-release-date-1236039085/|title=Halle Berry Horror Movie ''Never Let Go'' Going Earlier In The Fall|date=2024-08-13|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-08-13|archive-date=2024-08-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240814135023/https://deadline.com/2024/08/halle-berry-never-let-go-release-date-1236039085/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。电影原定于9月27日上映，之后宣布提前，原档期改上映《[[夺魂锯X]]》<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-04-09 |title=''The Crow'' Flies To August, Halle Berry Pic ''Never Let Go'' Sets Fall, ''Saw XI'' To Slice 2025, 'Best Christmas Pageant Ever' Earlier – Lionsgate Release Date Changes |url=https://deadline.com/2024/04/lionsgate-the-crow-saw-xi-never-let-go-halle-berry-release-dates-1235879683/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240409224519/https://deadline.com/2024/04/lionsgate-the-crow-saw-xi-never-let-go-halle-berry-release-dates-1235879683/ |archive-date=2024-04-09 |url-status=live |access-date=2024-04-10 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。

