《'''噢，加拿大'''》（{{langx|en|''Oh, Canada''}}）是2024年上映的美国[[剧情片]]，由[[保罗·许瑞德]]执导、编剧，改编自美国作家[[罗素·班克斯]]2021年出版的小说《已成定局》。演员阵容包括[[李察·基尔]]、[[雅各·艾洛迪]]、[[乌玛·瑟曼]]、{{tsl|en|Victoria Hill|维多利亚·希尔}}、[[米高·伊派里奥里]]、{{tsl|en|Penelope Mitchell|佩内洛普·米切尔}}和[[克莉丝汀·弗洛赛斯]]<ref>{{cite web |last1=Thompson |first1=Anne |title=Paul Schrader on the 'Explicit' Script He Gave to Elisabeth Moss: 'I'm an Old Male. How Am I Going to Direct This?' |date=2023-05-09 |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/paul-schrader-wga-strike-ai-elisabeth-moss-movie-1234860543/ |publisher=IndieWire |access-date=2023-09-16 |archive-date=2023-09-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230920023836/https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/paul-schrader-wga-strike-ai-elisabeth-moss-movie-1234860543/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片是基尔与施拉德继《[[美国舞男]]》后第二度携手<ref>{{cite web |last1=Thompson |first1=Anne |title=Paul Schrader on the 'Explicit' Script He Gave to Elisabeth Moss: 'I'm an Old Male. How Am I Going to Direct This?' |date=2023-05-09 |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/paul-schrader-wga-strike-ai-elisabeth-moss-movie-1234860543/ |publisher=IndieWire |access-date=2023-09-16 |archive-date=2023-09-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230920023836/https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/paul-schrader-wga-strike-ai-elisabeth-moss-movie-1234860543/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，也是施拉德在1997年的《{{tsl|en|Affliction (1997 film)|苦难 (电影)|苦难}}》后第二部改编自班克斯小说的电影。

电影于2024年5月17日在[[第77届坎城影展]]全球首映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.festival-cannes.com/en/2024/the-screenings-guide-of-the-77th-festival-de-cannes/|title=The Screenings Guide of the 77th Festival de Cannes|date=2024-05-08|website=Festival de Cannes|access-date=2024-05-08|archive-date=2024-05-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240508200110/https://www.festival-cannes.com/en/2024/the-screenings-guide-of-the-77th-festival-de-cannes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 故事大纲 ==
身患绝症的左翼作家伦纳德·法伊夫为躲避{{tsl|en|Draft evasion in the Vietnam War|越战征兵抽签的逃避情况|越战征兵抽签}}，逃到加拿大。临终前，伦纳德委托纪录片电影马尔科姆和戴安娜记录他的遗言。但事实上伦纳德生活窘迫，记忆扭曲，不是[[不可靠的叙事者|可靠叙事者]]<ref>{{cite web |last1=Barfield |first1=Charles |title='Oh, Canada': Paul Schrader Confirms New Film Will Star Richard Gere & Jacob Elordi |url=https://theplaylist.net/oh-canada-paul-schrader-confirms-new-film-will-star-richard-gere-jacob-elordi-20230911/ |publisher=The Playlist |access-date=2023-09-16 |archive-date=2023-09-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230920140733/https://theplaylist.net/oh-canada-paul-schrader-confirms-new-film-will-star-richard-gere-jacob-elordi-20230911/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=romney>{{cite web |last1=Romney |first1=Jonathan |title=‘Oh, Canada’: Cannes Review |url=https://www.screendaily.com/reviews/oh-canada-cannes-review/5193323.article |website=Screen Daily |accessdate=2024-09-10 |date=2024-05-17 |archive-date=2024-06-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240602005442/https://www.screendaily.com/reviews/oh-canada-cannes-review/5193323.article |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

