== 制片 ==
[[File:Oh, Canada Press Conference at 2024 Cannes Film Festival.jpg|thumb|主创团队出席戛纳记者会]]
剧组获[[受2023年演员工会-美国电视和广播艺人联合会大罢工影响的作品列表|美国演员工会豁免]]，可以在演员工会大罢工期间拍摄。2023年9月，主体拍摄正式启动，至同年10月结束，历时三个星期<ref>{{cite web |last1=Ruimy |first1=Jordan |title=Paul Schrader's 'Oh, Canada' Starts Production in NYC |date=2019-08-19 |url=https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2023/9/15/74blksb7gh05baqfex1neozn6ocg5e |publisher=World of Reel |access-date=2023-09-16 |archive-date=2023-09-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230920141148/https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2023/9/15/74blksb7gh05baqfex1neozn6ocg5e |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.orangecountynyfilm.org/news/paul-schraders-oh-canada-wraps-production/|title=Paul Schrader's 'Oh' Canada' Wraps Production|website=Orange County Film Office|date=2023-10-12|accessdate=2023-10-29|archive-date=2023-10-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231028230622/https://www.orangecountynyfilm.org/news/paul-schraders-oh-canada-wraps-production/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2023年12月，消息指[[克莉丝汀·弗洛赛斯]]、[[米高·伊派里奥里]]和[[乌玛·瑟曼]]加盟剧组<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/oh-canada-movie-kristine-froseth-richard-gere-jacob-elordi-1235652626/|title=Kristine Froseth Joins Richard Gere, Jacob Elordi In Paul Schrader Pic 'Oh, Canada'|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2023-12-05|access-date=2023-12-08|archive-date=2023-12-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231208165725/https://deadline.com/2023/12/oh-canada-movie-kristine-froseth-richard-gere-jacob-elordi-1235652626/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/oh-canada-movie-michael-imperioli-1235659416/|title=Michael Imperioli Boards Paul Schrader's 'Oh, Canada|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2023-12-08|access-date=2023-12-08|archive-date=2023-12-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231208220447/https://deadline.com/2023/12/oh-canada-movie-michael-imperioli-1235659416/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2023-12-12 |title=Uma Thurman Confirmed To Join Richard Gere, Jacob Elordi In 'Oh, Canada' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/oh-canada-movie-uma-thurman-richard-gere-1235662448/ |access-date=2024-01-13 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-02-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240208053202/https://deadline.com/2023/12/oh-canada-movie-uma-thurman-richard-gere-1235662448/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。因薪水较低，[[罗伯特·德尼罗]]婉拒演出机会，由基尔接任<ref>{{cite web |last1=Brzeski |first1=Patrick |title=Paul Schrader in Cannes: “Every Time I’m Getting Ready to Die, I Have a New Idea” |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/paul-schrader-cannes-oh-canada-interview-1235902912/ |website=The Hollywood Reporter |accessdate=2024-09-10 |date=2024-05-18}}</ref>。与施拉德在《{{tsl|en|First Reformed|牧师的最后诱惑}}》中有过合作的弧光影业（Arclight Films）同意参与本片融资，负责在[[柏林国际电影节|欧洲电影市场]]期间销售影片<ref>{{cite web |last1=Keslassy |first1=Elsa |title=Arclight Films Boards Paul Schrader's 'Oh, Canada' Starring Jacob Elordi, Richard Gere (EXCLUSIVE) |date=2024-02-08 |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/oh-canada-arclight-films-jacob-elordi-richard-gere-1235902005/ |publisher=Variety |access-date=2024-02-08 |archive-date=2024-02-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240214210011/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/oh-canada-arclight-films-jacob-elordi-richard-gere-1235902005/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

