== 制作 ==
本片改编自{{le|1994年北美寒流|1994 North American cold wave}}期间发生的真实事件。音乐家{{le|戴夫·马修斯|Dave Matthews}}向制片人强·柏格（{{lang|en|Jon Berg}}）推销了此故事，柏格将此引荐给[[狮门影视公司|狮门]]，狮门则找上{{le|凯文·唐恩斯|Kevin Downes}}及其{{le|王国故事公司|Kingdom Story Company}}团队，打算将其拍成剧情片。<ref>{{cite web | url=https://writerofpop.com/2023/09/14/award-winning-producer-of-ordinary-angels-is-hoping-for-a-big-impact/ | title=Award-Winning Producer of 'Ordinary Angels' is Hoping for a Big Impact | date=2023-09-14 | access-date=2024-12-08 | archive-date=2024-03-04 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240304074827/https://writerofpop.com/2023/09/14/award-winning-producer-of-ordinary-angels-is-hoping-for-a-big-impact/ | dead-url=no }}</ref>据2022年3月的报导，本片由[[希拉蕊·史旺]]和[[艾伦·里奇森]]主演，{{le|强·冈恩|Jon Gunn}}执导并与[[厄文兄弟|强·厄文]]编写了剧本草稿的最新版。[[梅格·蒂莉]]和{{le|凯莉·弗莱蒙·克雷格|Kelly Fremon Craig}}贡献了剧本的初期稿并最终获得了编剧署名。<ref name=":0">{{cite web|last=Grobar|first=Matt|title=Hilary Swank & 'Reacher' Breakout Alan Ritchson To Lead Kingdom Story Company's 'Ordinary Angels'; Lionsgate Distributing|date=2022-03-24|website=Deadline Hollywood|url=https://deadline.com/2022/03/hilary-swank-alan-ritchson-to-star-in-ordinary-angels-for-lionsgate-1234986170/|accessdate=2022-04-24|archive-date=2022-04-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220409064740/https://deadline.com/2022/03/hilary-swank-alan-ritchson-to-star-in-ordinary-angels-for-lionsgate-1234986170/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Ordinary Angels |url=https://directories.wga.org/project/1226943/ordinary-angels |access-date=2023-05-17 |website={{le|美国西部编剧工会|Writers Guild of America West|Writers Guild of America West}} |archive-date=2024-12-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241202012847/https://directories.wga.org/project/1226943/ordinary-angels |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2023-03-16 |title=Lionsgate Dates ''Ordinary Angels'' Drama Starring Hilary Swank, Alan Ritchson |url=https://deadline.com/2023/03/hilary-swank-movie-ordinary-angels-release-date-lionsgate-1235302081/ |access-date=2023-05-17 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-03-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230320053759/https://deadline.com/2023/03/hilary-swank-movie-ordinary-angels-release-date-lionsgate-1235302081/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>电影2022年4月在加拿大[[温尼伯]]展开[[主要拍摄]]<ref>{{cite web|last=McKendrick|first=Devon|title=Where Hilary Swank and Alan Ritchson have been spotted in Winnipeg|date=2022-04-25|website=CTV News|url=https://winnipeg.ctvnews.ca/where-hilary-swank-and-alan-ritchson-have-been-spotted-in-winnipeg-1.5875862|accessdate=2022-04-29|archive-date=2022-10-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221027000930/https://winnipeg.ctvnews.ca/where-hilary-swank-and-alan-ritchson-have-been-spotted-in-winnipeg-1.5875862|dead-url=no}}</ref>，2022年6月在[[纽约州]][[奥尔巴尼]]拍摄<ref>{{cite web|url=https://thecinemaholic.com/ordinary-angels-where-filmed/|title=Ordinary Angels: Where Was the Inspiring Movie Filmed?|last=Singh|first=Sartaj|work=The Cinemaholic|date=2024-02-21|accessdate=2024-12-08}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
《普通天使》由[[狮门影视公司|狮门]]定档2024年2月23日于美国院线上映，2024年3月26日采[[随选视讯|VOD]]发行<ref name="NUM" />。电影在美国原定2023年10月13日上映<ref name="Release">{{Cite web|url=https://www.today.com/popculture/movies/ordinary-angels-hilary-swank-movie-details-rcna75271?fbclid=IwAR1aGCHy9tJ3q11tgNalwSqGOBHSmduHAsPCd7MH5tzhp4gTxe0PQyKS1b8|title=Hilary Swank's 'Ordinary Angels' follows an act of heroism during a catastrophic storm|website=TODAY.com|date=2023-03-16|first=Ryan|last=Hudgins|access-date=2023-04-04|archive-date=2024-12-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241202013234/https://www.today.com/popculture/movies/ordinary-angels-hilary-swank-movie-details-rcna75271?fbclid=IwAR1aGCHy9tJ3q11tgNalwSqGOBHSmduHAsPCd7MH5tzhp4gTxe0PQyKS1b8|dead-url=no}}</ref>，为了避免与演唱会电影《[[泰勒·斯威夫特：时代巡回演唱会]]》竞争而延期<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-09-01 |title='Ordinary Angels' Flying Away From Taylor Swift – Release Date Change |url=https://deadline.com/2023/09/taylor-swift-ordinary-angels-release-date-change-1235534462/ |access-date=2023-09-02 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2023-09-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230920190233/https://deadline.com/2023/09/taylor-swift-ordinary-angels-release-date-change-1235534462/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。不久之后，[[索尼影视集团|索尼影视发行国际]]以[[第六摄影棚电影]]的名义取得部分国家的发行权。电影2024年4月26日在英国上映。<ref name="BBFC"/>

== 反响 ==
=== 票房 ===
在美国和加拿大，《普通天使》与《{{le|鬼灭之刃 绊之奇迹，迈向柱训练|Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba – To the Hashira Training}}》和《{{le|浪迹女孩|Drive-Away Dolls}}》一起上映，外界预估本片于首映周末能从2800家影院获得500至700万美元的票房<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-02-21 |title='Bob Marley: One Love' To Stay High As A Kite At Box Office Until 'Dune' Gang Arrives – Preview |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/bob-marley-one-love-drive-away-dolls-demon-slayer-box-office-1235833436/ |access-date=2024-02-21 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-02-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240221223552/https://deadline.com/2024/02/bob-marley-one-love-drive-away-dolls-demon-slayer-box-office-1235833436/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片首映票房达650万美元，位居当周票房排名第三<ref name=opening>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/box-office-bob-marley-one-love-demon-slayer-madame-web-1235835359/|title='Bob Marley: One Love' At $120M+ WW Takes Out Three Little Birds At The Box Office – Sunday Update|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2024-02-25|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|access-date=2024-02-25|archive-date=2024-02-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240226205350/https://deadline.com/2024/02/box-office-bob-marley-one-love-demon-slayer-madame-web-1235835359/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=McClintock |first=Pamela |date=2024-02-24 |title=Box Office: Bob Marley's ''One Love'' Still Rocking at No. 1, ''Madame Web'' and ''Drive-Away Dolls'' Spin Out |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/bob-marley-one-love-box-office-drive-away-dolls-madame-web-1235834503/ |access-date=2024-02-24 |website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2024-02-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240224203335/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/bob-marley-one-love-box-office-drive-away-dolls-madame-web-1235834503/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。第二个周末票房为390万美元（仅下降38%），同样名列第三<ref>{{Cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |date=2024-03-03 |title='Dune: Part Two': How Sci-Fi Space Worm Epic Reared Head To $81.5M Opening After Strike Release Delay – Sunday Box Office Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-dune-part-two-1235842667/ |access-date=2024-03-03 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-03-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240302235212/https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-dune-part-two-1235842667/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

=== 评价 ===
本片在[[烂番茄]]网站上根据100名影评人的评分，新鲜度达84%，平均得分6.5／10。该网站的共识影评：「希拉蕊·史旺凭借著一丝优雅及宿命气息，稳定了这种甜美的人性表现，扮演了触动所有《普通天使》心弦的角色。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/ordinary_angels|title=Ordinary Angels (2024)|work=[[烂番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-12-08|archive-date=2024-12-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241203011350/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/ordinary_angels|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]网站上，电影根据16名影评人的评分，取得57分（满分100），象征「普遍好评」<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/ordinary-angels|title=Ordinary Angels|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-12-08|archive-date=2024-10-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241007155724/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/ordinary-angels/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。受[[CinemaScore]]调查的观众在A+至F间，给予本片罕见的「A+」<ref name=opening/>。

《[[综艺 (杂志)|综艺]]》的寇特妮·霍华德（{{lang|en|Courtney Howard}}）在影评中写道：「史旺的角色好猜到令人生畏，但凭借她干练的演技，足以深植人心并唤起同情。此外，她与米契和休斯相处的情景浑然天成，两位童星本身就是冉冉升起的新星，以合适的表演成功演出了早熟的效果。」<ref name="VarietyReview">{{Cite web |last=Howard |first=Courtney |date=2024-02-20 |title=''Ordinary Angels'' Review: Hilary Swank and Alan Ritchson's Inspirational Weepy Tugs at the Heartstrings |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/ordinary-angels-review-1235916521/ |access-date=2024-02-20 |website=Variety |archive-date=2024-02-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240220170017/https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/ordinary-angels-review-1235916521/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>

