==制作==
===开发===
瓜达尼诺一直想把[[威廉·柏洛兹]]1985年出版的小说《{{tsl|en|Queer (novel)|酷儿 (小说)|酷儿}}》改编成电影，这本书是他17岁的时候就看过的。2022年4月，他将这本书介绍给编剧{{tsl|en|Justin Kuritzkes|贾斯汀·库里茨克斯}}，当时他们正在波士顿拍《[[挑战者 (2024年电影)|挑战者]]》<ref name="rep">{{Cite web|title=Challengers è il nuovo film sul tennis di Luca Guadagnino: "I fischi ai miei film? La gente si offende troppo facilmente"|url=https://www.repubblica.it/venerdi/2024/03/21/news/luca_guadagnino_challengers_zendaya-422352838/|last=Jacobbi|first=Paola|date=2024-03-22|website=[[共和国报 (意大利)|la Repubblica]]|language=it|access-date=2024-03-26|url-access=subscription|archive-date=2024-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329204814/https://www.repubblica.it/venerdi/2024/03/21/news/luca_guadagnino_challengers_zendaya-422352838/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。瓜达尼诺给库里茨克斯买了这本书，库里茨克斯一读便爱上。制片人{{tsl|en|Lorenzo Mieli|洛伦佐·米埃里}}联络了著作的版权方，在跟巴勒斯资产的{{tsl|en|literary executor|遗著管理人}}{{tsl|en|James Grauerholz|詹姆斯·格劳尔霍尔兹}}通电话后，他们拿下小说的电影改编权。库里茨克斯还在创作《挑战者》的时候，就已经开始撰写《酷儿》的剧本<ref name="rep"/>。由于《酷儿》发行的版本是非完整版，库里茨克斯和瓜达尼诺向巴勒斯著作学者奥利弗·哈里斯（Oliver Harris）请教，问他如何在保持作者视角的情况下，给编剧补上一个合适的结局<ref name="VQ">{{cite news|last=Vivarelli|first=Nick|date=2024-09-02|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/luca-guadagnino-queer-on-screen-sex-daniel-craig-venice-1236127658/|title=Luca Guadagnino Unpacks ‘Queer’: How Burroughs’ ‘Universal’ Love Story, Casting Daniel Craig and Lots of On-Screen Sex Resulted in a ‘Very Revolutionary’ Film |work=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|access-date=2024-09-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240903131652/https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/luca-guadagnino-queer-on-screen-sex-daniel-craig-venice-1236127658/|archive-date=2024-09-03}}</ref>。瓜达尼诺称《酷儿》是最能展现他个人思想感情的电影，同时致敬了{{tsl|en|Powell and Pressburger|迈克尔·鲍威尔和埃默里克·普雷斯伯格}}执导电影《[[红菱艳]]》（1948年）<ref name="CCN">{{cite news|last=Cavaggioni|first=Alessandro|date=2024-06-22|url=https://cinecittanews.it/guadagnino-queer-sara-il-mio-film-piu-personale/|title=Guadagnino: "Queer sarà il mio film più personale"|work=Cinecittà News|language=it|access-date=2024-09-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240623030629/https://cinecittanews.it/guadagnino-queer-sara-il-mio-film-piu-personale/|archive-date=2024-06-23}}</ref>。

2022年12月，消息指[[丹尼尔·克雷格]]就演出事宜进行洽谈<ref>{{Cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |last2=Kroll |first2=Justin |date=2022-12-09 |title=Luca Guadagnino-Directed Adaptation Of 'Queer' With Daniel Craig In Works |url=https://deadline.com/2022/12/daniel-craig-luca-guadagnino-queer-1235194243/ |access-date=2022-12-13 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2022-12-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221213203646/https://deadline.com/2022/12/daniel-craig-luca-guadagnino-queer-1235194243/ |url-status=live}}</ref>。瓜达尼诺的人才中介{{tsl|en|Bryan Lourd|布莱恩·劳德}}将剧本寄给克雷格后不久，克雷格同意出演。瓜达尼诺后来回忆：“丹尼尔和我在一个礼拜后通了电话。之后又过了一个礼拜，他就参与电影<ref name="VQ"/>。”2023年4月，[[莱斯莉·曼维尔]]、[[詹森·舒瓦兹曼]]和{{tsl|en|Henry Zaga|亨利·扎格}}参演电影<ref name="Vivarelli"/>。[[德鲁·斯塔基]]将另一部作品的试镜录像交给瓜达尼诺看，之后也入选。瓜达尼诺曾就选斯塔基的问题咨询克雷格，克雷格看过录像，告诉瓜达尼诺“就是他了”<ref>{{cite web |last1=Cartter|first1=Eileen |title= Is Outer Banks Star Drew Starkey Hollywood's Next Prestige Heartthrob?|date=2024-02-29|work= [[GQ]]|url=https://www.gq.com/story/drew-starkey-profile|archive-url=https://archive.today/20240229144811/https://www.gq.com/story/drew-starkey-profile?utm_medium=social&mbid=social_twitter&utm_social-type=owned&utm_source=twitter&utm_brand=gq|archive-date=2024-02-29|access-date=2024-03-26}}</ref>。共有300人试镜了斯塔基的角色<ref name="VQ"/>。2024年6月，消息指[[阿里尔·舒曼]]、[[李桑德罗·阿隆索]]和[[大卫·罗利]]三位导演也出现在电影中<ref name="CCN"/>。

===拍摄===
[[主体拍摄]]于2023年4月29日在[[意大利]][[罗马]]启动<ref>{{Cite web |last=Deon |first=Brynn |date=2023-04-29 |title=Luca Guadagnino's 'Queer' Has Begun Filming |url=https://maxblizz.com/luca-guadagninos-queer-has-begun-filming/ |access-date=2023-06-30 |website=Maxblizz |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-04-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240418081844/https://maxblizz.com/luca-guadagninos-queer-has-begun-filming/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="Vivarelli"/>。电影还在意大利[[奇尼奇塔]]电影制片厂拍摄。其他取景地包括[[厄瓜多尔]][[基多]]，此地代替了片中的[[墨西哥城]]。拍摄工作于同年6月29日杀青<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony|date=2023-09-03 |title=Lorenzo Mieli: How The Italian Producer Of Sofia Coppola's 'Priscilla', Luca Guadagnino's 'Queer' & HBO's 'My Brilliant Friend' Is Breaking Global Boundaries – Venice|url=https://deadline.com/2023/09/lorenzo-mieli-priscilla-producer-sofia-coppola-my-brilliant-friend-luca-guadagnino-1235534484/|access-date= 2023-10-16|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-09-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230903234409/https://deadline.com/2023/09/lorenzo-mieli-priscilla-producer-sofia-coppola-my-brilliant-friend-luca-guadagnino-1235534484/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite Instagram |author=Jonathan Anderson|user=jonathan.anderson|postid=CuFRNa4svGq |date=2023-06-29 |title=Today we wrap |access-date=2024-06-28 |url-status=live}}</ref>。西班牙奢侈品牌[[罗威]]的创意总监{{tsl|en|Jonathan Anderson (fashion designer)|乔纳森·安德森}}继《挑战者》后二度携手瓜达尼诺，担任本片的服装设计<ref name="Vivarelli"/><ref>{{Cite web |last=Cartner-Morley |first=Jess |date=2023-02-17 |title=Fashion needs to step up as UK is 'in a paralysis', says Jonathan Anderson |url=https://www.theguardian.com/fashion/2023/feb/17/british-fashion-needs-to-say-something-says-designer-jonathan-anderson |access-date=2023-04-21 |website=[[卫报|The Guardian]] |url-status=live |archive-date=2023-03-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230319060034/https://www.theguardian.com/fashion/2023/feb/17/british-fashion-needs-to-say-something-says-designer-jonathan-anderson}}</ref>。

===后期制作===
电影初剪版长达185分钟至200分钟，这个版本被递交给[[威尼斯电影节]]组委会，获接受。最终放映的版本被剪到135分钟<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/story/venice-film-festivals-artistic-director-interview-awards-insider|title=Venice Film Festival's Artistic Director on the Boldest Films and Biggest Stars of This Year's Lineup|url-access=limited|date=2024-08-15|first=Rebecca|last=Ford|website=[[名利场 (杂志)|Vanity Fair]]|access-date=2024-08-16|quote=There were three versions of the film. The first one was more than three hours long. The second one was two and one half. The final version is two hours and 15 minutes.|archive-date=2024-09-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240902211810/https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/story/venice-film-festivals-artistic-director-interview-awards-insider|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://lucysullacultura.com/una-vita-per-il-cinema-intervista-ad-alberto-barbera/|language=it|trans-title=A Life for Cinema. Interview with Alberto Barbera|title=Una vita per il cinema. Intervista ad Alberto Barbera|date=2024-08-26|first=Lorenzo|last=Gramatica|website=Lucy. Sulla cultura|access-date=2024-08-26|archive-date=2024-08-31|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240831192356/https://lucysullacultura.com/una-vita-per-il-cinema-intervista-ad-alberto-barbera/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==发行==
2024年2月，《[[综艺 (杂志)|综艺]]》杂志称电影有望在2024年底的各大电影展巡演<ref>{{Cite web |last=Vivarelli |first=Nick |date=2024-02-17 |title=New Italian Movies Set to Hit This Year's Festival Circuit |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/italian-movies-festival-circuit-1235915121/|access-date=2024-03-26|website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|language=en-US|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240627015111/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/italian-movies-festival-circuit-1235915121/|archive-date=2024-06-27}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Josh O'Connor in Talks to Star in Luca Guadagnino's Gay Romance Film 'Separate Rooms' (EXCLUSIVE) |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/josh-oconnor-luca-guadagnino-separate-rooms-gay-romance-1235950925/|last=Vivarelli|first=Nick|date=2024-03-25|website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|language=en|access-date=2024-03-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240620175251/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/josh-oconnor-luca-guadagnino-separate-rooms-gay-romance-1235950925/|archive-date=2024-06-20}}</ref>。2024年7月，电影入选[[第81届威尼斯影展]]主竞赛单元，将在电影节上首映<ref name="Venice">{{Cite web|title=Venice Film Festival Reveals Lineup (Updating Live)|first1=Nick|last1=Vivarelli|first2=Ellise|last2=Shafer|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/venice-film-festival-lineup-2024-1236079828/|date=2024-07-23|website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|language=en|access-date=2024-07-23|archive-date=2024-07-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240723094540/https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/venice-film-festival-lineup-2024-1236079828/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2024年8月，电影入选{{tsl|en|2024 New York Film Festival|2024年纽约电影节|第62届纽约电影节}}“聚光灯晚会”（Spotlight Gala）单元<ref>{{Cite web |title=Queer |url=https://www.tiff.net/events/queer |access-date=2024-08-25 |website=TIFF |language=en |archive-date=2024-08-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240830131210/https://www.tiff.net/events/queer |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同月，[[A24 (公司)|A24]]买下电影美国发行权<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/queer-daniel-craig-luca-guadagnino-a24-1236072192/|title=Luca Guadagnino's Daniel Craig Feature ''Queer'' Landing At A24|date=2024-08-28|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-08-28|archive-date=2024-09-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240902082144/https://deadline.com/2024/08/queer-daniel-craig-luca-guadagnino-a24-1236072192/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

