== 制作 ==
2020年11月，[[派拉蒙影业]]聘请[[杰夫·尼科尔斯]]编导一部根据[[约翰·卡拉辛斯基]]的构思为基础的外传电影，而卡拉辛斯基、[[麦可·贝]]、[[安德鲁·福姆]]和[[布莱德·富勒 (制片人)|布莱德·富勒]]将担任制片人<ref>{{cite news|last=Kit|first=Borys|date=2020-11-09|title='A Quiet Place' Spinoff in the Works With Jeff Nichols Writing, Directing|work=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/a-quiet-place-spinoff-in-the-works-with-jeff-nichols-writing-directing|access-date=2020-11-10|archive-date=2020-12-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201201203253/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/a-quiet-place-spinoff-in-the-works-with-jeff-nichols-writing-directing|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|last=Barry|first=John W.|date=2020-11-20|title='A Quiet Place' in Dutchess again? Site scouting underway for spinoff|work=Poughkeepsie Journal|url=https://www.poughkeepsiejournal.com/story/entertainment/2020/11/20/quiet-place-spinoff-dutchess-site-scouting/6360283002/|access-date=2020-11-22|archive-date=2021-06-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210627220740/https://www.poughkeepsiejournal.com/story/entertainment/2020/11/20/quiet-place-spinoff-dutchess-site-scouting/6360283002/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.varietyinsight.com/production_restart_full_view.php?track_id=184658 | title=Film and TV Projects Going Into Production - Nichols, Jeff A Quiet Place Spin-off Project|work=[[Variety]] |access-date=2021-05-06|url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210506171214/https://www.varietyinsight.com/production_restart_full_view.php?track_id=184658 |archive-date=2021-05-06}}</ref>。2021年5月，卡拉辛斯基宣布剧本已经完成<ref>{{cite web|url=https://screenrant.com/quiet-place-3-spinoff-script-finished-john-krasinski/|work=[[Screen Rant]]|title=Next Quiet Place Movie Script Has Already Been Written|last=Deloss|first=John|date=2021-05-29|accessdate=2022-04-28|archive-date=2023-01-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230109193426/https://screenrant.com/quiet-place-3-spinoff-script-finished-john-krasinski/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2021年10月，尼科尔斯因创作分歧辞去导演一职<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2021/10/jeff-nichols-parts-quiet-place-paramount-1234863556/#recipient_hashed=d0283a1bba933056df855a79b27212d8d9d484399087dbfbe4ed575e79a09217|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|title=Jeff Nichols Parts Ways With Next 'Quiet Place' Movie At Paramount|author=Kroll, Justin|date=2021-10-27|accessdate=2022-04-28|archive-date=2023-01-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230117124634/https://deadline.com/2021/10/jeff-nichols-parts-quiet-place-paramount-1234863556/#recipient_hashed=d0283a1bba933056df855a79b27212d8d9d484399087dbfbe4ed575e79a09217|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年1月，宣布{{le|麦可·萨诺斯基|Michael Sarnoski}}担任导演职务，并会重写剧本<ref>{{Cite web|last=Kroll|first=Justin|date=2022-01-11|title='Pig' Director Michael Sarnoski To Helm Next 'A Quiet Place' Pic For Paramount|url=https://deadline.com/2022/01/pig-michael-sarnoski-quiet-place-1234907122/|access-date=2022-01-24|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|archive-date=2023-02-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230208045052/https://deadline.com/2022/01/pig-michael-sarnoski-quiet-place-1234907122/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年4月，派拉蒙影业于国际电影展CinemaCon标上正式公布片名为「{{lang|en|A Quiet Place: Day One}}」<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.thewrap.com/a-quiet-place-spinoff-is-titled-a-quiet-place-day-one/|work=[[The Wrap]]|title='A Quiet Place' Spinoff Will Be Titled 'A Quiet Place: Day One'|last=Fuster|first=Jeremy|date=2022-04-28|accessdate=2022-04-28|archive-date=2023-01-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230120233920/https://www.thewrap.com/a-quiet-place-spinoff-is-titled-a-quiet-place-day-one/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.slashfilm.com/846775/a-quiet-place-day-one-is-the-title-of-the-new-spin-off-film/|work=[[/Film]]|title=A Quiet Place: Day One Is The Title Of The New Spin-Off Film [CinemaCon 2022]|last=Mathai|first=Jeremy|date=2022-04-28|accessdate=2022-04-28|archive-date=2023-01-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230113011322/https://www.slashfilm.com/846775/a-quiet-place-day-one-is-the-title-of-the-new-spin-off-film/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3712890/a-quiet-place-day-one-is-the-official-title-for-third-franchise-movie/|work=Bloody Disgusting|title='A Quiet Place: Day One' is the Official Title for Third Franchise Movie|author=Squires, John|date=2022-04-28|accessdate=2022-04-28|archive-date=2022-04-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220428170544/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3712890/a-quiet-place-day-one-is-the-official-title-for-third-franchise-movie/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年11月，[[露琵塔·尼咏欧]]和[[乔瑟夫·昆恩]]洽谈出演<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-11-01 |title='A Quiet Place: Day One' At Paramount Taps Lupita Nyong’o To Star |url=https://deadline.com/2022/11/a-quiet-place-day-one-paramount-lupita-nyongo-1235159475/ |access-date=2022-11-02 |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2022-12-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221203090031/https://deadline.com/2022/11/a-quiet-place-day-one-paramount-lupita-nyongo-1235159475/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="Cast">{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-11-16 |title='Stranger Things' Breakout Joseph Quinn In Talks For Leading Role In 'A Quiet Place: Day One' Starring Lupita Nyong'o |url=https://deadline.com/2022/11/stranger-things-joseph-quinn-lupita-nyongo-quiet-place-day-one-1235174078/ |access-date=2022-11-17 |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-02-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230208210349/https://deadline.com/2022/11/stranger-things-joseph-quinn-lupita-nyongo-quiet-place-day-one-1235174078/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

