== 制片 ==
=== 开发 ===
[[File:A Real Pain movie production in Lublin.jpg|thumb|剧组在[[卢布林]]拍戏]]
2022年8月，[[国际银幕]]独家报道[[杰西·艾森柏格]]担任电影导演、编剧与主演，与[[基伦·克金]]演对手戏。{{tsl|en|Fruit Tree (company)|果树影业}}的[[艾玛·史东]]、{{tsl|en|Dave McCary|戴夫·麦卡里}}和阿丽·赫廷（Ali Herting）将担任制片<ref name="ScreenExclu">{{cite web |last=Dalton |first=Ben |date=2022-08-17 |title=Jesse Eisenberg to direct ''A Real Pain'', will star opposite Kieran Culkin (exclusive) |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/jesse-eisenberg-to-direct-a-real-pain-will-star-opposite-kieran-culkin-exclusive/5173533.article |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240111041001/https://www.screendaily.com/news/jesse-eisenberg-to-direct-a-real-pain-will-star-opposite-kieran-culkin-exclusive/5173533.article |archive-date=2024-01-11 |access-date=2023-12-06 |website=[[国际银幕|Screen International]]}}</ref>。电影是艾森伯格继《{{tsl|en|When You Finish Saving the World (film)|当你拯救完世界}}》（2022年）后第二部担任导演兼编剧的电影，也是双方继《当你拯救完世界》的第二次携手<ref>{{Cite web |last=Goslin |first=Austen |date=2024-01-26 |title=Jesse Eisenberg's new movie ''A Real Pain'' has what ''Succession'' fans have been missing |url=https://www.polygon.com/reviews/24050799/real-pain-kieran-culkin-jesse-eisenberg-succession-sundance-2024 |access-date=2024-01-27 |website=Polygon |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213085435/https://www.polygon.com/reviews/24050799/real-pain-kieran-culkin-jesse-eisenberg-succession-sundance-2024 |url-status=live }}</ref>。电影也是克金自电视剧《[[继承之战]]》后的首个大项目<ref name="VFPod">{{Cite web |last=Canfield |first=David |date=2024-11-05 |title=Live With Kieran Culkin: On ''A Real Pain'', Post-''Succession'' "Terror," and His Next Big Role |url=https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/kieran-culkin-a-real-pain-little-gold-men-live-vanity-fair |access-date=2024-12-12 |website=[[名利场 (杂志)|Vanity Fair]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-02-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250211201646/https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/kieran-culkin-a-real-pain-little-gold-men-live-vanity-fair |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

开发电影前，艾森伯格并不熟悉克金的作品，但在妹妹的建议下，根据克金的精神选择了他<ref name="IWSundance">{{Cite web |last1=Bergeson |first1=Samantha |last2=Perella |first2=Vincent |date=2024-01-19 |title=Jesse Eisenberg Hadn't Seen ''Succession'' Before Casting Kieran Culkin in ''A Real Pain'' |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/jesse-eisenberg-never-saw-succession-before-casting-kieran-culkin-1234945878/ |access-date=2024-12-14 |website=[[IndieWire]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-01-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250118015335/https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/jesse-eisenberg-never-saw-succession-before-casting-kieran-culkin-1234945878/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="Tribeca">{{Cite web |last=Goldsmith |first=Jill |date=2024-06-14 |title=Kieran Culkin And Jesse Eisenberg Talk ''A Real Pain'', ''Home Alone'' & ''Succession'' At Tribeca Festival |url=https://deadline.com/2024/06/kieran-culkin-jesse-eisenberg-a-real-pain-tribeca-festival-talk-1235972937/ |access-date=2024-12-13 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-12-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241226111251/https://deadline.com/2024/06/kieran-culkin-jesse-eisenberg-a-real-pain-tribeca-festival-talk-1235972937/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。艾森伯格一开始想找[[犹太人|犹太]]演员，而克金是[[爱尔兰天主教徒]]<ref name="Kepnes">{{cite web |last=Kepnes |first=Caroline |date=2006-06-03 |title=Mila Kunis on Culkin: "No my boyfriend was raised Irish Catholic... |url=http://www.jvibe.com/popculture/mila_kunis.shtml |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20060603115539/http://www.jvibe.com/popculture/mila_kunis.shtml |archivedate=2006-06-03}}</ref>，所以没有把写好的剧本前十页给他<ref name="Richman">{{Cite web |last=Richman |first=Darren |date=2025-01-13 |title=Jesse Eisenberg: 'Is our modern pain valid?' |url=https://lwlies.com/interviews/jesse-eisenberg-is-our-modern-pain-valid/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20250114201637/https://lwlies.com/interviews/jesse-eisenberg-is-our-modern-pain-valid/ |archive-date=2025-01-14 |access-date=2025-01-14 |website={{tsl|en|Little White Lies (magazine)||Little White Lies}} |language=en}}</ref>。艾森伯格原本想扮演本吉，认为自己有一些性格和本吉相似，但几位制片人建议他不应该在执导的同时做一些精神错乱的表演<ref name="Richman" />。艾森伯格向[[Vulture (网站)|Vulture]]透露，对于要不要让一位非犹太演员扮演犹太角色，他有“1.7万个想法”，但“（克金）帮助我讲述了这个对我家人来说很私人的故事，给了我一份惊喜礼物<ref name="Handler">{{Cite web |last=Handler |first=Rachel |date=2024-10-22 |title=Trust the Kieran Culkin Process |url=https://www.vulture.com/article/kieran-culkin-a-real-pain-interview.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20241109222631/https://www.vulture.com/article/kieran-culkin-a-real-pain-interview.html |archive-date=2024-11-09 |access-date=2024-12-13 |website=[[Vulture (网站)|Vulture]] |language=en}}</ref>。”

另一方面，克金刚刚拍完《继承之战》，对是不是应该投入另一部“紧张”的项目犹豫不决<ref name="IWSundance2">{{Cite web |last1=Zilko |first1=Christian |last2=Blauvelt |first2=Christian |date=2024-01-20 |title=Kieran Culkin Tried to Back Out of ''A Real Pain'' After ''Succession'', but Couldn't Find a Flaw in Jesse Eisenberg's Script |url=https://www.indiewire.com/video/a-real-pain-kieran-culkin-tried-to-get-out-jesse-eisenberg-movie-1234946296/ |access-date=2024-12-13 |website=[[IndieWire]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-02-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250210034145/https://www.indiewire.com/video/a-real-pain-kieran-culkin-tried-to-get-out-jesse-eisenberg-movie-1234946296/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。正式拍摄前两周，克金想放弃，以不想离开家人为理由<ref name="Waititi">{{Cite web |last=Waititi |first=Taika |date=2023-05-22 |title=Kieran Culkin Confides in Taika Waititi About the End of ''Succession'' |url=https://www.interviewmagazine.com/film/kieran-culkin-confides-in-taika-waititi-about-the-end-of-succession?utm_source=social&utm_medium=Twitter&utm_campaign=MAY23 |access-date=2024-12-13 |website=[[访问 (杂志)|Interview]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-02-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240228133311/https://www.interviewmagazine.com/film/kieran-culkin-confides-in-taika-waititi-about-the-end-of-succession?utm_source=social&utm_medium=Twitter&utm_campaign=MAY23 |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="Soteriou">{{Cite web |last=Soteriou |first=Stephanie |date=2024-10-23 |title=Kieran Culkin Just Detailed The Full Conversation He Had With Emma Stone When He Tried To Drop Out Of Their Latest Movie — And She Handled It Like An Absolute Pro |url=https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/kieran-culkin-just-detailed-clever-145507354.html |access-date=2024-12-13 |website=[[BuzzFeed]] |language=en-US |via={{tsl|en|Yahoo! Entertainment||Yahoo! Entertainment}} |archive-date=2024-12-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241228013200/https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/kieran-culkin-just-detailed-clever-145507354.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>，但又喜欢艾森伯格“优秀”的剧本，以及他之前拍的《当你拯救完世界》<ref name="IWSundance2" /><ref name="Waititi" />。艾玛·斯通劝他离开下，说如果他离开的话，整个制作过程就会崩盘<ref name="Soteriou" />。

=== 编剧 ===
2017年11月，艾森伯格为犹太网络杂志《{{tsl|en|Tablet (magazine)|牌匾 (杂志)|牌匾}}》撰写短篇小说《蒙古》（"Mongolia"）<ref>{{Cite web |last=Eisenberg |first=Jesse |date=2017-11-14 |title=Jesse Eisenberg's Short Story "Mongolia" |url=https://www.tabletmag.com/sections/arts-letters/articles/mongolia |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241115113906/https://www.tabletmag.com/sections/arts-letters/articles/mongolia |archive-date=2024-11-15 |access-date=2025-01-27 |website={{tsl|en|Tablet (magazine)||Tablet Magazine}}}}</ref>。故事围绕两个关系很好的大学生展开，一个克制自律，一个个性冲动；为了探寻“一生难忘的经历”，两个人来到[[东亚]]旅游，结果误打误撞，住进了[[生态旅游]]中心的[[蒙古包]]<ref name="FearInt">{{Cite magazine |last=Fear |first=David |date=2024-11-05 |title='I Was Trying to Close the Loop': Jesse Eisenberg on ''A Real Pain'' |url=https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-reviews/jesse-eisenberg-a-real-pain-interview-1235144610/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20241106093251/https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-reviews/jesse-eisenberg-a-real-pain-interview-1235144610/ |archive-date=2024-11-06 |access-date=2025-01-27 |magazine=Rolling Stone |language=en-US}}</ref>。这两个角色出自艾森伯格曾经撰写参演的两部戏剧，分别是2013年的《修正主义者》（''The Revisionist''），以及2015年的《战利品》（''The Spoils''）<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jackson |first=Destiny |date=2024-12-12 |title=Jesse Eisenberg Opens Up About ''A Real Pain'' |url=https://deadline.com/2024/12/jesse-eisenberg-kieran-culkin-a-real-pain-interview-1236201638/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20250127223547/https://deadline.com/2024/12/jesse-eisenberg-kieran-culkin-a-real-pain-interview-1236201638/ |archive-date=2025-01-27 |access-date=2025-01-27 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en-US}}</ref>。

艾森伯格很喜欢在《蒙古》中呈现的《{{tsl|en|The Odd Couple (1970 TV series)|单身公寓 (电视剧)|单身公寓}}》式角色形态，希望能将其改编成电影，但剧本始终没有写完<ref name="FearInt" />。就在他准备放弃的时候，电脑屏幕出现了一则参观[[奥斯威辛集中营]]的广告，而且报名附送免费午餐<ref name="FearInt" />。广告图片让艾森伯格既欣喜又羞愧，“很好概括了我身为{{tsl|en|Transgenerational trauma|跨代创伤|犹太大屠杀幸存者第三代}}的感受：没有纪念和敬畏历史的完美方式，没有什么方式比这能更好地体验这一切，因为你是在当代人所具备的特权下生活的<ref name="FearInt" />。”

艾森伯格是[[犹太世俗主义|世俗犹太人]]，祖先是[[波兰犹太人历史|波兰犹太人]]<ref>{{Cite news |last=McHugh |first=Meadhbh |date=2015-09-12 |title=The Jesse Eisenberg principle |url=https://www.irishtimes.com/culture/stage/the-jesse-eisenberg-principle-1.2347134 |access-date=2024-12-13 |newspaper=[[爱尔兰时报|The Irish Times]] |language=en |issn=0791-5144 |archive-date=2018-04-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180425183434/https://www.irishtimes.com/culture/stage/the-jesse-eisenberg-principle-1.2347134 |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Ufa |first=Chrystian |date=2024-05-16 |title=Słynny aktor w Poznaniu! Jesse Eisenberg: Chcę zostać Polakiem! Oto rozmowa z gwiazdą Impact 2024. Zobacz wideo |url=https://gloswielkopolski.pl/slynny-aktor-w-poznaniu-jesse-eisenberg-chce-zostac-polakiem-oto-rozmowa-z-gwiazda-impact-2024-zobacz-wideo/ar/c1p2-26337539 |access-date=2024-12-13 |website=Głos Wielkopolski |language=pl |archive-date=2024-12-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241217092931/https://gloswielkopolski.pl/slynny-aktor-w-poznaniu-jesse-eisenberg-chce-zostac-polakiem-oto-rozmowa-z-gwiazda-impact-2024-zobacz-wideo/ar/c1p2-26337539 |dead-url=no }}</ref>。过去20年来，他都在努力回答一个问题：如何将他在“当代日常生活中遇到的挑战”，与他[[阿什肯纳兹犹太人|阿什肯纳兹]]先祖身为[[纳粹大屠杀的受害者]]、{{tsl|en|Holocaust survivors|犹太人大屠杀幸存者|幸存者}}的{{tsl|en|historical trauma|历史创伤}}调和到一起<ref name="SundanceQA">{{Cite web |last=Pennick |first=Bailey |date=2024-11-04 |title=Give Me the Backstory: Get to Know Jesse Eisenberg, the Writer-Director of ''A Real Pain'' |url=https://www.sundance.org/blogs/give-me-the-backstory-get-to-know-jesse-eisenberg-the-writer-director-of-a-real-pain/ |access-date=2024-12-12 |publisher=[[圣丹斯电影节|Sundance Film Festival]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-08-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250815160748/https://www.sundance.org/blogs/give-me-the-backstory-get-to-know-jesse-eisenberg-the-writer-director-of-a-real-pain/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Frick |first=Evelyn |date=2022-11-04 |title=18 Things to Know About Jewish Actor Jesse Eisenberg |url=https://www.heyalma.com/18-things-to-know-about-jewish-actor-jesse-eisenberg/ |access-date=2024-12-13 |website=Hey Alma |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-12-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241230015940/https://www.heyalma.com/18-things-to-know-about-jewish-actor-jesse-eisenberg/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2022年，他开始撰写电影剧本，最初是当成[[思想实验]]，安排一对表兄弟在[[第二次世界大战]]的恐怖背景下，经历焦虑、抑郁等“不同程度的痛苦”。这设定让他以“视觉上不含糊”地形式探索这些主题，用一种大家不觉得“{{tsl|en|Didacticism|说教}}”的方式“隐晦地”提出这些问题<ref name="SundanceQA" />。

=== 拍摄 ===
[[主体拍摄]]于2023年5月至6月进行，取景地包括[[纽约]]及[[波兰]]多地<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.filmneweurope.com/news/poland-news/item/124801-production-jesse-eisenberg-shoots-a-real-pain-starring-himself-and-kieran-culkin-in-poland|title=PRODUCTION: Jesse Eisenberg Shoots A Real Pain Starring Himself and Kieran Culkin in Poland|website=Film New Europe|date=2023-05-26|access-date=2023-12-06|archive-date=2025-07-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250703075224/https://www.filmneweurope.com/news/poland-news/item/124801-production-jesse-eisenberg-shoots-a-real-pain-starring-himself-and-kieran-culkin-in-poland|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.thefirstnews.com/article/hollywood-duo-surprise-muranow-locals-after-being-spotted-filming-in-warsaw-38574|title=Hollywood duo surprise Muranów locals after being spotted filming in Warsaw|website=The First News|first=Stuart|last=Dowell|date=2023-05-19|access-date=2023-12-06|archive-date=2023-12-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231207180517/https://www.thefirstnews.com/article/hollywood-duo-surprise-muranow-locals-after-being-spotted-filming-in-warsaw-38574|url-status=live}}</ref>。艾森伯格在[[2019冠状病毒病疫情|COVID-19疫情]]期间撰写剧本，受此影响只能通过[[Google地图]]的[[Google街景服务|街景服务]]，以及2008年与妻子在波兰旅游时拍的照片勘景。之后，他亲自踏上角色经历的这趟旅程<ref name="Burns">{{Cite web |last=Burns |first=Alex Jhamb |date=2024-11-15 |title=In ''A Real Pain'', Jesse Eisenberg and Kieran Culkin Explore Their Polish-Jewish Heritage |url=https://www.cntraveler.com/story/on-location-a-real-pain |access-date=2024-12-14 |website={{tsl|en|Condé Nast Traveler||Condé Nast Traveler}} |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-02-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250209161701/https://www.cntraveler.com/story/on-location-a-real-pain |dead-url=no }}</ref>。摄影师米卡尔·迪梅克（Michał Dymek）是土生土长的[[华沙]]人，从小就在犹太人大屠杀的历史中长大<ref name="Burns" />，他对故土的了解帮助艾森伯格拍摄出凸显波兰美丽的[[蒙太奇]]画面<ref name="Burns" />：

{{blockquote|我希望我对波兰的描绘，能在总体上给人一种美丽、活力、多姿多彩的感觉，表现出我在那里所感受到的一切。我认为波兰经常被描绘成非常悲情，还在留恋[[东欧]][[苏联历史|苏联共产主义历史]]，留恋战争的恐怖。这根本不是我认识的波兰，我认识的波兰充满活力、色彩缤纷、温暖。所以我想展示波兰的这一面，这是我在美国电影中很少看到的一面，这一面对我来说是完全真实的。}}

米哈尔通过透视手法呈他主要的艺术概念，以表现出剧中人物对自身的不同看法。他通过装有{{tsl|en|Long-focus lens|长焦镜头|长焦镜片}}的[[标准镜头]]来结合角色们的观察，从而使透视变得平坦，以“利用这样一个事实：选择[[焦距]]不同的镜头，有时可以赋予同一幅图像不同定义<ref name="Filmmaker">{{Cite web |last= |first= |date=2024-01-21 |title="My Main Idea Was To Work With Perspective": DP Michał Dymek on ''A Real Pain'' |url=https://filmmakermagazine.com/124761-interview-dp-michal-dymek-a-real-pain-sundance-2024/ |access-date=2024-12-14 |website=Filmmaker Magazine |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-12-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241228001341/https://filmmakermagazine.com/124761-interview-dp-michal-dymek-a-real-pain-sundance-2024/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。”

=== 音乐 ===
电影配乐几乎全部为[[钢琴]]曲，为波兰音乐家[[弗雷德里克·肖邦]]的作品，由加拿大以色列裔钢琴演奏家{{tsl|en|Tzvi Erez|兹维·埃雷兹}}演奏<ref name="THR Review" />。配乐还融入了肖邦的[[叙事曲 (肖邦)|叙事曲]]、[[练习曲 (肖邦)|练习曲]]、[[夜曲 (肖邦)|夜曲]]、[[前奏曲 (肖邦)|前奏曲]]和[[圆舞曲 (肖邦)|圆舞曲]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Beckerman |first=Gal |date=2024-11-01 |title=Finally, a Holocaust Movie With No Lessons |url=https://www.theatlantic.com/culture/archive/2024/11/real-pain-holocaust-movie-jesse-eisenberg-kieran-culkin-no-lessons/680490/ |access-date=2024-12-10 |website=[[大西洋 (杂志)|The Atlantic]] |language=en |archive-date=2025-02-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250203131234/https://www.theatlantic.com/culture/archive/2024/11/real-pain-holocaust-movie-jesse-eisenberg-kieran-culkin-no-lessons/680490/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

