电影在{{tsl|en|2024 Sundance Film Festival|2024年圣丹斯电影节}}上获得{{tsl|en|Waldo Salt#The Waldo Salt Screenwriting Award|沃尔多·索尔特|沃尔多·索尔特编剧奖}}<ref name="Sundance2024Winners">{{Cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |last2=Hipes |first2=Patrick |date=2024-01-26 |title=Sundance Film Festival Awards: ''In The Summers'', ''Dìdi'', ''Daughters'' Top Winners List |url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/2024-sundance-film-festival-winners-list-1235803729/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240927075041/https://deadline.com/2024/01/2024-sundance-film-festival-winners-list-1235803729/ |archive-date=2024-09-27 |access-date=2024-11-22 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。在[[第82届金球奖]]上获得四项提名，包括[[金球奖最佳音乐及喜剧电影|最佳音乐及喜剧电影奖]]，克金赢得其中的[[金球奖最佳电影男配角|最佳电影男配角奖]]<ref>{{cite web |title=Golden Globes Nominations Revealed: Full List |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |first=Andreas |last=Wiseman |date=2024-12-09 |access-date=2024-12-09 |url=https://deadline.com/2024/12/golden-globes-nominations-2025-list-film-tv-1236198070/ |archive-date=2024-12-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241209151642/https://deadline.com/2024/12/golden-globes-nominations-2025-list-film-tv-1236198070/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Zuckerman |first=Esther |date=2025-01-06 |title=Kieran Culkin Wins a Golden Globe for ''A Real Pain'' |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/05/movies/kieran-culkin-golden-globes-a-real-pain.html |url-access=registration |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20250106022805/https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/05/movies/kieran-culkin-golden-globes-a-real-pain.html |archive-date=2025-01-06 |access-date=2025-01-10 |work=[[纽约时报|The New York Times]] |language=en-US |issn=0362-4331}}</ref>。[[第30届评论家选择奖]]上获得三项提名，赢得[[评论家选择电影奖最佳喜剧电影|最佳喜剧电影奖]]和[[评论家选择电影奖最佳男配角|最佳男配角奖]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jones |first=Marcus |date=2024-12-12 |title=Critics Choice Awards 2025 Nominations: ''Conclave'' and ''Wicked'' Lead with 11 Nods — See Full List |url=https://www.indiewire.com/awards/results/critics-choice-awards-2025-nominations-1235075555/ |access-date=2024-12-12 |website=[[IndieWire]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-02-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250216044607/https://www.indiewire.com/awards/results/critics-choice-awards-2025-nominations-1235075555/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，以及[[第78届英国电影学院奖]][[英国电影学院奖最佳男配角|最佳男配角奖]]和[[英国电影学院奖最佳原创剧本|最佳原创剧本奖]]<ref>{{Cite news |date=2025-02-16 |title=Baftas 2025: the full list of winners |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2025/feb/16/baftas-2025-the-full-list-of-winners-live |work=The Guardian |issn=0261-3077 |access-date=2025-02-17 |archive-date=2025-04-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250403002520/https://www.theguardian.com/film/2025/feb/16/baftas-2025-the-full-list-of-winners-live |dead-url=no }}</ref>。此外还获得{{tsl|en|29th Satellite Awards|第29届卫星奖}}四项提名<ref>{{Cite web |last=Neglia |first=Matt |date=2024-12-16 |title=The 2024 Satellite Award (IPA) Nominations |url=https://nextbestpicture.com/the-2024-satellite-award-ipa-nominations/ |access-date=2024-12-16 |website=Next Best Picture |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-12-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241216193927/https://nextbestpicture.com/the-2024-satellite-award-ipa-nominations/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>、[[第40届独立精神奖]]两项提名<ref>{{cite web |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/spirit-awards-2025-nominations-1236233647/ |title=Spirit Awards 2025 Nominations: ''Anora'' and ''I Saw the TV Glow'' Lead Film Categories, ''Shōgun'' Rules TV |last1=Lang |first1=Brent |last2=Moreau |first2=Jordan |work=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |date=2024-12-04 |access-date=2024-12-05 |archive-date=2024-12-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241205023034/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/spirit-awards-2025-nominations-1236233647/ |url-status=live }}</ref>、[[2024年哥谭奖|第34届哥谭奖]]一项提名<ref>{{Cite web |last=Goldsmith |first=Jill |date=2024-10-29 |title=Gotham Awards Nominations: ''Anora'' Leads Pack, ''Challengers'' & ''Nickel Boys'' Among Group Up For Best Feature |url=https://deadline.com/2024/10/2024-gotham-awards-nominations-1236160891/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241120182334/https://deadline.com/2024/10/2024-gotham-awards-nominations-1236160891/ |archive-date=2024-11-20 |access-date=2024-11-22 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。入选[[2024年美国电影学会奖]]和[[第96届国家评论协会奖|2024年美国国家评论协会奖]]的年度10佳电影榜单<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/afi-awards-top-10-wicked-anora-dune-2-1236236697/|title=AFI Awards: ''Anora'', ''Emilia Pérez'' and ''Wicked'' Among 10 Best Films, Top TV Shows Include ''The Penguin'' and ''Shogun''|first=Clayton|last=Davis|date=2024-12-05|access-date=2024-12-05|archive-date=2025-08-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250812161920/https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/afi-awards-top-10-wicked-anora-dune-2-1236236697/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.indiewire.com/awards/results/national-board-of-review-2024-winners-list-1235072435/ |title=''Wicked'' and Jon M. Chu Win Big with the National Board of Review — See the Full List |first=Ryan |last=Lattanzio |work=[[IndieWire]] |date=2024-12-04 |access-date=2024-12-05 |archive-date=2024-12-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241205193927/https://www.indiewire.com/awards/results/national-board-of-review-2024-winners-list-1235072435/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

