== 制作 ==
《红色一号》灵感来自{{le|七块钱制片公司|Seven Bucks Productions}}的海勒姆·贾西亚（{{lang|en|Hiram Garcia}}）<ref name="Lang">{{cite news |last=Lang |first=Brent |title=Dwayne Johnson Starring in Holiday Action-Adventure 'Red One' For Amazon Studios |url=https://variety.com/2021/film/news/dwayne-johnson-red-one-fast-and-furious-chris-morgan-amazon-studios-1235006814/ |work=Variety |publisher=Penske Media Corporation |date=2021-06-28 |accessdate=2022-11-12 |archive-date=2022-10-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221027115536/https://variety.com/2021/film/news/dwayne-johnson-red-one-fast-and-furious-chris-morgan-amazon-studios-1235006814/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影最早预定[[巨石强森]]领衔主演，[[杰克·卡斯丹]]担任导演<ref name="Kasdan">{{cite web |last1=Kit |first1=Borys |title='Jumanji' Director Jake Kasdan Reuniting With Dwayne Johnson for Holiday Adventure Movie at Amazon |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/jumanji-director-jake-kasdan-dwayne-johnson-holiday-movie-red-one-1235039123/ |website=The Hollywood Reporter |publisher=PMRC |date=2021-10-29 |access-date=2022-11-12 |archive-date=2022-10-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221027115535/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/jumanji-director-jake-kasdan-dwayne-johnson-holiday-movie-red-one-1235039123/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。[[克里斯·伊凡]]在2022年1月加入演出阵容<ref>{{cite news|last=Grobar|first=Matt|url=https://deadline.com/2022/01/red-one-chris-evans-to-star-with-dwayne-johnson-in-amazon-action-film-1234918455/|title='Red One': Chris Evans To Star Opposite Dwayne Johnson In Amazon's Holiday Action-Comedy From Director Jake Kasdan|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2022-01-24|access-date=2022-01-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220124231136/https://deadline.com/2022/01/red-one-chris-evans-to-star-with-dwayne-johnson-in-amazon-action-film-1234918455/|archive-date=2022-01-24|url-status=live}}</ref>；[[琪兰·席普卡]]于9月加入<ref>{{cite web |last1=Grobar |first1=Matt |title=Kiernan Shipka To Star Opposite Dwayne Johnson & Chris Evans In Jake Kasdan’s Holiday Event Film ''Red One'' For Prime Video |url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/kiernan-shipka-joins-dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-in-red-one-1235107002/ |website=Deadline Hollywood |access-date=2022-09-06 |date=2022-09-06 |archive-date=2022-10-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221024220104/https://deadline.com/2022/09/kiernan-shipka-joins-dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-in-red-one-1235107002/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。其余演出阵容在接下来的一个月中公开，包括[[刘玉玲]]、{{le|玛丽·伊莉莎白·艾利斯|Mary Elizabeth Ellis}}、[[J·K·西蒙斯]]、{{le|尼克·克罗尔|Nick Kroll}}、[[克里斯多佛·希夫哲]]、韦斯利·金梅尔（{{lang|en|Wesley Kimmel}}）与[[邦妮·亨特]]<ref>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Lucy Liu To Star Opposite Dwayne Johnson & Chris Evans In Prime Video's Holiday Pic ''Red One'' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-lucy-liu-red-one-amazon-1235142902/ |website=Deadline Hollywood |access-date=2022-10-12 |date=2022-10-12 |archive-date=2022-10-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221024213705/https://deadline.com/2022/10/dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-lucy-liu-red-one-amazon-1235142902/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="EllisSimmonsFilming" /><ref>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Dwayne Johnson & Chris Evans Prime Video Holiday Pic ''Red One'' Adds Nick Kroll, Kristofer Hivju, Wesley Kimmel & Mary Elizabeth Ellis |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/dwayne-johnson-red-one-nick-kroll-mary-elizabeth-ellis-cast-amazon-1235153324/ |website=Deadline Hollywood |access-date=2022-10-24 |date=2022-10-24 |archive-date=2022-11-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221107100342/https://deadline.com/2022/10/dwayne-johnson-red-one-nick-kroll-mary-elizabeth-ellis-cast-amazon-1235153324/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Dwayne Johnson-Led Holiday Film Starts Production; Adds J.K. Simmons & Bonnie Hunt To Cast |url=https://deadline.com/2022/11/dwayne-johnson-red-one-j-k-simmons-bonnie-hunt-amazon-studios-1235165099/ |website=Deadline Hollywood |access-date=2022-11-07 |date=2022-11-07 |archive-date=2022-11-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221107173942/https://deadline.com/2022/11/dwayne-johnson-red-one-j-k-simmons-bonnie-hunt-amazon-studios-1235165099/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

电影2022年10月起在[[亚特兰大]]展开[[主要拍摄]]，2023年2月[[杀青]]<ref name="EllisSimmonsFilming">{{cite web |last1=Ellis |first1=Mary Elizabeth |title=Mary Elizabeth Ellis on Twitter: Verified I had a blast shooting #RedOne in Atlanta this week with @chrisevans #wesleykimmel and the awesome crew! Paparazzi photo isn't the most flattering, but cool to see the fake snow! This giant Christmas movie with the likes of @therock @lucyliu #jksimmons is gonna be hella fun!! #jakekasdan @amazonstudios |url=https://www.instagram.com/p/Cjvk3vNOWDv/ |website=[[Instagram]] |access-date=2022-10-24 |date=2022-10-15 |archive-date=2022-10-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221025232119/https://www.instagram.com/p/Cjvk3vNOWDv/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last1=Leishman|first1=Rachel|title=Chris Evans Shares a Behind-The-Scenes Look at 'Red One'|url=https://collider.com/chris-evans-red-one-behind-the-scenes-image/|website=Collider|access-date=2022-10-20|date=2022-10-19|archive-date=2022-10-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221030103117/https://collider.com/chris-evans-red-one-behind-the-scenes-image/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
《红色一号》原定2023年耶诞档期在串流媒体[[Amazon Prime Video]]独家上线<ref name="RedOne_TW">{{cite web|url=https://www.thewrap.com/hobbs-and-shaw-2-status-jumanji-3-update-dwayne-johnson-red-one-hiram-garcia/|work=The Wrap|title=Producer Hiram Garcia on the Future of 'Hobbs & Shaw,' 'Jumanji 3' and Dwayne Johnson's Next Film|author=November 11, 2021|date=2021-11-11|accessdate=2021-11-18|archive-date=2022-11-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221112074625/https://www.thewrap.com/hobbs-and-shaw-2-status-jumanji-3-update-dwayne-johnson-red-one-hiram-garcia/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年12月20日，电影延迟至2024年11月15日在美国院线上映<ref name="Date">{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Dwayne Johnson & Chris Evans Seven Bucks Amazon MGM Movie 'Red One' To Jingle In Theaters Next Year |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-red-one-release-date-1235678552/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |date=2023-12-20 |access-date=2023-12-20 |archive-date=2023-12-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231220160705/https://deadline.com/2023/12/dwayne-johnson-chris-evans-red-one-release-date-1235678552/ |url-status=live}}</ref>。电影2024年12月12日在Prime Video上发行。

