==制作==
===开发===
项目由贾斯汀·皮亚塞茨基编剧，原名《中介人》（''The Broker''），入选2019年剧本黑名单。电影由{{tsl|en|Thunder Road Films|雷霆路影业}}的[[贝索·伊旺尼克]]、{{tsl|en|Sigma Films|西格玛影业}}的{{tsl|en|Gillian Berrie|吉莉安·贝里}}、{{tsl|en|Black Bear Pictures|黑熊影业}}的{{tsl|en|Teddy Schwarzman|泰迪·施瓦茨曼}}，以及[[大卫·麦肯齐 (导演)|大卫·麦肯齐]]本人共同制片<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a42964853/riz-ahmed-lily-james-relay|website=Digital Spy|access-date=2023-04-12|first=Joe|last=Anderton|title=Star Wars' Riz Ahmed and Downton Abbey's Lily James join thriller movie|date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2025-12-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251219232427/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a42964853/riz-ahmed-lily-james-relay/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

===选角===
2023年2月，[[里兹·阿迈德]]和[[莉莉·詹姆斯]]加盟剧组<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/riz-ahmed-lily-james-john-wick-movie-relay-black-bear-thunder-road-efm-1235263255|title=Riz Ahmed & Lily James To Star In David Mackenzie Thriller 'Relay' For Thunder Road, Sigma & Black Bear: EFM Hot Package|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|date=2023-02-17|website=Deadline Hollywood|access-date=2023-04-12|archive-date=2023-03-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230320171053/https://deadline.com/2023/02/riz-ahmed-lily-james-john-wick-movie-relay-black-bear-thunder-road-efm-1235263255/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年4月，[[山姆·沃辛顿]]确认加盟，媒体拍到他在纽约片场出现<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://people.com/celebrity/star-tracks-wednesday-april-19-2023|title=Melissa McCarthy & Paapa Essiedu on Set in N.Y.C., Plus Lucy Boynton, Priyanka Chopra and More|date=2023-04-19|accessdate=2023-04-19|website=People|archive-date=2023-08-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230809193142/https://people.com/celebrity/star-tracks-wednesday-april-19-2023/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|website=Deadline Hollywood|accessdate=2023-04-24|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/sam-worthington-riz-ahmed-lily-james-relay-movie-filming-new-york-1235334875|title=Sam Worthington Joins Riz Ahmed & Lily James In Thriller 'Relay'; Filming Underway In New York & New Jersey|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|date=2023-04-24|archive-date=2023-05-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230520023911/https://deadline.com/2023/04/sam-worthington-riz-ahmed-lily-james-relay-movie-filming-new-york-1235334875/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

