==制作==
《撒冷镇》改编自[[斯蒂芬·金]]1975年出版的[[撒冷地|同名小说]]。2019年4月，[[新线影业]]公开了这部电影，当时《[[荷里活报道]]》透露[[盖瑞·道柏曼]]将担任电影的编剧和执行制片人，[[温子仁]]出任制片人<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/james-wan-gary-dauberman-tackling-stephen-kings-salems-lot-1204201/ |title=James Wan, Gary Dauberman Tackling Stephen King's Vampire Tale ''Salem's Lot''|date=2019-04-23|first=Borys|last=Kit|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210827234910/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/james-wan-gary-dauberman-tackling-stephen-kings-salems-lot-1204201/ |archive-date=2021-08-27 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-08-27}}</ref>。在采访中，道柏曼被问到会不会沿用金小说《[[牠 (小说)|牠]]》改编电影《[[牠 (电影)|牠]]》（2017年）和《[[牠：第二章]]》（2019年）的编剧手法，他回复道：“我倾向于尽可能忠实小说剧情，除非出现难以改编成电影的地方”<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/annabelle-director-it-2-his-salems-lot-vision-1220872/ |title=''Annabelle'' Filmmaker Gary Dauberman on ''It 2'' Gore and His ''Salem's Lot'' Vision|date=2019-06-25|first=Brian|last=Davids|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210505231650/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/annabelle-director-it-2-his-salems-lot-vision-1220872/ |archive-date=2021-05-05 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-09-12}}</ref>。

2020年4月，道柏曼宣布出任导演<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/annabelle-comes-home-filmmaker-gary-dauberman-direct-stephen-kings-salems-lot-1289603/ |title=''Annabelle Comes Home'' Filmmaker Gary Dauberman to Direct Stephen King's Vampire Tale ''Salem's Lot'' (Exclusive)|date=2020-04-10|first=Borys|last=Kit|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210827234911/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/annabelle-comes-home-filmmaker-gary-dauberman-direct-stephen-kings-salems-lot-1289603/ |archive-date=2021-08-27 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-08-27}}</ref>。2021年8月，[[路易斯·普曼]]出任主演<ref name="PullmanCast">{{cite web |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/stephen-king-adaptation-salems-lot-finds-its-lead-in-lewis-pullman-exclusive-1235004127/ |title=Stephen King Adaptation ''Salem's Lot'' Finds Its Lead in Lewis Pullman (Exclusive)|date=2021-08-27|first=Borys|last=Kit|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210827234913/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/stephen-king-adaptation-salems-lot-finds-its-lead-in-lewis-pullman-exclusive-1235004127/ |archive-date=2021-08-27 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-08-27}}</ref>。9月，[[主体拍摄]]在[[美国]][[波士顿]]启动，迈克尔·伯吉斯负责摄影<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.denofgeek.com/movies/salems-lot-firestarter-reignite-stephen-king-box-office/ |title=Can ''Salem's Lot'' and Firestarter Reignite Stephen King at the Box Office?|date=2021-09-08|first=Don|last=Kaye|website={{tsl|en|Den of Geek||Den of Geek}} |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210909022025/https://www.denofgeek.com/movies/salems-lot-firestarter-reignite-stephen-king-box-office/ |archive-date=2021-09-09 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-09-09}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://theronin.org/2021/08/14/salems-lot-james-wan-produced-vampire-flick-adds-malignant-cinematographer-michael-burgess/ |title=''Salem's Lot'': James Wan-Produced Vampire Flick Adds ''Malignant'' Cinematographer Michael Burgess|date=2021-08-14|first=Christopher|last=Marc|website=The Ronin |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210912152543/https://theronin.org/2021/08/14/salems-lot-james-wan-produced-vampire-flick-adds-malignant-cinematographer-michael-burgess/ |archive-date=2021-09-12 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-09-12}}</ref>。取景地还包括[[麻萨诸塞州]]其他地方，包括[[伊普斯威奇 (麻萨诸塞州)|伊普斯威奇]]，以及[[乌斯特县 (麻萨诸塞州)|乌斯特县]]的[[斯特灵 (麻萨诸塞州)|斯特灵镇]]和[[克林顿 (麻萨诸塞州)|克林顿镇]]<ref>{{cite web |url=http://thelocalnews.news/2021/07/20/bloody-mess-as-movie-making-returns-downtown-in-september/ |title=Bloody mess as movie-making returns downtown in September |date=2021-07-20 |first=John P. |last=Muldoon |website=Ipswich Local News}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.telegram.com/story/news/local/the-item/2021/09/03/second-coming-planned-sterling-stephen-king-film-use-locations/5690947001/ |title=Second Coming planned for Sterling as Stephen King film will use locations |date=2021-09-03 |first=Jan |last=Gottesman |website={{tsl|en|Telegram & Gazette||Telegram & Gazette}} |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210903214217/https://www.telegram.com/story/news/local/the-item/2021/09/03/second-coming-planned-sterling-stephen-king-film-use-locations/5690947001/ |archive-date=2021-09-03 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-09-03}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.telegram.com/story/news/local/the-item/2021/09/15/salems-lot-using-clinton-homes-stephen-king-movie-shoots/5780164001/ |title=''Salem's Lot'' using Clinton homes for Stephen King movie shoots|date=2021-09-15|first=Ken|last=Cleveland|website={{tsl|en|Telegram & Gazette||Telegram & Gazette}} |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210916002934/https://www.telegram.com/story/news/local/the-item/2021/09/15/salems-lot-using-clinton-homes-stephen-king-movie-shoots/5780164001/ |archive-date=2021-09-16 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-09-16}}</ref>。[[普林斯顿 (麻萨诸塞州)|普林斯顿]]的{{tsl|en|Princeton Public Library|普林斯顿公共图书馆}}也被包场三天，用作取景地<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.thelandmark.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/08/17/princeton-library-booked-stephen-king-film-salems-lot/8153991002/ |title=Princeton library booked for Stephen King film |date=2021-08-17 |first=Patricia |last=Roy |website=The Landmark |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210903214215/https://www.thelandmark.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/08/17/princeton-library-booked-stephen-king-film-salems-lot/8153991002/ |archive-date=2021-09-03 |url-status=live |access-date=2021-09-03}}</ref>。2022年5月底6月初，补拍戏份<ref name="ReleaseDate" />。后期制作阶段，{{tsl|en|Nathan Barr|内森·巴尔}}和{{tsl|en|Lisbeth Scott|莉丝贝斯·斯科特}}担任作曲<ref>{{cite web |date=2022-06-20 |title=Nathan Barr & Lisbeth Scott Scoring Gary Dauberman's ''Salem's Lot'' |url=https://filmmusicreporter.com/2022/06/20/nathan-barr-lisbeth-scott-scoring-gary-daubermans-salems-lot/ |access-date=2022-06-21 |website=Film Music Reporter |archive-date=2023-04-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230406122059/https://filmmusicreporter.com/2022/06/20/nathan-barr-lisbeth-scott-scoring-gary-daubermans-salems-lot/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。据导演道柏曼介绍，电影时长从近三个小时缩短到了现在的100多分钟，其中包括在马斯滕大宅（Marsten House）拍摄的开场戏份<ref name="navarro-bd">{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3834421/gary-daubermans-initial-salems-lot-cut-was-three-hours-long-and-included-marsten-house-opening/|title=Gary Dauberman’s Initial 'Salem’s Lot' Cut Was 3 Hours Long and Included Marsten House Opening|first=Meagan|last=Navarro|work=Bloody Disgusting|date=2024-10-04|access-date=2024-10-05|archive-date=2024-10-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241006054904/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3834421/gary-daubermans-initial-salems-lot-cut-was-three-hours-long-and-included-marsten-house-opening/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年10月3日发行<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3830708/new-salems-lot-movie-sinks-its-teeth-into-max-on-october-3-2024/|title=New ''Salem's Lot'' Movie Sinks Its Teeth into Max on October 3, 2024|last=Squires|first=John|date=2024-09-10|access-date=2024-09-10|website={{tsl|en|Bloody Disgusting||Bloody Disgusting}}|archive-date=2024-09-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240927055618/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3830708/new-salems-lot-movie-sinks-its-teeth-into-max-on-october-3-2024/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。原本定档2022年9月9日<ref>{{cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2021/09/warner-bros-moves-furiosa-to-memorial-day-weekend-2024-salems-lot-to-fall-2022-1234830681/ |title=Warner Bros. Moves ''Mad Max'' Spinoff ''Furiosa'' To Memorial Day Weekend 2024; 'Salem's Lot' To Debut Early Fall 2022 |date=2021-09-10 |first=Anthony |last=D'Alessandro |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2021-09-10 |archive-date=2022-06-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220602051311/https://deadline.com/2021/09/warner-bros-moves-furiosa-to-memorial-day-weekend-2024-salems-lot-to-fall-2022-1234830681/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，也就是[[劳动节 (美国)|劳动节]]结束后的周末，参照华纳兄弟此前在该档期上映的恐怖片均获得成功而定。其后受[[2019冠状病毒病疫情对电影业的影响|COVID-19疫情影响后期制作进度]]，档期延迟到2023年4月21日<ref name="ReleaseDate">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/07/salems-lot-release-date-change-2023-1235061343/|title=Theatrical Release Of Stephen King Pic ''Salem's Lot'' Moves From Post Labor Day To Spring 2023; ''House Party'' Undated On HBO Max|date=2022-07-11|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-07-11|archive-date=2022-08-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220808220434/https://deadline.com/2022/07/salems-lot-release-date-change-2023-1235061343/|dead-url=no}}</ref>，原档期由《[[鬼玩人：复活]]》顶替<ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2022-08-24 |title=''Aquaman 2'' Heads To Christmas 2023, ''Shazam: Fury Of The Gods'' Goes To March; HBO Max Pics ''House Party'' & ''Evil Dead Rise'' Going Theatrical – Warner Bros. Release Date Changes |url=https://deadline.com/2022/08/aquaman-2-shazam-fury-of-the-gods-hbo-max-house-party-evil-dead-rise-1235099521/ |access-date=2022-08-24 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2022-09-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220901092842/https://deadline.com/2022/08/aquaman-2-shazam-fury-of-the-gods-hbo-max-house-party-evil-dead-rise-1235099521/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

2023年10月，华纳兄弟计划将电影搬上流媒体平台[[Max (流媒体)|Max]]，考虑到[[2023年美国演员工会大罢工]]“不断为Max创造内容需求”，惟该平台发言人表示电影未来的发行计划未有定论<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/salems-lot-new-movie-warner-bros-max-streaming-debut-1235774431/|title=Warner Bros.' ''Salem's Lot'' Remake Appears Headed to Max Instead of Theaters (EXCLUSIVE)|first=Tatiana|last=Siegel|website=Variety|date=2023-10-31|access-date=2023-10-31|archive-date=2024-10-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241002054238/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/salems-lot-new-movie-warner-bros-max-streaming-debut-1235774431/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2024年2月，金再次被问到电影的发行计划为何还没有定论，金表示“不清楚华纳兄弟为什么一拖再拖，电影又不是令人尴尬。（真实原因）谁知道呢<ref>{{cite web |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/stephen-king-warner-bros-shelved-salems-lot-remake-1235916884/ |title=Stephen King: 'I'm Not Sure' Why Warner Bros. Is 'Holding Back' the ''Salem's Lot'' Remake as 'It's Quite Good' and 'Not Embarrassing or Anything'|first=Zack|last=Sharf|work=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]]|date=2024-02-20 |access-date=2024-02-22}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/salems-lot-stephen-king-calls-out-warner-bros-1235832374/|title=''Salem's Lot'' Author Stephen King Calls Out Warner Bros. For 'Holding' Film's Release|first=Armando|last=Tinoco|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2024-02-20|access-date=2024-02-22|archive-date=2024-02-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240221040610/https://deadline.com/2024/02/salems-lot-stephen-king-calls-out-warner-bros-1235832374/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。”2024年3月，电影确认上线Max，8月确定10月份上线<ref name="vanityfair">{{cite web |url=https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/story/salems-lot-lives-inside-the-retro-retelling-of-stephen-kings-vampire-story |title=Salem's Lot Lives! Inside the Retro Retelling of Stephen King's Vampire Story |last=Breznican |first=Anthony |date=2024-08-20 |access-date=2024-08-20 |website=[[名利场 (杂志)|Vanity Fair]] |archive-date=2024-09-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240902020427/https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/story/salems-lot-lives-inside-the-retro-retelling-of-stephen-kings-vampire-story |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/stephen-king-salems-lot-max-release-date-2024-1235856136/|title=''Salem's Lot'' Set To Premiere On Max In October – Update|date=2024-08-23|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-08-23|archive-date=2024-10-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241006054904/https://deadline.com/2024/08/stephen-king-salems-lot-max-release-date-2024-1235856136/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。据电影发行商协会，电影于10月11日在英国和爱尔兰院线发行<ref>{{cite web |url=https://filmdistributorsassociation.com/release-schedule/all-future-releases/ |title=All Future Releases – Week commencing: Monday 13 May |access-date=2024-05-18 |website=Film Distributors' Association |archive-date=2023-11-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231121164739/https://filmdistributorsassociation.com/release-schedule/all-future-releases/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影于2024年9月25日作为{{tsl|en|Beyond Fest|超然电影节}}开幕片全球首映<ref>{{cite web|title=''Salem's Lot'', ''The Brutalist'', ''Anora'', ''The Apprentice'', ''Terrifier 3'' & More Set For Beyond Fest 2024|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2024-09-12|access-date=2024-09-12|url=https://deadline.com/2024/09/beyond-fest-lineup-for-2024-unveiled-salems-lot-set-opening-night-film-1236085024/|archive-date=2024-09-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240926063834/https://deadline.com/2024/09/beyond-fest-lineup-for-2024-unveiled-salems-lot-set-opening-night-film-1236085024/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

