==制作==
电影大量引用ABC转播[[慕尼黑奥运会]]及[[慕尼黑惨案|人质危机]]的历史画面<ref>{{Cite web |last=Mintzer |first=Jordan |date=2024-08-29 |title='September 5' Review: Peter Sarsgaard Stars in a Gripping Newsroom Thriller About the 1972 Munich Terrorist Attacks |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-reviews/september-5-review-peter-sarsgaard-munich-olympics-terror-1235986809/ |access-date=2024-09-01 |website=The Hollywood Reporter |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-09-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240901210345/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-reviews/september-5-review-peter-sarsgaard-munich-olympics-terror-1235986809/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。导演菲尔巴姆与制作团队耗费几个月时间研究慕尼黑惨案，与布景设计团队还原了当天[[ESPN on ABC|ABC Sports]]的转播室<ref>{{Cite web |last=Gardner |first=Chris |date=2024-08-29 |title='September 5' Filmmaker on Tackling Tragic Event With Tireless Research, "Highest Respect" |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/september-5-venice-2024-tim-fehlbaum-munich-olympics-1235986678/ |access-date=2024-09-01 |website=The Hollywood Reporter |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-09-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240901232541/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/september-5-venice-2024-tim-fehlbaum-munich-olympics-1235986678/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==发行==
2024年8月29日，电影作为[[第81届威尼斯影展]]“地平线附加”单元开幕片全球首映<ref>{{cite web |title=Biennale Cinema 2024 {{!}} Finalised the two opening films of the Orizzonti and Orizzonti Extra competition sections |url=https://www.labiennale.org/en/news/finalised-two-opening-films-orizzonti-and-orizzonti-extra-competition-sections |website=La Biennale di Venezia |access-date=2024-09-01 |language=en |date=2024-07-21 |archive-date=2024-09-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240901131350/https://www.labiennale.org/en/news/finalised-two-opening-films-orizzonti-and-orizzonti-extra-competition-sections |url-status=live }}</ref>。[[派拉蒙影业]]和{{tsl|en|Republic Pictures|共和影业}}买下电影全球发行权（除德国、奥地利、瑞士）。电影在威尼斯和{{tsl|en|Telluride Film Festival|特柳赖德电影节}}获得如潮好评后，派拉蒙决定保留电影发行权，不卖给其他发行商。电影被[[多伦多国际电影节]]拒绝放映，《[[荷里活报道]]》记者斯科特·费恩伯格（Scott Feinberg）推测主办方考虑到[[以巴冲突]]的大背景下，上映该片会引发争议。此前，主办方曾计划放映以[[俄军]]视角展现[[俄罗斯入侵乌克兰|俄乌战争]]的纪录片《{{tsl|en|Russians at War|战时俄军}}》，但这部片子引发乌克兰人大规模抗议，主办方不得以撤销放映计划<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/toronto-international-film-festival-2024-takeaways-1235998851/|title=Toronto Awards Takeaways: Feinberg on an Off-Year for the Fest|date=2024-09-15|first=Scott|last=Feinberg|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2024-09-15|archive-date=2024-09-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240916025000/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/toronto-international-film-festival-2024-takeaways-1235998851/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

2025年2月，电影在{{tsl|en|54th International Film Festival Rotterdam|第54届鹿特丹国际电影节}}聚光灯单元放映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://iffr.com/en/iffr/2025/films/september-5|title=Limelight: September 5|work=International Film Festival Rotterdam|access-date=2025-01-07|archive-date=2025-01-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250130141920/https://iffr.com/en/iffr/2025/films/september-5|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

电影原计划2024年11月27日在北美上映，后来被发行商派拉蒙改为11月29日[[有限上映]]，两周后的12月13日公映<ref name=":1">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/september-5-sells-paramount-munich-terrorist-attacks-1235991379/|title=Paramount Snags Fall's Hottest Sales Title ''September 5'', Shaking Up Oscar Race (Exclusive)|website=[[荷里活报道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|first=Scott|last=Feinberg|date=2024-09-15|access-date=2024-09-15|archive-date=2024-09-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240915173133/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/september-5-sells-paramount-munich-terrorist-attacks-1235991379/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/10/paramount-movies-2025-glen-powell-running-man-1236107827/|title=Paramount Dates & Shifts Slew For 2025: Glen Powell's ''Running Man'', ''Smurfs'', ''Naked Gun'', ''Vicious'' & More|date=2024-10-04|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-10-04|archive-date=2025-05-31|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250531105048/https://deadline.com/2024/10/paramount-movies-2025-glen-powell-running-man-1236107827/|url-status=live}}</ref>。后来有限上映时间改为2024年12月13日，公映推迟到2025年1月17日<ref name="shift">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/11/paramount-better-man-sept-5-1236184010/|title=Paramount Tweaks Theatrical Rollout Of ''Better Man'' & ''September 5'' During Awards Season|date=2024-11-21|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-11-21|archive-date=2024-11-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241122020528/https://deadline.com/2024/11/paramount-better-man-sept-5-1236184010/|url-status=live}}</ref>。此前曾计划推迟至2月初公映<ref>{{Cite news |last=Barnes |first=Brooks |date=2025-01-19 |title=How 'Mufasa: The Lion King' Became a Sleeper Hit |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/19/business/media/mufasa-lion-king-box-office.html |access-date=2025-01-24 |work=The New York Times |language=en-US |issn=0362-4331 |archive-date=2025-07-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250730090007/https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/19/business/media/mufasa-lion-king-box-office.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。

