==制作==
2020年6月，原版电影《龙卷风》（1996年）的国际发行商[[环球影业]]宣布正在开发翻拍版，[[约瑟夫·柯金斯基]]正进行早期导演谈判。[[法兰克·马歇尔]]和萨拉·斯科特将担任该项目的制片人。2021年6月，[[海伦·亨特]]表达了开发原片续集的兴趣<ref>{{Cite web|title=Helen Hunt Says Studio Rejected ‘Twister’ Sequel Idea with ‘All Black and Brown Storm Chasers’|url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/general/twister-sequel-helen-hunt-1234644168/|website=IndieWire|date=2021-06-12|language=en-US|last=Lattanzio|first=Ryan|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2024-02-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240212003356/https://www.indiewire.com/features/general/twister-sequel-helen-hunt-1234644168/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。然而，工作室拒绝了亨特的编剧和导演计划，因为在该项续作提案中，亨特在前作饰演的角色乔·哈丁将会在龙卷风的袭击中身亡。<ref>{{Cite web|title=Rejected Twister 2 Story Killed Off Helen Hunt’s Character|url=https://screenrant.com/twister-2-helen-hunt-story-details-character-death/|website=ScreenRant|date=2021-06-14|language=en|last=Bentz|first=Adam|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2021-09-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210910235511/https://screenrant.com/twister-2-helen-hunt-story-details-character-death/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

2022年10月，宣布《龙卷风》的续作正在制作中，剧本将由[[马克·L·史密斯]]编写，马歇尔担任制片。导演方面则包括[[金国威]]、[[伊莉莎白·柴·瓦沙瑞莉]]、[[丹·崔克坦伯格]]和[[崔维斯·奈特]]正在洽谈。有消息称，他们希望亨特能重新扮演他的角色，特别是他和[[比尔·帕克斯顿]]的女儿的角色。电影将融入[[气候变迁]]的情节。史密斯解释道：「这是我们利用的一个元素，也是真实的。我与许多风暴专家、龙卷风专家和风暴追逐者交谈过，甚至亲自体验过。由于气候变化，龙卷风季节变得更加广泛、更加激烈，龙卷风的数量和强度也增加了。因此，我们确实将气候变迁纳入了电影情节，以让观众更加了解气候变迁的原因和影响。」

同年12月，[[郑李烁]]受聘执导。这部独立续集由环球影业、华纳兄弟影业、安布林娱乐公司和肯尼迪/马歇尔公司合资制作，环球影业和华纳兄弟将在不同区域进行发行，前者负责北美，后者负责其他地区。<ref>{{Cite web|title='Twisters' Won't Be Connected to 'Twister,' Despite What 'Twisters' Won't Be Connected to 'Twister,' Despite What You've Heard [Exclusive]'ve Heard|url=https://collider.com/twisters-plot-details/|website=Collider|date=2023-12-15|language=en|last=McPherson|first=Chris|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-12-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231218203949/https://collider.com/twisters-plot-details/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=The Dish: ‘Twisters’ Forecast For Spring Start As Universal, Amblin Finalize Director For Sequel|url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/twisters-sequel-forecast-spring-start-universal-amblin-finalize-director-1235147353/|website=Deadline|date=2022-10-17|language=en-US|last=Jr|first=Mike Fleming|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2022-10-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221017211018/https://deadline.com/2022/10/twisters-sequel-forecast-spring-start-universal-amblin-finalize-director-1235147353/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Lee Isaac Chung in Talks to Direct ‘Twisters’ Sequel|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/lee-isaac-chung-to-direct-twister-sequel-1235282780/|website=The Hollywood Reporter|date=2022-12-15|language=en-US|last=Vlessing|first=Etan|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2022-12-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221215174844/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/lee-isaac-chung-to-direct-twister-sequel-1235282780/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

===选角===
2023年3月，[[黛西·埃德加-琼斯]]加入演员阵容并担任主角<ref>{{Cite web|title=Daisy Edgar-Jones To Star In ‘Twisters’ For Amblin And Universal Pictures|url=https://deadline.com/2023/03/daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-amblin-universal-pictures-1235302694/|website=Deadline|date=2023-03-17|language=en-US|last=Kroll|first=Justin|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-03-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230317175234/https://deadline.com/2023/03/daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-amblin-universal-pictures-1235302694/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。[[葛伦·鲍威尔]]和[[安东尼·拉莫斯]]于次月确定参演<ref>{{Cite web|title=Glen Powell To Star Opposite Daisy Edgar-Jones In ‘Twister’ Sequel For Universal, Amblin Entertainment And Warner Bros.|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/glen-powell-daisy-edgar-jones-twister-universal-1235325117/|website=Deadline|date=2023-04-14|language=en-US|last=Kroll|first=Justin|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-04-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230414004814/https://deadline.com/2023/04/glen-powell-daisy-edgar-jones-twister-universal-1235325117/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Anthony Ramos Joins ‘Twister’ Sequel For Universal, Amblin & Warner Bros|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/anthony-ramos-twister-universal-amblin-warner-bros-1235327592/|website=Deadline|date=2023-04-17|language=en-US|last=Kroll|first=Justin|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-04-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230417170650/https://deadline.com/2023/04/anthony-ramos-twister-universal-amblin-warner-bros-1235327592/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年5月，{{Link-en|布兰登·皮雷亚|Brandon Perea}}、{{Link-en|戴瑞·麦考马克|Daryl McCormack}}、{{Link-en|毛拉·蒂尔尼|Maura Tierney}}等人等宣布加入演员阵容。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jackson |first=Angelique |date=2023-05-12 |title=''Nope'' Star Brandon Perea Joins ''Twisters'' (Exclusive) |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/twister-sequel-brandon-perea-1235610677/ |access-date=2023-05-13 |website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |archive-date=2023-05-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230512192347/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/twister-sequel-brandon-perea-1235610677/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Ramachandran |first=Naman |date=2023-05-17 |title=''Bad Sisters'', ''Leo Grande'' Actor Daryl McCormack to Feature Alongside Daisy Edgar-Jones in ''Twisters'' (Exclusive) |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/daryl-mccormack-daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-1235615849/ |access-date=2023-05-17 |website=[[综艺 (杂志)|Variety]] |archive-date=2023-05-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230517135531/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/daryl-mccormack-daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-1235615849/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |title=''Twisters'': Maura Tierney, Sasha Lane, Kiernan Shipka & David Corenswet Among Final Additions To Lee Isaac Chung's Disaster Pic For Uni, Amblin And Warner Bros |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/twisters-adds-david-corenswet-kiernan-shipka-sasha-lane-maura-tierney-1235370095/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-05-17 |date=2023-05-17 |archive-date=2023-05-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230517164013/https://deadline.com/2023/05/twisters-adds-david-corenswet-kiernan-shipka-sasha-lane-maura-tierney-1235370095/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

===拍摄===
该片的主要拍摄于2023年5月在[[奥克拉荷马市]]周边拍摄。并在{{Link-en|草原冲浪工作室|Prairie_Surf_Studios}}进行40天的拍摄、俄克拉荷马城地铁进行50天的拍摄。其他拍摄地点包括[[奇克谢 (奥克拉荷马州)|奇克谢]]、[[奥卡奇 (奥克拉荷马州)|奥卡奇]]、{{Link-en|艾尔里诺 (奥克拉荷马州)|El_Reno,_Oklahoma|艾尔里诺}}、{{Link-en|史宾塞 (奥克拉荷马州)|Spencer,_Oklahoma|史宾塞}}和{{Link-en|卡西恩 (奥克拉荷马州)|Cashion,_Oklahoma|卡西恩}}。然而，由于{{Link-en|2023年SAG-AFTRA罢工|2023_SAG-AFTRA_strike}}，拍摄工作在7月暂停<ref>{{Cite web|title=All The Movies Affected by the SAG-AFTRA Strike From 'Deadpool 3' to 'Mission: Impossible 8'|url=https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/|website=TheWrap|date=2023-07-14|language=en-US|last=Gonzalez|first=Umberto|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-07-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230714014112/https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。直到罢工于2023年11月结束后，制作才恢复进行，并于随后的月份完成拍摄。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Sperling |first=Nicole |date=2023-11-09 |title=Getting Hollywood Back Up and Running Won't Be Easy |website=[[The New York Times]] |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2023/11/09/business/media/hollywood-schedule-backlog.html |access-date=2024-01-03 |archive-date=2024-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213013716/https://www.nytimes.com/2023/11/09/business/media/hollywood-schedule-backlog.html |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.vogue.com/article/how-glen-powell-charmed-hollywood-interview|title=How Glen Powell Charmed Hollywood|author=Kaplan, Ilana|date=2023-12-22|work=[[Vogue (magazine)|Vogue]]|access-date=2024-01-03|archive-date=2024-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213013927/https://www.vogue.com/article/how-glen-powell-charmed-hollywood-interview|dead-url=no}}</ref>

==上映==
本片2024年7月19日由环球影业安排在美国上映，并由华纳兄弟影业负责全球上映<ref>{{Cite web|title=‘Twisters’ From Director Lee Isaac Chung Gets Universal Release Date|url=https://deadline.com/2022/12/twisters-release-date-set-lee-isaac-chung-directing-universal-sequel-1235203820/|website=Deadline|date=2022-12-20|language=en-US|last=Grobar|first=Matt|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2022-12-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221221050716/https://deadline.com/2022/12/twisters-release-date-set-lee-isaac-chung-directing-universal-sequel-1235203820/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。
== 回响 ==
=== 评价 ===
[[烂番茄]]根据392条评论，本片获得75%的新鲜度，平均得分6.7／10，观众的好评度为83%，平均得分4.2／5，网站共识评论：「《龙卷风暴》的预报换来一场壮观的风暴，同时伴随著葛伦·鲍威尔的魅力旋风，精采绝伦且刺激不断。」<ref>{{Cite Rotten Tomatoes|title=Twisters|id=twisters|type=movie|access-date=2024-07-19}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]上，本片获得65分，代表「正面评价为主」<ref>{{Cite Metacritic|id=twisters/|type=movie|title=Twisters|access-date=2024-07-19}}</ref>。

=== 票房 ===
影片在美国和加拿大获得2.678亿美元，其他地区取得1.03亿美元，全球累计3.71亿美元。

