* {{tsl|en|Sara Serraiocco|萨拉·萨里约科}}

== 制片 == 
[[主体拍摄]]于2023年8月启动<ref name="bio" />，12月杀青<ref name="ansa">{{cite news |last1=Redazione |title=Fine riprese per Vermiglio, la sposa di montagna |url=https://www.ansa.it/amp/trentino/notizie/2023/12/18/fine-riprese-per-vermiglio-la-sposa-di-montagna_1035306a-1446-42cf-9ca4-92f1eb8e17c2.html |access-date=2024-07-24 |work=[[安莎通讯社|ANSA]] |date=2023-12-18 |archive-date=2024-07-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240726154714/https://www.ansa.it/amp/trentino/notizie/2023/12/18/fine-riprese-per-vermiglio-la-sposa-di-montagna_1035306a-1446-42cf-9ca4-92f1eb8e17c2.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影在意大利[[特伦蒂诺-上阿迪杰大区]][[韦尔米廖]]、{{tsl|it|Carciato|卡恰托}}、{{tsl|it|Comasine|考马辛}}等城镇取景<ref>{{Cite web |last=Scarpa |first=Vittorio |date=2023-12-19 |title=Ultimo ciak per Vermiglio, la sposa di montagna di Maura Delpero |url=https://cineuropa.org/it/newsdetail/453863/ |access-date=2024-09-05 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=it |archive-date=2024-09-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240903074435/https://cineuropa.org/it/newsdetail/453863/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影由意大利Cinedora、法国Charades和比利时Versus共同制作<ref>{{Cite web |last=Goodfellow |first=Melanie |date=2024-08-30 |title='Vermiglio' Teaser: Maura Delpero's Charades-Sold Drama Capturing Past Lives In An Italian Mountain Village Is A Venice Golden Lion Contender |url=https://deadline.com/video/vermiglio-teaser-maura-delpero-venice/ |access-date=2024-09-06 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2024-12-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241208135134/https://deadline.com/video/vermiglio-teaser-maura-delpero-venice/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。导演德尔佩罗在父亲去世后萌生了制作本片的想法，希望借此保存伴随父亲成长的文化传统，为此在前期制作阶段采访众多当地人<ref>{{Cite web |last=Finos |first=Arianna |date=2024-09-02 |title="Vermiglio", la regista Maura Delpero: "Partita dal nulla sono arrivata a Venezia e ne sono felice". Tommaso Ragno: "Il lusso del film è prendersi del tempo" |url=https://www.repubblica.it/spettacoli/cinema/2024/09/02/video/vermiglio_la_regista_maura_delpero_partita_dal_nulla_sono_arrivata_a_venezia_e_ne_sono_felice_tommaso_ragno_il_luss-423475021/ |access-date=2024-09-05 |website=[[共和国报 (意大利)|La Repubblica]] |language=it |archive-date=2024-11-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241121222306/https://www.repubblica.it/spettacoli/cinema/2024/09/02/video/vermiglio_la_regista_maura_delpero_partita_dal_nulla_sono_arrivata_a_venezia_e_ne_sono_felice_tommaso_ragno_il_luss-423475021/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Barone |first=Martina |date=2024-09-02 |title=Vermiglio, nella grandezza del suo paesaggio, racconta le piccole tradizioni del passato |url=https://www.gqitalia.it/article/vermiglio-film-recensione-venezia-2024 |access-date=2024-09-05 |website=[[GQ|GQ Italia]] |language=it |archive-date=2024-12-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241225154028/https://www.gqitalia.it/article/vermiglio-film-recensione-venezia-2024 |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 发行== 
电影于2024年9月2日在[[第81届威尼斯影展]]全球首映<ref>{{cite news |last1=Rosser |first1=Michael |last2=Parfitt |first2=Orlando |title=Venice Film Festival reveals 2024 line-up |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/venice-film-festival-reveals-2024-line-up/5195641.article |access-date=2024-07-24 |work=[[国际银幕|Screen International]] |date=2024-07-23 |language=en |archive-date=2024-08-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240803143115/https://www.screendaily.com/news/venice-film-festival-reveals-2024-line-up/5195641.article |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=nos>{{cite news |last1=L.S. |title=Vermiglio al Festival del cinema di Venezia |url=https://www.nosmagazine.it/dettaglio/9791/home/0/vermiglio-al-festival-cinema-venezia.html |access-date=2024-07-24 |work=NOS Magazine |date=2024-07-23 |language=it |archive-date=2024-07-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240726200241/https://www.nosmagazine.it/dettaglio/9791/home/0/vermiglio-al-festival-cinema-venezia.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>，北美首映礼于{{tsl|en|2024 Toronto International Film Festival|2024年多伦多国际电影节}}举行<ref>{{Cite web |title=The TIFF '24 schedule is now live on tiff.net and includes 20 new additions to the slate |url=https://tiff.net/press/news/the-tiff-24-schedule-is-now-live-in-tiff-net-and-includes-19-new-additions-to-the-slate |date=2024-08-13 |access-date=2024-09-24 |website=[[多伦多国际电影节|TIFF]] |language=en |archive-date=2024-09-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240925141328/https://tiff.net/press/news/the-tiff-24-schedule-is-now-live-in-tiff-net-and-includes-19-new-additions-to-the-slate |dead-url=no }}</ref>。此外还入选{{tsl|en|54th International Film Festival Rotterdam|第54届鹿特丹国际电影节}}“聚光灯”（Limelight）单元<ref>{{cite web|url=https://iffr.com/en/iffr/2025/films/vermiglio |title=Limelight: Vermiglio|work=International Film Festival Rotterdam|access-date=2025-01-07}}</ref>。

电影于2024年9月19日在意大利院线上映，由Lucky Red发行<ref>{{cite web |title=Vermiglio, il trailer ufficiale del film [HD] |url=https://www.mymovies.it/film/2024/vermiglio/news/il-trailer-ufficiale-del-film-hd/ |website=MYmovies.it |accessdate=2025-01-07 |language=it |date=2024-09-10 |archive-date=2024-12-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241213052603/https://www.mymovies.it/film/2024/vermiglio/news/il-trailer-ufficiale-del-film-hd/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

