* {{le|欧雯·弗勒|Olwen Fouéré}}<ref name="Screen"/>饰演玛德琳（{{lang|en|Madeline}}）
* {{le|席芳·休雷特|Siobhan Hewlett}}饰演米娜之母
* {{le|约翰·林区 (演员)|John Lynch (actor)|约翰·林区}}饰演基尔马丁（{{lang|en|Kilmartin}}）

== 制作 ==
2023年2月，[[新线影业]]宣布将制作由[[奈·沙马兰]]之女{{le|伊莎娜·奈·沙马兰|Ishana Night Shyamalan}}编导的《窥探者》，成为她的长片编导处女作，此前仅在电视剧《[[灵异女仆]]》（2021年至2023年）从事这两项工作<ref name="Deadline">{{cite news|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-the-watchers-1235259720/|title=Ishana Night Shyamalan Making Feature Directorial Debut With New Line Thriller 'The Watchers'; Summer 2024 Release Set|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2023-02-14|access-date=2023-02-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230214225204/https://deadline.com/2023/02/ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-the-watchers-1235259720/|archive-date=2023-02-14|url-status=live}}</ref>。同年4月，[[达科塔·芬妮]]和[[乔吉娜·坎贝尔]]加入演出阵容<ref name="Deadline1">{{cite news|last=Grobar|first=Matt|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/dakota-fanning-joins-the-watchers-movie-from-ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-1235338481/|title=Dakota Fanning Boards Ishana Night Shyamalan's Supernatural Thriller 'The Watchers' For New Line|work=Deadline Hollywood|date=2023-04-26|access-date=2023-04-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230426224510/https://deadline.com/2023/04/dakota-fanning-joins-the-watchers-movie-from-ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-1235338481/|archive-date=2023-04-26|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|last=Kit|first=Borys|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/barbarian-star-georgina-campbell-the-watchers-1235405748/|title='Barbarian' Breakout Georgina Campbell Joins Dakota Fanning in New Line Supernatural Thriller 'The Watchers' (Exclusive)|work=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]|date=2023-04-28|access-date=2023-04-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230428222619/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/barbarian-star-georgina-campbell-the-watchers-1235405748/|archive-date=2023-04-28|url-status=live}}</ref>。

电影2023年7月在[[都柏林]]、[[威克洛]]和[[高威]]进行[[主要拍摄]]<ref name="Screen"/><ref>{{Cite web |last=Rajput |first=Priyanca |date=2023-09-05 |title=Ishana Shyamalan's debut feature ''The Watchers'' wraps in Dublin |url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/09/05/ishana-shyamalan-debut-feature-watchers-wraps-bray-dublin |access-date=2023-09-06 |website=[[KFTV.com]] |archive-date=2023-09-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230906180537/https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/09/05/ishana-shyamalan-debut-feature-watchers-wraps-bray-dublin |url-status=live}}</ref>。7月中旬，制片方获得了一项临时协议，得以在{{le|2023年美国演员工会-美国电视和广播艺人联合会大罢工|2023 SAG-AFTRA strike}}期间继续拍片<ref name="Screen">{{Cite web |date=2023-07-19 |last=Kay |first=Jeremy |title=Sam Raimi horror, ''The Watchers'' among new indie shoots approved by SAG-AFTRA |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/sam-raimi-horror-the-watchers-among-new-indie-shoots-approved-by-sag-aftra/5184188.article |access-date=2023-08-11 |website=[[国际银幕|Screen Daily]] |archive-date=2023-08-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230810070543/https://www.screendaily.com/news/sam-raimi-horror-the-watchers-among-new-indie-shoots-approved-by-sag-aftra/5184188.article |url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
《窥探者》2024年6月7日由[[华纳兄弟]]在美国发行<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-02-28 |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |title='The Watchers': Ishana Night Shyamalan Horror Movie Moves To Father's Day Weekend |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/the-watchers-release-date-change-1235841486/ |access-date=2024-02-29 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-02-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240229005316/https://deadline.com/2024/02/the-watchers-release-date-change-1235841486/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。此前的美国上映日定为2024年6月14日<ref name="Deadline"/>，台湾则是于2024年6月13日上映院线，并且于2024年8月30日于串流平台HBO GO上架。

