== 发行 ==

=== 评价 ===
电影收获了普遍影评人的好评。根据[[烂蕃茄]]上收集的245篇专业影评文章，其中221篇给出了「新鲜」的正面评价，「新鲜度」为90%，平均得分8.1分（满分10分）<ref name="rt">{{cite web|url= http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/minority_report/|title= Minority Report reviews|publisher= [[Rotten Tomatoes]]|accessdate= June 18, 2012|archive-date= 2011-04-27|archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20110427211232/http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/minority_report/|dead-url= no}}</ref>，且该网站还将其列入2002年最佳电影之一<ref name="best">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/top/bestofrt/?year=2002|title=Best of 2002|publisher=[[Rotten Tomatoes]]|accessdate=June 18, 2012|archive-date=2017-02-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170202080728/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/top/bestofrt/?year=2002|dead-url=no}}</ref>。而基于另一影评网站[[Metacritic]]上的37篇评论文章，其中34篇予以好评，无差评，3篇褒贬不一，平均分为80（满分100）<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=http://www.metacritic.com/movie/minority-report|title=Minority Report entry|publisher=[[Metacritic]]|accessdate=March 14, 2007|archive-date=2020-04-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200410190920/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/minority-report|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

