== 舞台剧版 ==
在2012年期间，英国剧团Whole Hog Theatre策划将《魔法公主》改编为舞台剧于[[伦敦]]的New Diorama剧院上映。其中与宫崎骏有往来关系的英国动画导演[[尼克·帕克]]，协助了Whole Hog Theatre与吉卜力之间的联系。<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.crunchyroll.com/anime-news/2013/04/19-1/studio-ghibli-explained-how-uk-princess-mononoked-stage-play-got-oked |title=Studio Ghibli Explains How UK "Princess Mononoke" Stage Play Got OKed |work=[[Crunchyroll]] |author=Scott Green |language=en |date=2013-04-20 |accessdate=2017-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160402110519/http://www.crunchyroll.com/anime-news/2013/04/19-1/studio-ghibli-explained-how-uk-princess-mononoked-stage-play-got-oked |archive-date=2016-04-02 |dead-url=no }}</ref>

内容是由亚历珊卓·卢特（{{lang|en|Alexandra Rutter}}）女士编导，麦克西米利亚·特洛伊·泰勒（{{lang|en|Maximillian Troy Tyler}}）与梅依·麦克（{{lang|en|Mei Mac}}）分别饰演阿席达卡与小桑。<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.wholehogtheatre.com/princessmononoke.html |title=Princess Mononoke |work=Whole Hog Theatre |language=en |accessdate=2017-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180119032238/http://www.wholehogtheatre.com/princessmononoke.html |archive-date=2018-01-19 |dead-url=no }}</ref>所使用到的场景道具方面，是透过回收资源物件来再利用所打造出。<ref>{{cite web |url=http://screenanarchy.com/2012/11/exclusive-news-on-the-upcoming-stage-adaptation-of-miyazaki-hayaos-anime-classic-princess-mononoke.html |title=EXCLUSIVE: News on the Upcoming Stage Adaptation of Miyazaki Hayao's Anime Classic PRINCESS MONONOKE! |work=Screen Anarchy |author=Hugo Ozman |language=en |date=2012-11-22 |accessdate=2017-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190104131716/https://screenanarchy.com/2012/11/exclusive-news-on-the-upcoming-stage-adaptation-of-miyazaki-hayaos-anime-classic-princess-mononoke.html |archive-date=2019-01-04 |dead-url=no }}</ref>

舞台剧在宣布公演后，有达到3天内门票销售一空的成绩。<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.slashfilm.com/official-stage-adaptation-of-princess-mononoke-coming-to-london-sold-out-almost-a-year-in-advance/ |title=Official Stage Adaptation of ‘Princess Mononoke’ Coming To London; Sold Out Almost A Year In Advance |work=Slash Film |author=Germain Lussier |language=en |date=2012-09-24 |accessdate=2017-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170713025736/http://www.slashfilm.com/official-stage-adaptation-of-princess-mononoke-coming-to-london-sold-out-almost-a-year-in-advance/ |archive-date=2017-07-13 |dead-url=yes }}</ref>首次上演是在2013年4月初，<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.escapistmagazine.com/news/view/118581-Princess-Mononoke-Comes-to-London-Stage |title=Princess Mononoke Comes to London Stage |work=The Escapist |author=Adam Gauntlett |language=en |date=2012-07-19 |accessdate=2017-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180825075423/http://www.escapistmagazine.com/news/view/118581-Princess-Mononoke-Comes-to-London-Stage |archive-date=2018-08-25 |dead-url=yes }}</ref>之后于2013年4月底至5月初前往日本东京的AiiA 2.5剧院进行海外表演，<ref name="Animenewsnetwork20130305">{{cite web |url=http://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2013-03-05/princess-mononoke-stage-play-heads-to-japan |title=Princess Mononoke Stage Play Heads to Japan |work=Anime News Network |language=en |date=2013-03-05 |accessdate=2017-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170928123222/http://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2013-03-05/princess-mononoke-stage-play-heads-to-japan |archive-date=2017-09-28 |dead-url=no }}</ref>并有在5月期间透过影片分享网站[[niconico动画]]进行线上播放。<ref>{{cite web |url=https://animeanime.jp/article/2013/05/04/13925.html |script-title=ja:舞台「Princess MONONOKE～もののけ姫～」 千秋楽がニコニコ生放送に |work=Anime Anime |language=ja |date=2013-05-04 |accessdate=2017-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20181020112715/https://animeanime.jp/article/2013/05/04/13925.html |archive-date=2018-10-20 |dead-url=no }}</ref>在宣布从日本返回英国后要于6月进行国内第二次公演时的消息时，则超越前次在4个半小时内售完门票。<ref name="Animenewsnetwork20130305"/>

